<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="toc3">Isa.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isaiah Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="mt">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Isaiah Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Isaiah au Judah Gwangpeidung Uzziah, Jotham, Ahaz nah Hezekiah hegwang ketei dau Caiha rang. Kecingsam rangkela Isaiah de 680 BC bekum kenlien Hezekiah napei Manasseh tingdau daptset di.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isaiah au Jerusalem nah Judah de penui kenlien ziemne mmau laibam lie eh mrairang nswa dai bamdi. Pa pe sam 39 ga pa Babylonia bang tei kera ranggai. Dede pa hegwangram teucuh dailu kera keregui de ranggai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pe sam 40 gade mdeu eh Isaiah au Tinggwang dade sampetdung lungciep aidungde kaibeu: 1. Babylon baangmedung de Jerusalem ga peu cailigwang lu kera; 2. Marang eh reigai beu kera kila ge kelikelu teugwang beu kera; 3. Tinggwang hegwangram keheci keyi ge teucuh beu kera.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Tutiak nah teucuh dai kelu (7:1-12:6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Assyriame de Tinggwang da keregui (7:1-12:6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Heleuhdung ha caihadung (13:1-23:18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel tutiak nah kelilu kera (24:1-27:13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mraisamdung nah Zion teucuh kelu (28:1-35:10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Hegwangpei Hezekiah dade ngkieng kelu (36:1-39:8)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tinggwang lungmpet beu kera sampet kebeu (40:1-56:8)</para>
  <para style="io1">Hegwangram kekambe tei kelu (56:9-66:24)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ISA 1" />
  <para style="s">Heleuh Kecamlai ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 1:1" />Amoz napei Isaiah marengei kengau, Judah nah Jerusalem ziemne, Uzziah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Uzziah: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aipau hegwangpei de Azariah de qula: 2 Heg 14:21</char></note>, Jotham, Ahaz, nah Hezekiah hegwang ketei tingdau, Judah gwangmedung.<verse eid="ISA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 1:2" />Kingneilu, tinggimdung, nah kingnei gailo, kideubo; kedanemene RAMPAUBE rangzeu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:2">“Ih henamedung pok tei eh teucuh lu, dede penui acu renia dida.<verse eid="ISA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 1:3" />Hetumseu pempaube de cila, nah gada de pecu kemruime pepok kaibeu kela kwak de cila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:3">dede Israelme au cimeda, a minadung au cet ci meda.”<verse eid="ISA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 1:4" />Co! Heleuhbo, kemaumedung, kesia ketei gade kaukedi minadung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">kenlien ta ketei namedung, petautei mene matei kela napeimedung!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Penui RAMPAUBE de gidi da, penui Israel Kemcibe de mlai dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">penuikatei pe dade nreu tet dida.<verse eid="ISA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 1:5" />Daitei nnuide peu dap bam reu no? Daitei nnui renia reureu la no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:5">N peu mateei bam dida, n mlung pelane mnei dida.<verse eid="ISA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 1:6" />N pideu gade n peu kecang rezam kemak sau gede gah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">rejam jamdung rünne, nah majamdung, nah majam keheci;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">cidungde hejai kaam dima, teimci ma, kang dema mede lamlui eh maca de keniak gai ma.<verse eid="ISA 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 1:7" />Nnui deudi au mta mrwa dida; nnui namdidung au ru dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:7">nnui luhdung, nnui dwade, sangmedung ne cidungde ngkap dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:7">sangme dungne gwadi, ngkap mcidi eh peu tetdi.<verse eid="ISA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 1:8" />Kubeluh ga ha ki ge nzwa Zion napui de gigai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:8">tanggainedung gurie ga kensiu bam ge nzwa, tui kera twagwapung kebam namdi nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 1:9" />Magade reugwame reu RAMPAUBE bangkebeume de anui dage kaibeu meliecai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:9">anuide Sodom nah Gomorrah nzwa tei ngkap dizie.<verse eid="ISA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 1:10" />RAMPAUBE sam kingnei lulo, nnui Sodom ga kedimedung;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:10">anui Tinggwang zai de kingnei lulo, nnui Gomorrah minadung:<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken. 13:13, Eze. 16:49</char></note><verse eid="ISA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 1:11" />“N reca kekiee ge a dage tei kegai de dai no?” RAMPAUBE rang la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">“Meurünseu keru ratakdung, nah makaune pelui keyi be ca ada kiee nzu bam dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">nah hetumseu jai, meurünnadung jai, mede hemeu jai Ih a sui meda.<verse eid="ISA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 1:12" />Nnui a dwaga kegwang dau,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:12">cau nnui dade aide teumai sia lie beu no, a kigu ga tet kera?<verse eid="ISA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 1:13" />Pekie kegah recadung teugwang sita di lu; kehengui ru kegai de au Ih ngkau dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:13">nnui gu hekei keheci nah Sabbath ngkwadung, kenlien ngkwadung aidungde Ih liasi gai lakta.<verse eid="ISA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 1:14" />Nnui keici ngyidung nah nnui gu keda ngyidung Ih ngkau dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:14">cidungde a pwet kerüt ge lie; Ih cidungde tei mzai leu dida.<verse eid="ISA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 1:15" />Cine nnui ba hwa mpet eh kekie tei kegaidau, Ih nnui dade a miak pung mbai dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:15">nnui kekiedung tei kieesüt gai liede, Ih au kingnei lak;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:15">nnui badung au hejai le pui lalu.<verse eid="ISA 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 1:16" />Hui dilu, nnuikatei nnuide teimci dilu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:16">nnui bata kesiadung a miakngau dwa gade keudi lu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:16">kesia tei mtak dilu;<verse eid="ISA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 1:17" />keyi tei kera heteu lu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:17">kemzuibe peeilu, mine mneu kelame de lungmpet beulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:17">pe pei kegahme kemzuibe peulu, hemipui ma pielu.”<verse eid="ISA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 1:18" />“Cu gwanglu, nah anui ngngwa mpau ncidi go,” RAMPAUBE rang la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">“Nnui maudung gierei kecu nzwa bam liede, cidungde ha pwa buising nzwa dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">penui giebei bam liede, penui au mamai nzwa dizie.<verse eid="ISA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 1:19" />Magade nnui neungga eh samzai teilucai, nnui kideu gu ma keyibe tyei zie,<verse eid="ISA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 1:20" />dede magade nnui mlai nah renia cai, kiengtie le nnuide ngkap dizie,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:20">RAMPAUBE mui gade cide rang pet kedi ziemne.<verse eid="ISA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 1:21" />Dainzwa makesang namdibe gwang helipui ge di no!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:21">Pa au makesang le pui, pa au kemzuibe le puipung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:21">dede pa cu au dapketset medung le puipung dida.<verse eid="ISA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 1:22" />Nnui gu rangkanggeu nci ta dida, nnui zau au dui ncüt dida,<verse eid="ISA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 1:23" />Nnui hegwangnadung mide renia nah keregame zangna tei dida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">Mileunede hetau henim pesui dida, nah ziehi kepeu cai pakla dida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">Penui pepei kegahme de gumbeu lama, mede hemipuidung penui dwa kegwang dau penui lam sap beu lama.<verse eid="ISA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 1:24" />Cine aide reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ne ndugai, Israel Ngkingtube:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:24">“Penui da lungrei! Acu kereniamedung de Ih hekum peei zie, nah a ngauraume de akatei ne mmau eh tei keherei zie.<verse eid="ISA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 1:25" />Ih a ba nreu pwa nnuide mmau zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:25">lye nzwa nnui keheradung de tei mci dizie, nah nnui kehera pelane keugi dizie.<verse eid="ISA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 1:26" />Kerai dau nzwa n tutiakme de Ih kai dai beuzie, nah raitu dau nzwa ncu saukeliame de;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:26">cipaucai ncu petauketei namdi lie qu zie, makesang nam ge lie.”<verse eid="ISA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 1:27" />Kemzuibe gade Zion de rilu zie, nah masang gade pelung nreu kelume de.<verse eid="ISA 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 1:28" />Reniakelame nah kemaumedung de tei kecai ncüt dizie, nah RAMPAUBE de püt kedime de tei ngkap dizie.<verse eid="ISA 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 1:29" />“Nnui renet mhu tsingbangdung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Renet mhu tsingbangdung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">reca kela tsingbang</char></note> de luu neu kedi ziemne nnui ngngam zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:29">nah nnui heguriedung de kedet kelune nnui ngngai dizie.<verse eid="ISA 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 1:30" />Nnui mhu nei regui kedibe nzwa dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:30">nah hegurie ga dui kegah ge nzwa dizie.<verse eid="ISA 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 1:31" />Kengkiengme ge tsingtie keceu nage nzwa di, nah pe bata de mici nage nzwa dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:31">penai kenana de ru ncüt dizie, nah migede penaide peu gailak.”<verse eid="ISA 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ISA 2" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube gu Lamlwatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 2:1" />Amoz napei Isaiah Judah nah Jerusalem ha marengei gade kengau de.<verse eid="ISA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 2:2" />Tingbaziedung kekam lebie ainzwa dizie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">RAMPAUBE ki kebam lamlwa de</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">lamlwatudung hutube tei zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">nah cide kideutudung peureu zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">nah heleuhdung pelane cikage lwa gaizie.<verse eid="ISA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 2:3" />Mina kekiee ge gwang eh hangge gede rangzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">“Gwanglu, RAMPAUBE lamlwa ga nghang golie, Jacob Tinggwang ki ga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">iciu eh pe lampuidung anuide ledeu beulu kerane, nah anui pe lampui ga tetlu kerane.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Kedanemene hezaibe Zion gade pet zie, nah RAMPAUBE sambe Jerusalem gade pet zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:20-23">Zec. 8:20-23</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 2:4" />Pa heleuhdung kakga hetu tiak zie nah mina kekiee ge ziemne ma cet riem beuzie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">penui kingtiedung pwa kepu hepei reki luzie, nah penui ngeidung pwa tangkanedung tei luzie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">heleuh ge heleuh keda ge de mmau eh kiengtie keu cuh lak, mede penui hereu teikera ziemne keteu silak da.<verse eid="ISA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 2:5" />Jacob kilungme, gwanglu, nah RAMPAUBE kebaa ga anui tet lugo.<verse eid="ISA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 2:6" />Nang n minadung de püt kedi ziemne, Jacob kilungme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:6">kedanemene penui tingnaimiak kepetle de paupai zai kepui tei kedine nah penui Philistinme nzwa reka zai reli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:6">nah penui sangme napeidung de ngngwa bateu.<verse eid="ISA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 2:7" />Israel deudi au rangkanggeu nah kecak le pui bam, nah cika penui mahei penli gah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:7">penui kideu de hekwendung le pui, mede cika penui bagidung au penli gah.<verse eid="ISA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 2:8" />Dede penui kideu ga kerecamiedung le pui;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:8">penuikatei penui badung le tei kelu mamie, penui katei zurangdung le teikeludung de reca la.<verse eid="ISA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 2:9" />Minadung keumie zie, nah mina hangge ge kecu kau dizie; ciziemne RAMPAUBE penui mau gibeu ma.<verse eid="ISA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 2:10" />Tsupop bamdung ga miecu nah hangdeu kangga mbailu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:10">RAMPAUBE rata gade nah pekedi kendu gade mbailu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 6:15, Isa. 15-16, Luk. 23:30</char></note><verse eid="ISA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 2:11" />Mina ngangpie kelame de teu henah dizie, nah hegie kelame de teu ngkei dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:11">nah cipau tutiak benai RAMPAUBE de rünne twa dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:9">2 The. 1:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 2:12" />Kedanemene reugwame reu RAMPAUBE tingba ge bam zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:12">cidau hegie nah ngang cu kela leune de mmau dizie, nah ngangdang kela leune de mmau dizie, nah pecu teu nghung dizie,<verse eid="ISA 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 2:13" />nah Lebanon ga Cedar bangdung tie nah cehu kebamdung pelane de mmau zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:13">nah Bashan ga mhu bangdung pelane de mmau zie.<verse eid="ISA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 2:14" />Cipau reugwame reu RAMPAUBE gu tingba de lamlwatu kehudung pelane de mmau zie, nah hangdeutu cehu kebam pelane de mmau zie,<verse eid="ISA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 2:15" />nah reketbam kehu leude mmau zie, nah ntipbing kebam herie leude mmau zie,<verse eid="ISA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 2:16" />Tarshish ga liemdung pelane de mmau zie, nah hezu keyi liemdung pelane de mmau dizie.<verse eid="ISA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 2:17" />Hegie kelame de teu henah mie dizie, nah ngangdang kelame kau dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:17">cipau nai RAMPAUBE de rünne twa dizie.<verse eid="ISA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 2:18" />Mamiedung gahzing dizie.<verse eid="ISA 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 2:19" />Minadung tsupopdung tangtsu koiki ga nah kideu tsupopdung ga mie zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:19">RAMPAUBE rata gade, nah pekedi kendu gade, pa kideube de teikeheu cu kegai dau.<verse eid="ISA 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 2:20" />Cipau nai minadung rangkanggeu nah kecak le tei kelu mamiedung kelien gi dizie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:20">reca kerane penuikatei penui ziemne tei kelu, penui cidung kelien gi pwa takleidung nah takladung dage kai dizie.<verse eid="ISA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 2:21" />Minadung hetiadung ga nah tsupop koikidung ga mie zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:21">RAMPAUBE rata gade nah pekedi kendu gade, pa kideube de tei keheu cu kegai dau.<verse eid="ISA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 2:22" />Minadung de nlum ta dilu, pe ngkie koiki ga pe teilungh ngngi de bam kelabe de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:22">penui keyi dai bam no?<verse eid="ISA 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ISA 3" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem nah Judah Tutiak</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 3:1" />Pielo, Rampaube reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Jerusalem nah Judah gade maleune keuteu di lau da</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:1">kengha nah taktyei: tangku peu kela pelane nah dui peu kela pelane,<verse eid="ISA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 3:2" />mina kengkiengme nah reugwame, tutiakme nah caihakecime, reka zaiteu kelame nah kecingme,<verse eid="ISA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 3:3" />riakngei reu kedibe nah hetwakepung minadung, puisau keteime, bata teicitume nah ma rang kecime.<verse eid="ISA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 3:4" />“Ih rehang ngkieng kemak gede kaipwa penui muiteudung tei zie, nah kehename ne penui peureu kedi tei zie.<verse eid="ISA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 3:5" />Minadung de teikeherei süt zie, hangge ge ne keda gede, nah hangge ge ne pe kidabe de;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:5">hename kecingme de rangmsia zie, nah kemta kaudung hetwa kepungme de keneu kie zie.<verse eid="ISA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 3:6" />Mige pe pei ki gade pe sinabe de kecang de tui luzie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:6">‘Nang au ba nni kera bam; anui muiteube teilu, aipau kengkap de peu n ba gade lulo,’ de rang zie.<verse eid="ISA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 3:7" />Cipau nai pa sah eh rang zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:7">‘Ih tei kengkeibe gailak; Ih tangku mede paiheni de gah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:7">Nnui acu peu minadung reu kedi tei gailak.’”<verse eid="ISA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 3:8" />Jerusalem de ngkap dida, nah Judah kaumie dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:8">kedanemene penai marang gade nah penai batadung gade RAMPAUBE de renia kedine, pe keyi kendu de mlai eh.<verse eid="ISA 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 3:9" />Penui zu gade ngau kegai penuide kemmau keulia la; nah penui Sodom nzwa penui kemau rang; penui cide kebai ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:9">Penui da lungrei! Kedanemene penui katei penuide ngkap cangsiak di delu.<verse eid="ISA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 3:10" />Kesamsangme dage rangbeulo cide au yiki lie kecu, kedanemene penui tateidung tsi tyei zielu.<verse eid="ISA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 3:11" />Co kenlienme! Cide pe ziemne siasüt gwang zie, kedanemene pe badung le mide tei keherei kegaide pe dage teigai zie kecune.<verse eid="ISA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 3:12" />A minadung, penuide mneu kelame au henamedung ne, nah mipuidung ne penui reu di dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:12">A minadung nnui muiteume nnuide saulia maula nah nnui lampui tei kebwak dila.<verse eid="ISA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 3:13" />RAMPAUBE kesia tah de mmau kera ziemne sap lie; pa au kesiaketeime de mmau kera sap bam.<verse eid="ISA 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 3:14" />RAMPAUBE pe mina hangkiamedung de nah muiteumedung de tutiak kemmau ga nzang gwang zeu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:14">“Nnui kubeluh ngkap dida; kegahme dade süt kelu le nnui ki kaipui luda.<verse eid="ISA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 3:15" />Daitei nnui a minadung de tei kecai nah kegahme de rüttakcai lano?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:15">Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang aide ndugai.<verse eid="ISA 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 3:16" />RAMPAUBE rangla, kedanemene Zion mepuidung ngang kecune,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">penui ngwang tei mtie lwe tetla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">kemla miakpiedung teu, penui pikiet keceu gade tetla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">penui pikidung ga tangsuinedung kehio kwa teila.<verse eid="ISA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 3:17" />Cine Rampaube Zion napuidung peudung gage kemcak jam tei gaizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:17">nah RAMPAUBE cidungde tei kwak dizie.<verse eid="ISA 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 3:18" />Cipaunai Rampaube penui dade hezukeyidung keugi dizie hetageu pikap, peukang riadung, hekei mie kenzwabe heteidung,<verse eid="ISA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 3:19" />pekwen mlidung, hetadung, nah hezu kegumpai;<verse eid="ISA 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 3:20" />peuzui pai, pikap geudung, kiakangdung nah perim kehengui bungdung, nah kehemeudung.<verse eid="ISA 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 3:21" />Pa bakapdung nah mingkie geudung keugi dizie;<verse eid="ISA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 3:22" />hengyi paidung, mcwadung, hezu kegumpai, lokodung;<verse eid="ISA 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 3:23" />heba miakpiebungdung, langcimpai keyibe, peuzuidung, nah kehezudung.<verse eid="ISA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 3:24" />Perim keyi kehengui nding gade cika perim siatube zie; nah kiakangge nding gade, heria ge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:24">pe peutam lamlui hemi pwa bam kera nding gade, pe peukwak dizie; nah kedi paini nding gade, roso paige le kezui;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:24">hezukeyi nding ga de hengam bam zie.<verse eid="ISA 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 3:25" />Nnui mipeidung kingtie dade kaumie dizie, nah nnui mipei kengking medung hereu gade kaumie dizie.<verse eid="ISA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 3:26" />Jerusalem kiriedung suisiet kwa nah hei eh hap zie, nah pa pekatei rünne di eh kideureu ga ntumbam dizie.<verse eid="ISA 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ISA 4" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 4:1" />Cipau nai mipui hanghena ne mipei hangge de tui lu eh rang zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:1">“Anui katei anui taktyei tyei zie, anui katei anui gu paini teu zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:1">Dede anui ngngam keugi di kerane peu anuide nzi teu lo.”<verse eid="ISA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rampaube Kiak</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 4:2" />Cipau nai RAMPAUBE kiak hezuyi nah kendu ge zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:2">nah kideu tsibe nggum zie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:2">nah Israel ga ringkebammedung ziemne penui sui yisüt zie.<verse eid="ISA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 4:3" />Zion gage püt kai kedime cide teipet dizie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:3">nah Jerusalem ga bang kedime de kemcime lie quzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:3">mikeheibe de Jerusalem ga lunghbam lie eh pezi rau kelume.<verse eid="ISA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 4:4" />Rampaube Zion napuidung kehera hui nggah kedidau aide tei pet dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:4">nah Jerusalem kakga hejai lwa kedidung de tei mci dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:4">rabe tutiak gade nah rabe miheu gade.<verse eid="ISA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 4:5" />Iciu eh Zion kideutu pelane reu nah pe ngkwa heni reu gage,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:5">RAMPAUBE hemwa nah mika tingna teigai zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:5">nah tingmui cai miheu gi kembaa ge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:5">kendu pelane pereu gum beuzie kecune.<verse eid="ISA 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 4:6" />Cide tingna kelum gade nsiu lu kera ziemne pesung ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:6">nah tingkai nah tingrui gade kwak nah gum luzie.<verse eid="ISA 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ISA 5" />
  <para style="s">Kubeluh Lei</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 5:1" />A kube ziemne peu acu lei teilo, a kube gu pe kubeluh ha lei ge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:1">A kube kideutu malung yisüt kecu ga kubeluh ge bamla.<verse eid="ISA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 5:2" />Pa cide pulu, tangtsudung pwa gidi, nah kubebang leuh yitube linglu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Pa luh sum gage reketbam ge kwa cuhlu, nah kubetsi tui kera bam ge tei silu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Pa kubetsi bui beu kera kwabam, dede cide renaam gu rünne petsi buidi.<verse eid="ISA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 5:3" />Cine cu, Jerusalem ga kelunghme nah Judah minadung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:3">acu nah agu kubeluh kakga mcet gailo.<verse eid="ISA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 5:4" />Agu kubeluh ziemne Ih tei kemakbe daipai teisi lu kera bam reuno?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:4">Ih kubetsi cide bui beu kera pie kebam dau, daitei cide renaam kubetsidung bui dino?<verse eid="ISA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 5:5" />Cu Ih n dage ranglia zie Ih daipai a kubetsi luh dage teigai zie bi: Ih hetu ziu keugi dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">Ih cide tsehei ziu gage tei dizie, Ih perie teipang mie dizie, nah cide cai kedim dizie.<verse eid="ISA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 5:6" />Ih heira cika ge ling gaizie, nah cide peu bui mede puh de lak. Meliene, hetupui nah hetudung le gum ham dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:6">Ih hemwadung dage aja kai eh peu cika ge tingrui gaita dizie.<verse eid="ISA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 5:7" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE kubeluh au Israel kilungme de kecu ziemne</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">nah Judah minadung au pebang ling kelu pesuikeyi ge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">pa kesangbe de kwa, dede cika kedaptset bamdi; kesamsang de kwa, dede, kengha ziemne sah di.<verse eid="ISA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kehing nah tutiak</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 5:8" />Ainie, kige gade kige, luh ge gade luh ge tamtok kelame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:8">kibung bamsi tadi kemaktane, nah nnui rünne kideu ga bang nzeudi kemaktane!<verse eid="ISA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 5:9" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE a dage rang eh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:9">ki kekieege mrwa dizie, kikedi nah hezukeyidung kecangde, kelunghme gede gah dizie.<verse eid="ISA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 5:10" />Kubeluh ngwanggai kerei gade bath ket<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bath ket: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">litre 22.</char></note> rünne tei luzie, nah homer tsileuh ket gade ephah ket<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ephah ket: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilogram 16 </char></note> rünne tei luzie.<verse eid="ISA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 5:11" />Co tingcang nuge culwe zau kengking sak ndeu kelamedung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:11">nah tingmui zaune penuide tei nsia cang siakdi kemaktane bam tie kelamedung.<verse eid="ISA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 5:12" />Penui taktyei ngyi ga harp, lute, tambourine, terwaine nah zau teu la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:12">dede penui RAMPAUBE bata cila ma, mede penui pe batadung pie swa la ma.<verse eid="ISA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 5:13" />Ciziemne a minadung kecikecet kegah ziemne mibaang tei tetdi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:13">penui kenlang muiteume nzeu ladi, nah penui minadung sak kera magede gah.<verse eid="ISA 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 5:14" />Ciziemne Sheol<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sheol: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ketsaime deu</char></note> pe taktyei tei mzaha lu nah pemui ngnga mdi süt luda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:14">penui yitume, mina maadibe, penui muiteume nah pesui kerengame nah penui kakga pe suiyi kebammedung Sheol ga nghung dizie.<verse eid="ISA 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 5:15" />Mina telailai peu keukei mie zie, nah mina leune de henah miezie; kengang miakpieme de kelien mie dizie.<verse eid="ISA 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 5:16" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE pekesang gade hetwapung zie nah Tinggwang kemcibe pe masang gade pekatei kemci mide liazie.<verse eid="ISA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 5:17" />Iciu eh meuründung penui katei penui gu cehei nzwa tyei zie, nah namdi kau kedidung ga, meurünnadung sangme nzwa cehei peeityei zie.<verse eid="ISA 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 5:18" />Co kemta riadung pwa kemau teugai kela medung nah cide bagi ria kenzwa pwa kemau teu pung kelame.<verse eid="ISA 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 5:19" />Co ainzwa rang kelame, “Peu Tinggwang de kelwalu, peu pecu bata tei mzet lu, ciciu eh cide tei kecu anui ngaulu bui;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:19">nah peu Israel Kemcibe lungcet de gwanglo, ciciu de anui cidungde cilu zielu.”<verse eid="ISA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 5:20" />Co kesiabe de yilie kelame, keyibe de kesiabe lie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">kemuibe de kebaabe mding nzwa kelame, nah kebaabe de kemuibe nzwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">kekaa de kekum mding nzwa, nah kekum de kekaa nzwa!<verse eid="ISA 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 5:21" />Co pekatei pe miakngau gade maci lie kelame, nah pekatei pe bata kecet de mriak lie kela!<verse eid="ISA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 5:22" />Co zau kesak gade kenlangmedung, nah zau kengking hai ncüt citumedung;<verse eid="ISA 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 5:23" />hetauhenim kepeu ziemne kenlienme de mmaula kemakme, nah kemzuime de penui mzeudung peu ngaula kemakme!<verse eid="ISA 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 5:24" />Ciziemne mi mleu au mile reigau ru nggah dila kecu nzwa, nah cehei ki kedibe miheu ga gwang di kela nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">ciciu eh penui mahdung tim dizie, nah penui padung rebui nzwa guipung tet dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">Kedanemene ainzwa pet kedi penui reugwame reu RAMPAUBE zai mlai kedine, nah kedanemene penui Israel Kemcibe samde ngkau kedine.<verse eid="ISA 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 5:25" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE rata minadung de mmau eh heucuh di. Pa peba hetwa mpet penuide mmau nah penuide saja peu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Lamlwatudung mlaidi, nah penui ketsaipaaudung puidikidung ga kehera nzwa zeudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Ma aidung pelane gade, pe rata au penli dima, meliene, peba au cude hwa mpet pwa bam.<verse eid="ISA 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 5:26" />Pa heleuhdung kemdeime ziemne pailim pwacuh lia gai nah kideu penli ga kebamme ziemne makwa nza gai zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:26">Pielo, penui mzet süt eh nah kelwa gwanglu zie.<verse eid="ISA 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 5:27" />Penui kakgade migede leudi mede kau dima; mige de ziangmui mede zipma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:27">Mede penui kiakangdung de mza dima, mede penui picum riadung de cakdi ma.<verse eid="ISA 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 5:28" />Penui lakpitsidung au nzau nah penui lakpidung au teugung luda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:28">penui kwendung nginglwakdung au tangtsu nzwa, nah penui bagidung pita au kaiguidung nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 5:29" />Penui mra hingho ge nzwa zie, penui hinghonadung nzwa mra zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:29">Penui mrung nah pecit gade tuilu eh teu tet di, mige de keli gai lak di.<verse eid="ISA 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 5:30" />Cipau tingba benai jaaidi kwa keci nzwa giteu kedime de mmau eh mra zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:30">Magade keheibede kideureu pie gai cai, pa kemui nah lungrei ngau zie; hemwadung ne kebaa de teimui dizie.<verse eid="ISA 5:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ISA 6" />
  <para style="s">Isaiah de Kengkieng Kepeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 6:1" />Judah deuceu ga hegwangpei Uzziah tsai kedi bekum, Ih RAMPAUBE hegwangbam ga kebam ngau; pa au cehu nah hutu ga bam, nah pe cwatie le kerecaki puih bam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 4:2,6, Matt. 25:3, Keu. 7:10</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 6:2" />Pereu ga seraphim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Seraphim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pe hesiu kepung kaune</char></note> bam; hangge pe hesiu herok ramcau pung eh; hesiu kenale pezu gum, nah hesiu kenale pepi gum, nah hesiu kenale pa lim. <verse eid="ISA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 6:3" />Penui hangge ge de qu eh ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:3">“Mci, mci, mci, reugwame reu RAMPAUBE au! Kideu pelane pe kendu le pui.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 4:8, 15:8</char></note><verse eid="ISA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 6:4" />Hap kebamme kwadung dene kikam sing dung teukelai di, nah ki be mika le puidi.<verse eid="ISA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 6:5" />Pecai Ih mragai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:5">“Co! Ih kap dida kedanemene Ih a muileu gade mci kemak kerang kau ge kecu ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:5">nah mina mci kemak sam kerangme kakga Ih kelungh ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:5">kedanemene Ih a miak le Hegwangpei de ngau kelune, Rampaube, reugwame reu RAMPAUBE!”<verse eid="ISA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 6:6" />Pecai seraphim ket a da lim hung, pa pe ba ga miceu heukebam ge la, cide pa tuusiep le recabam gade keu kelu. <verse eid="ISA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 6:7" />Cide le pa a mui tunggai nah rang eh cu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:7">“Pielo, aide n muileukung tung gai da; n mau keu gi dida, nah n mau gibeu dida”.<verse eid="ISA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 6:8" />Ih RAMPAUBE ma kerang kwa siu, “Ih caude langgai lai; caune anui ziemne tetlai?” Pecai Ih keligai, “Ih aika bam; acu langgai”.<verse eid="ISA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 6:9" />Pa ranggai, “Mina aidungde da mie nah rangbeu lo, ‘Kingneilu, dede cilu so; pielu, dede made keteu so.’<verse eid="ISA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 6:10" />Pecai pa ada ge rangbeu, “Mina aidungde mlung teimang dilu, nah penui kwen tei pang, nah penui miak teicit dilu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">Iciumeliecai penui miakle ngau dilu bui, penui kwen le siu, nah penui mlung le ci, nah penui nreu gwang nah yi dizie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 13:15, Jhn. 12:40, Bat. 28:26-27, Rom. 11:8</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 6:11" />Pecai Ih keteu, “Rampaubo, daitie ge lai?” Pa keli eh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">“Namdidung kaumie sia cangsiak nah mina lung ta di kemaktane zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">nah kidung ga mina lungh lak, nah hangdeube de peu mta mrwa di kemakta,<verse eid="ISA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 6:12" />nah RAMPAUBE minadung de lang mdei gi di kemakta, nah hangdeu kedi nlikwak eh gi dizie.<verse eid="ISA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 6:13" />Magade mina hang kerei gade zi ge cika bam liede, aide de ngkap dai dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:13">terebinth bang mede mhu bang bi kedi nzwa nah tsingmui bang bam kela nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:13">kemci leuh au tsingmui ga bam.”<verse eid="ISA 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7" />
  <para style="s">Immanuel Rehi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 7:1" />Judah Gwangpei, Ahaz Jotham napei Uzziah capei, Rezin Aram gwangpei, nah Pekah Remaliah napei, Israel gwangpei, tingdau Jerusalem ga hereu tei kera hang, dede penui ngkinglu tadi. <verse eid="ISA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 7:2" />David<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">David: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hegwangpei Ahaz</char></note> kilungme da Aramme Ephraimme de ngngwa zangna tei kelu ci gwang kedi dau. Pe mlung nah pe minadung mlung mbeudi, tsingbang hegung ga tingkai gui kegai dau mlai kela nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 7:3" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Isaiah dage ranggai, “N napei Shear-Jashud de ngngwa lwe tet pet gai cu Ahaz de redau kerane rejaai nreube gade dui teugwang kebam helau tün ga, pai kehetame luh lampui ga de dau lu bui. <verse eid="ISA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 7:4" />Ahaz de rangbeu lu, ‘Mriaklu, sünne eh zing de bamlu, ngngi diso mede helung keherei diso tsingtie ai kena de heu mene mika kebam ziemne, Rezin nah Aram, nah Remaliah napei Pekah rata teu keheu kegai ziemne. <verse eid="ISA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 7:5" />Aram, Ephraim, nah Remaliah napei. Penui heciem kesia ge ncu mmau kera riemlu de lie penui ranggai; <verse eid="ISA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 7:6" />“Anui Judah gwa go nah pecu keheu go, nah anui pecu teipangpop ti go nah cikage Tabeel napei de anui gwangpei peu teilu kera.”<verse eid="ISA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 7:7" />Dede RAMPAUBE Tinggwang Ahaz dage rangzeu, “Cide teigwang lak; cide tei gailak,<verse eid="ISA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 7:8" />kedanemene Aram reu kedibe au Damascus, nah Damascus peu reu kedibe au Rezin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:8">Mmi riakherokemengei tingkak gage, Ephraim de tei pang takcai dizie nah mina teidau lak dizie.<verse eid="ISA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 7:9" />Ephraim peureu kedibe au Samaria, nah Samaria peureu kedibe au Remaliah napei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:9">Magade nang kenlum ntiplu mai, nang mateitei de kwak bam gailak.”<verse eid="ISA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 7:10" />Rampaube Ahaz de resiu dai, <verse eid="ISA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 7:11" />“N Tinggwang RAMPAUBE gu marehi ge kielu; ma kecok gage mede ma kecehu gage kie gailu.” <verse eid="ISA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 7:12" />Dede Ahaz rangdi, “Ih kie lak, mede Ih RAMPAUBE de kedei lak”. <verse eid="ISA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 7:13" />Cine Isaiah keligai, “Kingnei lu, David leuhme. Nnui mina liakebamme de kedei kera mnung cang mereu ni? Nnui a Tinggwang lia kebamde de kedei zie ni? <verse eid="ISA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14" />Ciziemne Rampaube ne marehi ge nnuide peu zie: Pielu, releipui ge telak luzie, mipeina ge nna luzie, nah pezi Immanuel lie qu zie. <verse eid="ISA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 7:15" />Pa tungdui mnwa nah heliadui tyei zie ngking cuh kesia be ci eh mlai dilu kebui nah keyibe luu lu kebui ting di de. <verse eid="ISA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 7:16" />Kedanemene hena nabe kesiabe mlai nah keyibe luulu kebui ci kemak dwa, hegwang kena nang hing kela deu de tei mta dizie. <verse eid="ISA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 7:17" />RAMPAUBE teu gwang beuzie n dage, n minadung dage, nah n pei ki kelak dage ndaa nzwa kette mene Judah gade Ephraim tsam mpet kelu benai gade, pa Assyria gwangpei de ngngwa gwang beuzie”.<verse eid="ISA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 7:18" />Cipau tingdau</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:18">RAMPAUBE Egypt reukidung kemdei ga tamaine ziemne makwa nza gai zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:18">nah Assyria deu ga tegeine ziemne.<verse eid="ISA 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 7:19" />Penui pelane gwang zie nah langkam mta kemrwa leune ga, tsura tia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:19">hetuhum pelane, nah tsehei deu leune ga lungh dizie.<verse eid="ISA 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 7:20" />Cipau tingdau Rampaube Euphrate Reuki kahpet lulamde li kelu tangkane le tai dizie, Assyria gwangpei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:20">pe peu nah pepi maidung; pe tangkeimai desi eh tai dizie.<verse eid="ISA 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 7:21" />Cipau benai mige hetumpui ge nah meurün kena gui bamzie,<verse eid="ISA 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 7:22" />nah tungdui kieesüt eh penui kepeu ziemne, pa tungdui sakzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:22">hangdeu cika mina bang kebamme tungdui nah heliadui tyei zie.<verse eid="ISA 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 7:23" />Cipau tingdau, kubebang cangge pemi rangkanggeu cangge tei lu kela luhdung de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:23">cika magede bamlak dede hetuhum nah hetu rünne dizie.<verse eid="ISA 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 7:24" />Minadung cika lakpi pwalwe heteih gwazie, kedanemene hangdeu pelane hetuhum nah hetu le puidi zielu.<verse eid="ISA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 7:25" />Penui hepei le ta kelu hangdeutu dungga mie tadi zie, hetuhum nah hetu le lungh pui kedide hing eh;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:25">dede cide hetum nah meuründung rwala kecu heni ge dizie.<verse eid="ISA 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ISA 8" />
  <para style="s">Assyria Rampaube gu Net</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 8:1" />RAMPAUBE ada ranggai, “Tangtsu kwak kedige keulu delwe kerautie le cika ge raulu, ‘Maher-Shalal-Hash-Baz<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maher-Shalal-Hash-Baz: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kemei tei eh keuteu.</char></note>.’ <verse eid="ISA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 8:2" />Ih nlumlu kebuime de zierang teikera qulu zie a zierang peu tei kerane, Uriah cingkupei, nah Jeberekiah napei Zechariah de”. <verse eid="ISA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 8:3" />Ih caiha kerangme pui da mie, nah pa tetlak lu nah mipeina ge lungh lu. Pecai RAMPAUBE ada ge ranggai, “Pezi Maher-Shalal-Hash-Baz qulu. <verse eid="ISA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 8:4" />Kedanemene hena nabe ‘A pei,’ nah ‘A poe,’ de ku ci kemak dwa gage, Damascus mabam nah Samaria mabam tuih kelu pelane Assyria gwangpei ne pung tet dizie”.<verse eid="ISA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 8:5" />RAMPAUBE acu resiu gai dai,<verse eid="ISA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 8:6" />“Kedanemene mina aidungde Shiloah ga dui zing de kebamde de mlai kedine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:6">nah Rezin penai Remaliah napei suiyi tei eh lunghla kedine,<verse eid="ISA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 8:7" />ciziemne RAMPAUBE penui dage hereuki duidiet peu lwa gwanggai lauda, kieesüt nah ngkingsüt eh, Assyria gwangpei nah pe kendu pelane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:7">Cide mina ne teikelu reukidung pelane ga gwang zie nah lwapet nlim eh pekuung pui dizie.<verse eid="ISA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 8:8" />Assyria reugwame Judah lebie lwagwang zie, lwapui nliem dide lwa bamzie nnui ngwang ga nghang cang kemaktane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:8">Pe hesiu dene nnui deu pelane gum luzie, Immanuel.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:23">Mat. 1:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 8:9" />Nnui lung pangpop dizie. Kingneilu, nnui pelane deudi kemdei tulam kebammedung:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:9">nnui katei nnuide mteilu hereu ziemne nah pangpop dilu; nnuikatei nnuide mtei lu nah pangpop dilu.<verse eid="ISA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 8:10" />Mage riem luzie, dede cide teipet gailak; aja kaizie, dede cide teipet lak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:10">kedanemene Tinggwang anuida bamlu. <verse eid="ISA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 8:11" />RAMPAUBE a dage rangbeu, Peba kengking a reuga kai, nah mina aidungde lampui ga tet helo rang mriak gai.<verse eid="ISA 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 8:12" />Mina aidungde heciem riem lie de eh rang kela leune de heciem riem lie de eh rang so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:12">nang mahing lak penui mahing kela de, nah n swagah diso.<verse eid="ISA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 8:13" />Reugwangme reu RAMPAUBE de kemci be lie eh nang herüt peu zie; pa da nnui hing kerabe de, nah pa da nnui hing kerabe.<verse eid="ISA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 8:14" />Pa au kemci ni ge dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:14">dede pa tangtsukang kehediang ge, nah puikam tsukang ge tei zie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">Israel leuhme kenana ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">nah pa Jerusalem ga minadung de</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">hetak ge tei eh keuh luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:32">Rom. 9:32</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 9:33">33</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 8:15" />Mi kekiee gede cikage mrap lwe mlui mie zie nah kaumie nah pang dizie, nah hetak gage keulu eh tui luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:44">Mat. 21:44</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 8:16" />A teilung zierang de kangteu lalu, tiakpwa kela rasam de kerak teula lu nah a caisuime depeu dilu.<verse eid="ISA 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 8:17" />Jacob leuhme dade pezu pung mbai kedibe RAMPAUBE de Ih kwabam zie; Ih pecu nlum zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mic. 3:4, Lei. 27:14</char></note><verse eid="ISA 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 8:18" />Pielo, Ih nah napeidungde, RAMPAUBE ne acu kepeu dung au marehi dung ge ziemne nah Israel ga swagahdung ziemne, maleune peu kela</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:18">reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Zion Deutu ga lungh kebambe dade gwang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:13">Heb. 2:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 8:19" />Penui n dage rang zie, “Ketsaime nah ketsaime rabedung de ngngwa mpau kelame dade keteu lulo eh,” cücüt nah rang duidui kelamedung. Dede mina penui Tinggwang dade keteu kerabe meni? Penui keringme ding tei ketsaime dade keteu kerabe ni? <verse eid="ISA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 8:20" />Hezai nah teilung zierang ga! Penui magade cikenzwa ranglu ta dicai; cide au penui da kebaa kegah ziemne da.<verse eid="ISA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 8:21" />Penui hangdeu kahgwang zie keherei süt nah mzeu eh. Penui mzeu kegai dau penui rata dizie nah penui gwangpei de</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:21">nah penui Tinggwang de reset zie, penui zu nreu tinggim ngangcuh pie kecudau.<verse eid="ISA 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 8:22" />Penui kideu be de piegai zie nah keherei, kemui,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:22">nah liagai kelak suisietdung ngauzie. Penuide gwagai dizie kemui deu ge gage.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 1:14">Zep. 1:14</ref>,<ref loc="ZEP 1:15">15</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9" />
  <para style="s">Anuide Mipeina ge Mna beu da</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 9:1" />Keherei kebam penui dade suisiet keugi dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:1">Kerai tingdau ge pa Zebulun nah Naphtali leuh kena deu da</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:1">hengam kai gai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:1">dede pecai pa kendu teugwang beuzie, lampui tet kegai jaaidi le kecang, Jordan kung kemdei ga kecang, Galilee deudidung dage.<verse eid="ISA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 9:2" />Minadung kemui ga tet kelame kebaa kedi ngaulu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:2">ketsai tingkaumie deu ga lungh kela leu, penui reu ga kebaa taubaa dida.<verse eid="ISA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 9:3" />Nang penui deudidung tei ngkiee beu da; nang penui suiyi tei ngkiee beu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">N dwa gade penui suiyi bam dida meitsi luhlüt kecu tingdau nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">mede minadung hema tuih kelube nzi kecu dau penui suiyi kela nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 9:4" />Kedanemene pe ngwanggai pwet kerüt de, pe hekeutu ga heking pwa kebam pak de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:4">pe suisiet tei kela geutie de, nang tei pang takcai dida, Midian de teipang takcai kedi benai nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 9:5" />Kedanemene reugwame picum hereu ga tet kedi leune de</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:5">nah paini niadung hejai lwa kedi leune</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:5">ru dizie, miheu ziemne maca ge tei eh.<verse eid="ISA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 9:6" />Kedanemene anui da henana ge lungh gwang beu da, anuide mipeina ge kaibeu da;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">nah hegwang pane punggwang zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">nah pezi Miswakegah Puisaube,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">Kengking Tinggwang, Kelunghta Peibe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">Kezuyi Gwangna lie eh quzie.<verse eid="ISA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7" />Pe hegwang deu direu reu zie nah kezuyi cika penli bamlak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">pa David kedi bam, nah pe hegwang ram reu hegwang tei zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">peu kwak lu nah bam tie lu kerane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">kesamsang nah kemzeu le cu gade nah kelungta gwang dai kerane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE aide teibi zie lie cet eh tei zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 1:32-33, Jer. 23:5</char></note><verse eid="ISA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 9:8" />Rampaube Jacob de mcau eh sam ge langgai, nah cide Israel leuhme reuga gwangdi.<verse eid="ISA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 9:9" />Mina pelane cilu zie, Ephraimme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ephraimme </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israel tingtünle ditube heni.</char></note> kecang de nah Samaria<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Samaria </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israel tingtünle namdi sumbe.</char></note> ga lungh kebamme dung de, caune hegie nah heliasüt eh rang bi kecu.<verse eid="ISA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 9:10" />“Lidei ru kelu tsukangdung kau dida, dede anui heruikelu tsupang kang le kwa dai dizie; Sycamore bangdung bi ngkau dida, dede anui cipau mding gage cedar bang le kaidai dizie.”<verse eid="ISA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 9:11" />Cine RAMPAUBE Aram gwangpei Rezin de mcau kelame de teu cuh beuzie, pecu renia kelame de, nah pe ngauraume de teu kebwak beuzie,<verse eid="ISA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 9:12" />naimiak kepetle Aramme nah kenlwetle Philistinme. Penui mui ngnga lwe Israel de ngkap dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:12">Aidung pelane gade, pe rata nli dima; meliene, peba hetwapet bamreu.<verse eid="ISA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 9:13" />Iciuliede penui au penuide tei keherei kegaibe da nreu gwang lak, mede penui reugwame reu RAMPAUBE de peei lak.<verse eid="ISA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 9:14" />Cine RAMPAUBE Israel dade pepeu nah pemi dang gi dizie, laira kiak nah hekuu, langnaige gage.<verse eid="ISA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 9:15" />Muiteume nah rütlu kebuime de pepeu be da; nah pemi be cai kenret keledeu caihakecime.<verse eid="ISA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 9:16" />Mina aidungde ne caugamme puisau tei bi penui lampui tetmau di la, nah penui sui laka eh cipau lampui ga tet dila.<verse eid="ISA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 9:17" />Cine Rampaube penui name rehangme reuga pe suiyi bam lak mede pe ngaugia pe pei kegahme nah hemipuidung da bam lak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:17">kedanemene mina leune nlumkemak nah kemauta tei la kedine, nah penui mui gade kepet samrang dung au kemang kwadung kecune.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:17">Ma aidung pelane tei bam de, perata nghim dima, meliene, peba hetwa pet bam reu.<verse eid="ISA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 9:18" />Mina kesiame miheu gene hetupui nah hetu dungde ngkapdi kelanzwa eh heu bam dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:18">cide hegung kecok mika mbuitung cuh kebam nzwa heubam dida.<verse eid="ISA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 9:19" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rata gade hangdeu be ruu di da, nah minadung be miheu be ziemne maca ge nzwa di.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:19">Migede pe sinabe de de kelilu ma.<verse eid="ISA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 9:20" />Penui taktyei pok zetle bale herak luzie dede nzeu bam zie; penui hile bale taktyei zie dede mnung gai lak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:20">Migege kecu penui katei penui bapum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bapum </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hename</char></note> de tyei dizie.<verse eid="ISA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 9:21" />Manasseh ga minadung nah Ephraim ga minadung ketket de gwaketang; nah penai ncütlwe Judah de gwaketang zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:21">Ma aidung pelane tei bam de, pe rata nhim dima; meliene, RAMPAUBE ba hetwapet bam reu.<verse eid="ISA 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 10:1" />Co hezaidung petau kemakpe mzai kelame nah rau kelamedung.<verse eid="ISA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 10:2" />Penui kegahme mjeu keu gidi la, a minadung kegahme kwa rega teu dila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:2">hemipuidung nah pe pei kegahme kwa süt teu dila!<verse eid="ISA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 10:3" />Nang kamtube tutiak benai daitei zieno kemdei gade kengkap kegwang dau?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:3">Nang cau dade kengha kie kera pak gwang lai, nah nang dai gage n mahei kaidiak lai?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Job. 31:14, 1 Pet. 2:12</char></note><verse eid="ISA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 10:4" />Magede bam silak, nah nang hebaangme kakga keumiee bwala dizie mede teitset kedime kakga kauzeu dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:4">Ma aidung pelane tei bam de, RAMPAUBE rata nhim dima; meliene, pe ba hetwa pet bam reu.<verse eid="ISA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5" />Co Assyriame, a rata tsingpak, a rata geutie Ih ne penui dage kai gai zie.<verse eid="ISA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6" />Ih penuide mcau ngang kela heleuh nah a rata pungsüt kecu minadung de langgai dida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:6">Ih penuide teitset kedime reunia, ma tui keludung keu tetdi lo langgai dida nah penuide puidikidung ga tangnia kedau nzwa dau niak dedi lo eh.<verse eid="ISA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 10:7" />Dede Assyria gwangpei aide tei kera cet ma, mede mning dema.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:7">Pe mlung au heleuh kekiee ge de ngkap nah tei takcai di kera ga ladi.<verse eid="ISA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 10:8" />Iciu eh pa hegie eh rang, “A napeimedung pelane hegwangme meni?<verse eid="ISA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 10:9" />Kalno namdi de Carchemish namdi nzwa meni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:9">Hamath namdi de Arpad namdi nzwa meni? Samaria namdi de Damascus namdi nzwa meni?<verse eid="ISA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 10:10" />Ih a bale mamie reca kela gwangramdung de ngam kelu nzwa, Jerusalem nah Samaria gu swade reki kelu mamiedung kieeki kebam gwangramdung de,<verse eid="ISA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 10:11" />Ih Samaria nah penui gu pemi kegah mamiedung dage tei kegai nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:11">Ih Jerusalem nah penui mamiedung dage de tei gai kera nsam meni?”<verse eid="ISA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 10:12" />Rampaube Zion Deutuh nah Jerusalem ga peta teicang di kecudau, Ih saja peu zie Assyria gwangpei pe mlung gade hegie sam kerang nah pe hegie de ziemne. <verse eid="ISA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 10:13" />Kedanemene Assyria gwangpei hegie eh rang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">“Ih a kengkieng nah mriak le tei lu dilu. Ih maci bam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">nah Ih minadung gu heraidung keu mpet dida. Ih penui mabamdung rega luda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">nah hetumseu ge nzwa lungh kebamme de tei ngkap dida.<verse eid="ISA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 10:14" />Ih a ba le, maciep gade nzwa, heleuhdung gu mahei swet luda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:14">nah mige gi kenzeu nruibum kekiee ge hekwa kela nzwa, Ih kideu pelane pwa hekwa lu da.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:14">Migede pe hesiu gede siulap ma mede penui mui ngnga dema mede magede tu ma.”<verse eid="ISA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 10:15" />Mreu ge pekatei pecu pempaube swa pa be diki lie helia lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:15">Tsingget ge pecu pwa matei kelabe swa pabe yiki lie eh pekatei pecu twa lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:15">Cinzwa cai hegeutie ge ne pecu keu ncuh kebeube de keu ncuh kecu nzwa da, mede tsingpak ge ne migede keu ncuh kera nzwa da.<verse eid="ISA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 10:16" />Ciziemne reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang pe reugwame keyime kakge mateei langgai beuzie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:16">nah pe kendu kang gade miheu ge nzwa tau heu bam dizie.<verse eid="ISA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 10:17" />RAMPAUBE, Israelme kebaa de mi mmi dizie, nah Kemci Tinggwang de mitau ge dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:17">cide tingnai ge gage hetuu nah hetuu humdung ru nah ngkap dizie.<verse eid="ISA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 10:18" />RAMPAUBE penui gu hegung keyidung nah luh zamdung petsi kekiee builu keladung ngkap dizie, pumtei nah penui rabe de si eh;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:18">cide kemrame ge mage de tei lutadi kela ting dau nzwa dizie.<verse eid="ISA 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 10:19" />Penui gu tsinggung ga tsingbang kecam nage bang nzeu zie, hename ge ne de cide pei lubui dizie.<verse eid="ISA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel Kebangnabe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 10:20" />Cipaunai, bang kebam Israelme, Jacob kibaume pak kelume, penuide ngam kedime kangga lungh tadi zie, dede Israel gu Kemci RAMPAUBE de ngngei eh lungh dizie.<verse eid="ISA 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 10:21" />Bang kelu Jacob kibaume kengking Tinggwang da caili gwang luzie.<verse eid="ISA 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 10:22" />Kedanemene Israelme, duidi kungga heciangdung kieege bam de, bang kelu kecam nage rünne cailigwang zie. Makesangme kekie puikenlim peu kela nzwa, kengkap au hezai kai kebeu ge gade gwangla.<verse eid="ISA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 10:23" />Kedanemene reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, pa teizie lie kela kengkap kideu pelane ga teugwang gai lai eh bam dide lu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:27">Rom. 9:27</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 9:28">28</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 10:24" />Ciziemne reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang rang eh cu, “Zion ga kelungh a minadung, Assyriame de hing so. Pa nnuide hegeutie nah pa pe tuitie pwa hwacuh nnuide mcau zie, Egyptme tei kegai nzwa. <verse eid="ISA 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 10:25" />Pecu hing so, kedanemene matie mene a rata n da bamsi lak delu, nah a rata ne pe da kengkap teugwang beuzie.”<verse eid="ISA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 10:26" />Pecai reugwame reu RAMPAUBE tsingria ge teu penuide dap zie, Oreb tialwa gade Midiame de ngam kelu dau nzwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tut. 7:24-25</char></note> Pa pegu hegeutie duidi reuga hetwa gaizie nah pwa cehu gai zie pa Egypt gade ketei nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 10:27" />Cipau nai nnui hekeutu gade pe pwet kerüt de lwak luzie nah pe ngwanggai nnui ngwang gade keu mpet dizie, nah ngwanggai de tei msia dizie.<verse eid="ISA 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 10:28" />Ngauraume Aiath namdi ga gwang bam dida</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:28">nah Migron nam tet kah dida; Michmash nam gage pe taktyei niadung hekwa gai dida.<verse eid="ISA 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 10:29" />Penui gicak de tet kahlu delwe Geba nam ga penui mtaklu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:29">Ramah nam ngngi di nah Saul nam ga Gibeah ga minadung pak tet dida.<verse eid="ISA 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 10:30" />Mra gailo, Gallim nam minadung! Kingnei sünne lu, Laishah namdi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:30">Nnui makega Anathoth namceudung!<verse eid="ISA 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 10:31" />Madmenah nam au pak tetti au da,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:31">nah Gebim nam ga lungh kebammedung kwaklu kerane pakla dida.<verse eid="ISA 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 10:32" />Aipaunai pa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:32">Nob nam ga mtak bam zie nah pa pe bazum tuilwe Zion ga minadung lamlwa de, Jerusalem deutu dage kesing gai zie.<verse eid="ISA 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 10:33" />Ainie, Rampaube reugwame reu RAMPAUBE tsingbang kiak bitap mie pekwa siu kehing ge teigai zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:33">tsingbang hutubedung bi ngkau dizie, nah kehube bangdung de de bi hena dizie.<verse eid="ISA 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 10:34" />RAMPAUBE mreu gele hegung tsingbangdung bi kau dizie, nah pe kendu gade Lebanon kau dizie.<verse eid="ISA 10:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11" />
  <para style="s">Jesse dade Tsingkiak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 11:1" />Jesse<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jesse </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hegwangpei David pei.</char></note> gu tsingmui gade pepwak ge pwakcuh zie, nah pekiakpe pe mah gade pet petsi buizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat. 13:23, Jer. 23:5, Keu. 22:16</char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2" />RAMPAUBE Rabe pe reu ga mtak bam zie, maci ningcing nah macilu kebui Rabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:2">keteulia kebeube nah kengkieng Rabe, maci nah RAMPAUBE de kehing Rabe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eph. 1:17, Isa. 42:1, Jhn. 14:17</char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 11:3" />Pa pesuiyi kecu au Rampaube sam kehing de zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:3">pa pemiak le ngau kegai lepwa tutiak teilak, nah pekwen siu kegai dele pwane mariem dilak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jhn. 8:15-16, 7:24</char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 11:4" />Meliene, makesang teu eh kegahmedung tutiak tei beuzie nah kideu ga kehename ziemne macet siakte beuzie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:4">Pa pemui hetui lepwa kideube de dap zie, nah pe muileu cuingi lepwa kesiame de gi zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Thes. 2:8, Keu. 19:15</char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 11:5" />Pa makesang le pwane pe kiakang tei zie, nah masang le pwane pekia hebiet luzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 59:17, Eph. 6:14</char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 11:6" />Cipau tingdau heneu meurünna de ngngwa lungh dizie, nah kaudau hemeuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:6">nah ketumna ngngwa bam zie, nah hinghona, ketumna pelui keyibe de ncüt eh ngngwa mla bam dizie. Hena keceu nage ne penui puisau teizie.<verse eid="ISA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 11:7" />Hegum nah ketum ngngwa taktyei peeityei ncüt dizie, nah penui nadung zeu mla ncüt dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:7">Hingho ketumseu nzwa reigau tyei dizie.<verse eid="ISA 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 11:8" />Ngiena henei koiki reuga nggwa zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:8">nah tung kebam nabe pe ba keri pwa heneei kibung gage kai zie.<verse eid="ISA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 11:9" />Penuide rezam dilak mede ngkap de dilak agu kemci lamlwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kemci lamlwa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zion</char></note> pelane ga au;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:9">kedanemene, RAMPAUBE maci lepwa kideu puih dizie, dui le jaaidi ham puih kebam nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 11:10" />Cipau tingba benai au, Jesse gu pe mah mina gu pailim tei eh sapzie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:10">Heleuhbedung pecu peei petzie, nah pe mtak bam cide au kendu ge zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:12">Rom. 15:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 11:11" />Cipau benai au, Rampaube pe ba ketwa pet zie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:11">iciu eh pegu mina dungde bang kenzeume de Assyria deu, Egypt nkangle, Egypt nreule,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:11">Cush, Elam, Shinar, Hamath, nah mediterranean jaaidi gade ridailu kerane.<verse eid="ISA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 11:12" />Pa heleuhdung ziemne pailim be pwacuh zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:12">nah langgi kedi Israelmedung de teu hekwa luzie nah zangkedi Judah leuh de kideu kimiak mdai gade hekwalu zie.<verse eid="ISA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 11:13" />Pa Ephraimme periak kela de peu teisi ta dizie, nah Judah zaisiedung keugi dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:13">Ephraim Judah de periak silak, nah Judah Ephraim dage penui zaisia silak.<verse eid="ISA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 11:14" />Iciu meliene Israel penai Judah medung ngngwalwe naimiak kenlütle Philistinme deutu ga zette nghung zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:14">delwe penui ncütlwe naimiak kepetle Jordan Reuki lebie kelungh medung de tei ngkap dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:14">Penui Edom nah Moab heleuhdung de gwaketang zie, nah Ammonmedung penui sam mzai dizie.<verse eid="ISA 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 11:15" />RAMPAUBE Egypt Jaaidi gu duingwang ngkap zingdi zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:15">Pa tingkai kelumcui teu eh Euphrate reuki reu gage pe ba kezit gai delwe cide hereuki keceuna hena gage cak mzi di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:15">iciu eh cide mi pideu picum teu eh kahlu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 10:11">Zec. 10:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 11:16" />Bang kelu pe mina Assyria gade cailigwang kelame ziemne puidi ge bam zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:16">Israelme Egyptme deu gade kempet dau puidi kebam nzwa eh.<verse eid="ISA 11:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ISA 12" />
  <para style="s">Ketwa Leidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 12:1" />Cipau benai nang lei teizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">“Ih ncu hetwa pwapeu zie, RAMPAUBO. Kedanemene nang acu n rata la liede, n lunghop nang teunreu dida, nah nang alung tei relui beu.<verse eid="ISA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 12:2" />Pielo, Tinggwang au acu kelikelube; Ih nlum zie nah ngngi dilak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:2">kedanemene RAMPAUBE, yeo, RAMPAUBE au a kengkieng nah a lei. Pa a kelikelube tei luda.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 118:14, Tet. 15:2</char></note><verse eid="ISA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 12:3" />Suiyi teu eh kelikelu tekwadung gade nang dui twak zie.<verse eid="ISA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 12:4" />Cipau tingba benai nang lei teizie, “RAMPAUBE de hetwa pwapeu lo nah ncu ngha kera pecu qulu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">pe batadung mina dage ranglia lo, pe zi hetwa pung kelube teu sahlo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:1">Lei. 105:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 105:2">2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 12:5" />RAMPAUBE dage lei teigai lu, kedanemene pa kendu batadung tei kegai ne; kideu reu pelane ga de peu aide ci lo.<verse eid="ISA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 12:6" />Mrabak nah suiyi sahlo, nnui Zion ga kelunghmedung, kedanemene nnui kakga Israelme gu Kemci Tinggwang au dizu lu.”<verse eid="ISA 12:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ISA 13" />
  <para style="s">Babylon de Kemmau Caiha ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 13:1" />Babylonme ziemne sam ge, Amoz napei Isaiah ne Tinggwang dade ngau kelu:<verse eid="ISA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 13:2" />Lamlwa kwak kebam gage marehi lia kera pailim pwacuh lu, reugwame dage sahbak gai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:2">penuide peu kedime kirieki lung lwetti lu kerane n ba kezit gaibeu.<verse eid="ISA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 13:3" />Ih agu kemci minadung de aja kaibeu dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:3">yeo, Ih a mina kengkiengmedung de qulu da a rata gai kerane, a kedi de suiyi kelamedung de de si eh.<verse eid="ISA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 13:4" />Lamlwatudung ga mina maadi mra kegai kwa, mina kekieege kenzwa ge!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:4">Heleuh kekieege ngkwa ncüt kelube nzwa zie hegwangramdung hemaa maadi mra kwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:4">Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE hereu tei kerane reugwame kekieege de hekwabam.<verse eid="ISA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 13:5" />Penui kemdei deudi gade gwang, kideu penli gade.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:5">Cide RAMPAUBE tutiak niadung teu delwe, kideu be de ngkap ti laizeu.<verse eid="ISA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 13:6" />Suisiet kwa teu mralu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE tingba mna gwang zeu; cide Ngkiengtube Tinggwang dade ngkapti kera gwang.<verse eid="ISA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 13:7" />Ciziemne mina badung leune zaura eh mzu zie, nah mileune mlung sui dizie.<verse eid="ISA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 13:8" />Minadung ngngi dizie; hena kemnapui ge nzwa keteei teeisüt kecule penuide kerakteu dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:8">Penui swagah eh penui hangge ge da kerepie dizie; penui zudung miheu ge nzwa dizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Thes. 5:3</char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 13:9" />Pielo, RAMPAUBE tingba au lunghop Kesia nah rata kepui tei eh gwangzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:9">kideu de kemta teidi kerane, nah cika kebam kemaumedung de ngkapti kerane.<verse eid="ISA 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 13:10" />Tinggim ga hegi leune nah hegimaadung penui kebaa peu ta dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:10">Tingnaimiak baareirang kecu dau de mui dizie, nah hekei de baa ta dizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 24:29, Mrk. 13:24, Keu. 6:12-13</char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 13:11" />Ih kideube de pe kesia ziemne, nah kesiame de mateu nsam ta kedine saja peu zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:11">Ngang kelame zaisiedung Ih tei nggah dizie nah pezai kesia ngaugia kegahmedung de tei ngkau dizie.<verse eid="ISA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 13:12" />Ih ring kebamme de kecak swade ngaupa kelage tei dizie, nah mina luilungh kemci Ophir kecak swade peeipa kelage tei dizie.<verse eid="ISA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 13:13" />Ciziemne Ih tinggimdung tei mbeu dizie, nah kideube de kecui kelai pwa pebam ga bam ta dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:13">cide reugwame reu RAMPAUBE lunghop gade zie, nah pa perata sia kedibe nai zie.<verse eid="ISA 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 13:14" />Babylon ga sangme lungh kebamdung heti gede rehume ne gwa kela nzwa mede meurün pe kekwabe kegah nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:14">mina leune de penui katei penui leuhme dage nreu cailigwang pekatei peram gage pakkai dizie.<verse eid="ISA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 13:15" />Ngau kelu leune de teitsetti zie, nah tuih kelu leune kingtie gade tsai zie.<verse eid="ISA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 13:16" />Penui nepamnadung de de penui miakdwa gade hekei kecai dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:16">Penui kidung tei msia dizie nah penui naudung de teuh dizie.<verse eid="ISA 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 13:17" />Pielu, penuide gwaketang kerane Ih Medesme lung teigai lai bam dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:17">cipaume rangkanggeu de de masi peilak, mede kecak gede penui mca swalak.<verse eid="ISA 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 13:18" />Penui lakpidung ne heluibuame de kap ngkau dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:18">penui nepamnadung de de ngaunggia lak nah hename de kenggia teu eh pielak.<verse eid="ISA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 13:19" />Iciu eh Babylon, mileune mca bam kela hegwangramdung, Chaldeme hegie bam kela hezukeyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:19">cide Sodom penai Gomorrah namdidung de Tinggwang ne ngam kelu nzwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken. 19:23-29</char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 13:20" />Babylon migede gum lak mede lungh mene ceheu ge gade ceheu ge gwang dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:20">Arabme pe paiki cikage limlak, mede meurün kekwame de penui meurünhau de cikage mtak kera gwagai lak.<verse eid="ISA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 13:21" />Dede hetaideu gade renaam kaunedung cika bam zie. Pe nui kidung ga biangkang le pui dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:21">nah ruitiedung nah renaam meudung cika nsak eh lungh zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:2">Keu. 18:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 13:22" />Penui kudadung ga maiserungdung hapzie, nah hezu keyi hegwangkidung ga heneudung bam zie. Babylon ting mna dida, nah petingba ziedung ri dilak.<verse eid="ISA 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 14:1" />RAMPAUBE Jacob da pe ngaugia bam zie; pa Israelme de kedet dailu nah penui deu penuide pwapeu daizie. Sangme penuide ncütlu zie nah Jacob ki ga ngngwa hekang zie. <verse eid="ISA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 14:2" />Heleuh kekieege ne Israelme de nghabeu eh RAMPAUBE penuide kepeu deu ga cailigwang gwang dai luzie. Nah Israel kilungmedung penuide RAMPAUBE deu gage ngngwa gwang kilapei nah kilapui tei zie. Penuide tui kelame de penui teu penui bang tei dizie, nah penuide tei keherei kelamedung reu penui kedi tei zie.<verse eid="ISA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 14:3" />RAMPAUBE nnuide kemtak kepeube nai nnui keherei nah teei kela gade, nah nnui kemei tei eh peu mata kewhung ketei gade, <verse eid="ISA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 14:4" />nnui aipau henui lei Babylonme gwangpei dage teigai zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:4">“Dai nzwa delwe mide tei keherei kelabe penli dau zeu no, ngang kela rata penli gwang dida!<verse eid="ISA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 14:5" />RAMPAUBE ne kesiame tuitie teipang dida, hegwangme tuitie kengking de,<verse eid="ISA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 14:6" />cide mtak mene mina de lunghop teu delwe kebiet eh dap bam kela de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:6">iciu eh heleuhbe reu rata teu hegwang tei kebam de, nah kezeu mezing delwe ketang kebam.<verse eid="ISA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 14:7" />Kideureu pelane mtak luda nah zingde luda; penui lei tei eh renga cuh dida.<verse eid="ISA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 14:8" />Cypress bang kecang de Lebanon cedar bangdung de ngngwa n peureu gade penui suiyi renga bam dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:8">penui rang eh, ‘Ncu tei hena kedi nzwa, tsing kebime gwang anuide bi ngkau kerame gah da.’<verse eid="ISA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 14:9" />Nang Sheol<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sheol </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ketsaime deu</char></note> ga nghung kecudau, ncu dau kera regui bam dida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:9">N ziemne ketsaime de nkia ncu luda, kideu ga hegwangdung pelane de de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:9">penui hegwangbamdung ga peu cuh dai kap luda, heleuhdung pelane hegwangdung.<verse eid="ISA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 14:10" />Penui marang eh n dage mra gaizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:10">‘Nang de anui nzwa mnei dida. Nang de anui nzwakap dida.<verse eid="ISA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 14:11" />Leibung kwadung de ngngwa ketsaideu gage n kengkieng cak nghung gai dida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:11">N cidung n kangga pui nah tangseu ne ncu hezui luda.’<verse eid="ISA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12" />Dainzwa eh nang tinggim gade cakmie lu dino, tingna gibo, tingcang napeibo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:12">Dainzwa eh ncu hangdeu gage keling nghung dino, nang heleuhbedung de ngam kelabe!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 10:18, Eze. 28:13-17</char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13" />Nang nkatei n mlung gade rang da, ‘Ih tinggim ga hangcang zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:13">Ih a hegwangbam keu cehu pwa Tinggwang gu hegidung swade huzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:13">nah ngkwa kela lamlwatu ga bam zie, cide tingpeule kemdei ga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 11:23, Luk. 10:15</char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14" />Ih hemwadung hutube reu hang zie; Ih akatei acu lepwa Tinggwang Hutube nzwa eh tei zie.’<verse eid="ISA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 14:15" />Iciu meliene cu au ncu Sheol gage teu nghung dida, hekwaki cuktu gage.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 11:23, Luk. 10:15</char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 14:16" />Ncu ngau kegaime ncu pieling zie nah penui n dage penui lung kai dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:16">Penui ainzwa rangzie, ‘Mina aide kideube de tei mbeu bam kelabe de deni, pa hegwangramdung kecui kelai kelabe de,<verse eid="ISA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 14:17" />pa kideube teipwa hetaideu nzwa tei kedibe, namdidung ngam kelube nah pegu hebaangme dungde peu kilung gwang kemakpe de meni?’<verse eid="ISA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 14:18" />Heleuhdung pelane gu hegwangmedung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:18">penui herüt teu eh hangge ge kecu penui katei penui rauga zeu.<verse eid="ISA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 14:19" />Dede ncu au tsingkiak kelien kedibe nzwa n rau gade de gwagi dida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:19">Ketsai ne ncu paini ge nzwa hezui luda, kiengtie le huih kedimedung, hekwaki tsudung ga nghung kelame.<verse eid="ISA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 14:20" />Ncu au hegwang kedame de nzwa kunglak, kedanemene nang n deu teingkap dida</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:20">nah nang n mina dungde teitset dida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:20">Makesia ketei namedung de madaude nsung dailak.”<verse eid="ISA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 14:21" />Aipau hegwangpei namedung de teitset kera mtei lulo, penui paume mau ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:21">iciu eh penui cuh delwe kideube gumlu nah kideu pelane namdidung le tei puih di kelakne.<verse eid="ISA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 14:22" />“Ih penuide renia cuh zie”, aide reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ndu gai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:22">“Ih penui zi Babylon gade kemai dizie, pe leuhdung nah penui namedung”, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<verse eid="ISA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 14:23" />“Ih pecu biangkang ne gumteu kedi ge tei dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:23">nah rejaai ge tei dizie, nah Ih pecu kengkap kaibiak le biak teu dizie”, aide reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<verse eid="ISA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 14:24" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE sampet luda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:24">“Kesang, Ih cet kelu de kesiakke, cinzwa eh gwangzie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:24">nah Ih riam teu kela de nzwa, ciciu luzie:<verse eid="ISA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 14:25" />Ih a deu gade Assyriame de teipang dizie, nah Ih a lamlwa gade pecu a pidau teizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:25">Iciu eh pe ngwanggai penui dade keucuh dizie nah pe reidung pe keutu gade keuteu dizie.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:25">Iciu eh pe ngwanggai penui dade keucuh dizie nah pe reidung pe keutu gade keuteu dizie.”<verse eid="ISA 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 14:26" />Mariem aide kideureu pelane dage teigai kera cet kelube da, nah heba aide hwapwa heleuh leune reu gage kai kelube da.<verse eid="ISA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 14:27" />Kedanemene, reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne aide riemlu da; caune pecu kamlu lai? Pe ba pwacuh dida, nah caune cide keu caili lulai?<verse eid="ISA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 14:28" />Hegwangpei Ahaz tsai kedibe kum ndu kegai sam aide ada gwang:<verse eid="ISA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 14:29" />Nnui Philistinme, nnuide kedap tie tsum di delu de nnui suiyi bamso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:29">Kedanemene henei leuh gade henei keheibe de lungh cuhlu builu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:29">nah penadung au lim kela miheu nei gezie lu.<verse eid="ISA 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 14:30" />Ma kegahme neraidung penui meurün de peu a luhpak gade taktyei peu tyei zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:30">nah makegahme kwak eh lungh dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:30">Ih nnui mah herakum le teitset dizie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:30">iciu eh ringkebammedung de de ketsai gage kaidi kerane.<verse eid="ISA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 14:31" />Rieki ga mra eh kengha sahgailo, namdi go; nnui pelane de sui tet dizie, Philistia go.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:31">Kedanemene, tingpeule de mika hemwa ge gwangla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:31">nah pe kedi kangga kenghet reugwame gede gah.<verse eid="ISA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 14:32" />Dainzwa eh penui cipau leuh Philistia samgwabe dage samli peulai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:32">“RAMPAUBE ne Zion ndeu luda, nah teei eh keherei kela pe minadung pe dade kensiuge ge ngau luzie.”<verse eid="ISA 14:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ISA 15" />
  <para style="s">Moab de Kemmau Sam ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 15:1" />Moab deudi de ziemne ndulia kegai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:1">Kesang, zeuziu ge gage Moab nam Ar ngkapdi nah kemta teidi da;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:1">kesang, zeuziu ge gage Moab nam Kir ngkapdi nah kemta teidi da.<verse eid="ISA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 15:2" />Penui kerecaki ga hang dida, Dibonmedung lamlwatu kehu ga hap kera tet hang dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:2">Nebome<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nebome </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Moab tingtünle lamlwa ge.</char></note> penai Medebame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Medebame </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nebo Deutu taiga namceu ge.</char></note> ziemne Moabme hapgai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:2">Penui peu tam taikwakdi nah penui muimai bitgi ciak dida.<verse eid="ISA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 15:3" />Penui puididung gade rosopai balwe; penui kireudung gade</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:3">nah renamsum gade mileune penui miakdui bia eh hap zie.<verse eid="ISA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 15:4" />Heshbon penai Elealeh hap mrung eh kengha kie kegai; penai kwa Jahaz kecang gade siu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:4">Cine Moab reugwamedung penui kakgade mbeu eh kengha kie kegai kwa sahgai.<verse eid="ISA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 15:5" />A mlung Moabme ziemne hap; pe mina mbai eh pak kelame Zoar nah Eglath Shelishiyah namdi gage pakgai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:5">Penui Luhith lampui ga hap eh tet hang;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:5">Horonaim lampui gade penui gudung ngkap kedi ziemne penui sütgai hap.<verse eid="ISA 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 15:6" />Nimrim lamkam dui de cang dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:6">tsehei regui dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:6">nah cehei ki kapdi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:6">cika heidiak kette bamsi meda.<verse eid="ISA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 15:7" />Penui lung nah hekwa kelu kepui kenlim</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:7">penui cidungde punglwe poplar tsingbang ziu kakga reueuna dungde pung kahpetdi.<verse eid="ISA 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 15:8" />Kehap cide Moabme deu pelane puidi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:8">Eglaim nah Beer Elim kecang de kehap kwa cide siudi.<verse eid="ISA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 15:9" />Dimon dui au hejai le pui dida; dede Ih Dimon reu gage ciswa keei eh keugwang si gai zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:9">Moab gade pak kedime nah cika bang kebammedung de hingho ne gwaketang zie.<verse eid="ISA 15:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ISA 16" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 16:1" />Hetaideu Selah gade, Zion napui deutu gage</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:1">hangdeu reu kedime dage meurünseudung langgai beulo.<verse eid="ISA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 16:2" />Limrwa kela ruinedung, pecit teuzang kedibe nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:2">Moabme puidung de Arnon Reuki kelüt kung ga rwala dizie.<verse eid="ISA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 16:3" />“Tei kera ranglia beulu, kemzuibe teibeu lu; tingna ridau de penuide tingkaumie le tingmui nzwa sung beulo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:3">mbai delwe pak kelame de kebai beulu; penuide cwa diso.<verse eid="ISA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 16:4" />Penuide peu nnui kakga lunghlu, Moab gade pak kelame de;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:4">penuide ngkapdi zielie kelame dade peu kemsiu bam ge lu.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:4">Kedanemene tei keherei kecu mtak dizie, nah kengkapdung cangdi zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:4">penuide pe pidau tei kelame kideu gade gah dizie.<verse eid="ISA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 16:5" />Samkak kelu kesamsang de teu eh hegwangbam ge tei luzie; nah David leuhme ge ne samsang eh hegwang tei luzie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:5">Pa kemzuibe peei kelanzwa eh ma teu nsam zie iciu eh kesamsangbe teizie.<verse eid="ISA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 16:6" />Judah ga minadung rang, “Anui Moabme ngang kela nah pezai kesia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:6">pegie kerang, nah perata ha siulu da, dede pegie rang eh ngang kela cide au kemta kemrwa samdung.”<verse eid="ISA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 16:7" />Cine Moabme Moab ziemne hap zeu, penui pelane hap! Nnui sui sialu, nnuide tei ngkapsüt kedimedung go, Kir Hareseth gade kubetsi kekibe tangkudung de penui msung eh hap dizie.<verse eid="ISA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 16:8" />Heshbon luhdung cangh kap dida Sibmah ga kubekiakdung de si eh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">Heleuhdung gu kedimedung ne kube bangkiak keyibe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">Jazer ga hangcang kelu hangdeuketsai nah</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">Pe pwakdung jaaidi kap pet; sangme deu ga zangra kepet de penui pidau tei dida.<verse eid="ISA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 16:9" />Ih Jazer de ngngwa hap kesang zie Sibmah megu kubeluhdung ziemne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">Heshbon nah Elealeh de, Ih a miakdui le pwa nnai de hetau zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">Kedanemene hepwak dau nnai luh gade petsidung buikelu nah luhlüt kelu suiyidung Ih de gah kedine.<verse eid="ISA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 16:10" />Matsibang ziu gade kerenga nah suiyidung keuteu dida; nah kubeluh ga lei ketei, mede suiyi kwa kesah gede gahda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:10">Migede zau niak bam ge zau niak meda, kedanemene Ih kubetsi niak kelabe suiyi kwa de tei nggah dida.<verse eid="ISA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 16:11" />Cine Moabme ziemne harp kwa nzwa a mlung mradi, nah Kir Hareseth ziemne alung sia gai.<verse eid="ISA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 16:12" />Moabme nlum kemak reca ni ga leu eh gwang cang keli dau</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:12">nah pe kerecaki ga kekie tei kera lüt, iciu de penui kekie magede teibeu lak.<verse eid="ISA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 16:13" />RAMPAUBE sam aide Moabme ziemne rang nswa kegai. <verse eid="ISA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 16:14" />RAMPAUBE rangdai eh cu, “Mmi kecum lung gage, Moabme kemdu gah di zieda; penui mina kekiee ge bam liede, bang kelubedung au camsüt zie nah pe kemlang ge de bamlak.”<verse eid="ISA 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ISA 17" />
  <para style="s">Damascus de Kemmau Sam ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 17:1" />Damascus namdi de ziemne ndu lia kegai.<verse eid="ISA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 17:2" />Aroer namdidung gidi dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:2">Heni cide kauruinedung bam ge dizie, nah migede penuide keheu lak.<verse eid="ISA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 17:3" />Rie kwakelu namdidung Damascus hegwangram Ephraim gade gah dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:3">nah bangkelu Arammedung, penui Israelme kemdu de nzwa zie, aide reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rang ndu kegai.<verse eid="ISA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 17:4" />Cide langnai ge gwang cang dizie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:4">Jacob kemdu ncimdi zie, nah pelui keyi teihdung ntiang dizie.<verse eid="ISA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 17:5" />Cide luhlüt kelabe meibui hekwa kebam, nah pe ba meibui nriep kebam dauzie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:5">Cide mige Rephaim langkam ga meibui tei tangra kegai pa kela dauzie.<verse eid="ISA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 17:6" />Tangra kedi meibuidung pütdi zie, dede, olive bang cuikelai kegaidau:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:6">olive kena kecum ge perang kengking nreutu ga kebam, nah mdai mede mengei ge petsi kebui kiakdung cehutu ga bam, aide RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang ndulia kegai.<verse eid="ISA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 17:7" />Cipau benai minadung penuide Damkegaibe de peei zie, nah penui miak Israel Kemcibe de piezie.<verse eid="ISA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 17:8" />Penui penui ba ne tei kelu recabamdung de pielak, nah penui zurangdung le tei kelubedung de pielak, Asherah miedung nah tingnaimiak miedung dede.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:13">Mic. 5:13</ref>,<ref loc="MIC 5:14">14</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 17:9" />Cipau benai penui kengkieng namdidung de lamlwatu ga gi kedi (tsinglwa) tsingkop kopkedi (tsinglwa) ge nzwa dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:9">Israel minadung ziemne pütkedi ge nah cide kemta nam ge dizie.<verse eid="ISA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 17:10" />Kedanemene nnuide kelikelube Tinggwang de nsungta kedine, nah nnuide gumbeu kelabe de masipei kemakne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:10">Cine sangme ge dade keu kelu kubetsibang kiakdung nnui ling kegai de him petlu,<verse eid="ISA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 17:11" />cipau benai tsing ceheibui linglu nah talu. Tiemene peleube pwakcuh luzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:11">dede suisiet nah lungrei kegwang benai cide luhlüt lu tadi zie.<verse eid="ISA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 17:12" />Ainie! Mina kekiee mra kwa, jaaididung mra kwa nzwa dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:12">nah heleuhdung mra kebam, dui kedi lwa kebam kwa nzwa zie!<verse eid="ISA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 17:13" />Heleuhdung mra kwa dui kekiee ge lwa kebam kwa nzwa zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:13">dede pa penuide kesiu zie nah penui kemdei gage pakgai dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:13">penuide gwapwa lamlwadung ga tingkai ne ciurie guiteu kedige nzwa zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:13">nah ceheidung heratingkai ne gui mrui kebam ge nzwa zie.<verse eid="ISA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 17:14" />Tinghegi dige, pielo, ngaukehing ge! Tingcang gwang kemakdwa cidungde gah dizie!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">Aide anui dade süttyei kelame mzi da, anui dade rega kelume magum.<verse eid="ISA 17:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ISA 18" />
  <para style="s">Cush de Kemmau Caiha ge</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 18:1" />Ainie Cush reukidung kunghga kebam, hangdeu ge hesiudung kwa siu eh bam;<verse eid="ISA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 18:2" />caune kiina le teikelu duiliem gade jaaidi taiga ge deudiding keteime de langgai no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">Kemzet samgwamedung, heleuh penui ra hu nah hezukeyi da miecu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">kemdei kenna leune gade mina ne pecu hingbam kela gage, heleuh kengkieng nah ma tei ngkapti kela, pedeu hereukidung ne mzi kedi deu ga.<verse eid="ISA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 18:3" />Hangdeu reu ga lunghkebam leune nah nnui kideu ga lungh kebamme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:3">kideutudung ga pailim pwacu lia kecudau, pielo; nah telui kwa kegaidau, kingnei lu.<verse eid="ISA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 18:4" />Aide RAMPAUBE a dage rang kegai ge, “Ih zingde a ki gade mcet sünne bamzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:4">tingnaimiak tau peri tingding tingdau nzwa, luhlüt peri dau mwangzim ge nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 18:5" />Luhlüt kemakdwa, pepa pah cang di eh kubetsi bui kepet tingdau,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:5">pa pe pwakdung de kieceuna le hetsia dizie, nah pa cide bi ngkaulu nah pekiak perang keuteu tet dizie.<verse eid="ISA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 18:6" />Penuide lamlwadung ga nruinedung de nah kideu ga makaunedung de ncüt delwe pütdiak gai dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:6">Nruinedung hepwak dau penui reu bamzie, nah kideu ga makaune pelane tingtiak dau penui da bam dizie.”<verse eid="ISA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 18:7" />Cipau tingdau pera hu nah hezukeyi minadung dade reugwame reu RAMPAUBE dage hetwakepeu mapeudung keu gwang zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:7">kemdei kenna leune gade mina ne pecu hingbam kela gage, heleuh kengkieng nah ma tei ngkapti kela, pedeu hereukidung ne mzi kedi deu ga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:7">Zion Deutu, reugwame reu RAMPAUBE zi kebam ni ga.<verse eid="ISA 18:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ISA 19" />
  <para style="s">Egypt de Kemmau Caiha ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 19:1" />Egyptme ziemne ndu kegai ge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:1">Pielo, RAMPAUBE hemwa gade mzet eh Egypt ga gwang lada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:1">Egypt gu mamiedung de pe dwa gade mbeu bam dida, nah Egyptme ngngi eh penui mlungdung suih dida.<verse eid="ISA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 19:2" />“Ih Egyptme kakga ngngwa kesia kaigai zie: Mige pe sinabe de renia zie, nah mige pe kidabe de renia;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:2">namdi ge namdi keda gede renia zie, nah hegwangram ge hegwangram keda gede renia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:21">Mat. 10:21</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:36">36</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 19:3" />Penui kak gade Egyptme rabe mnei dizie. Ih pe mariemdung tei msia dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:3">penui mamiedung, ketsaime rabedung, rekame nah ketsaime de mpau kelame dade ma keteu liede.<verse eid="ISA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 19:4" />Ih Egyptme de pe zaikesia mpaube ba gage kaigai zie, nah hegwang kengking ge penui reu dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:4">aide reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ne ndukegai.”<verse eid="ISA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 19:5" />Jaaidi ga duidung cang dizie, nah kereuki cang eh mtaku dizie.<verse eid="ISA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 19:6" />Kereukidung nnam dizie; Egypt ga reunadung ceureu reu eh cang dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:6">kiina nah hekuu bangdung regui dizie.<verse eid="ISA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 19:7" />Nile reuki le kiina bangdung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:7">Nile reu mui ga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:7">nah Nile tai mei luhdung ga lingpwa kebam leu ki dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:7">nah guipwa tet di eh magede bam ta dizie.<verse eid="ISA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 19:8" />Heka ketuime mra nah hap zie, nah Nile gage kagwak keling kegaime leune hapzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:8">nah dui gage helang sam kegaime suisia zie.<verse eid="ISA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 19:9" />Flax gade langcimpai tei kempetme nah pai keha dak kelame swagah dizie.<verse eid="ISA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 19:10" />Egypt ga pai dak kelame de teimsia dizie; ma hityei kelame leune penui lung keherei dizie.<verse eid="ISA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 19:11" />Zoan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zoan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Egypt nam sumbe.</char></note> ga hegwangnadung au mie cangsiak. Pharaoh puisau tei kela citumedung sam de kemta ge dida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:11">Nang dainzwa eh, “Ih au ma kecime na, nda hegwangme na ge?” Lie eh Pharaoh dage rang lulai.<verse eid="ISA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 19:12" />Ciucai nnui gu makecime daiga lano?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:12">Peu penuide ndage rang beulu nah reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Egyptme ziemne daige riem pwabam bi peu cilu.<verse eid="ISA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 19:13" />Zoan ga hegwangnadung au mie dida, Memphis ga hegwangnadung de cwa dida; penui heleuhdung gu kimiaktsudung ne Egypt de peu lampui kemak gage ngngwa gai dida.<verse eid="ISA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 19:14" />RAMPAUBE ngngwa kesia rabe penui kakga ge kaigai beu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:14">nah penui tei kegai leune Egypt de lampui kemak gage teu gaidi, cine sakmie kelume nzwa tanglia eh pekatei pe mrui ga kaumie bam dida.<verse eid="ISA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 19:15" />Egypt ziemne magede teilu kera gah da, keheime mede kegahme, pekiak mede hekuu de. <verse eid="ISA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 19:16" />Cipau nai, Egyptmedung mipuidung nzwa dizie. Penui mbeu nah ngngi dizie kedanemene reugwame reu RAMPAUBE penui reu gage pe ba hwa kegaine. <verse eid="ISA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 19:17" />Judahme deu Egypt ziemne kehing ge dizie. Mi keheibe de pe ha rang kegai dau, penui ngngi dizie, kedanemene RAMPAUBE penuide mcau kera riem pwa kebam de ziemne. <verse eid="ISA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 19:18" />Cipau benai Egypt namdi mengei ga canaanme let rang dizie nah reugwame reu RAMPAUBE dade samsang kera sampet lu. Aipaudung de ket zi Tingnaimiak Namdi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tingnaimiak Namdi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">makengkap namdi.</char></note> de qu zie.<verse eid="ISA 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 19:19" />Cipau nai Egypt deu sum ga RAMPAUBE de reca kepeu bam ge bamzie, nah deurai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Deurai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rampaube ne deurai zie.</char></note> gage RAMPAUBE zi gade tsusum ge sum gai zie. <verse eid="ISA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 19:20" />Cide Egypt deu ga reugwame reu RAMPAUBE zierang nah saulia ge zie. Penuide teikeherei kelame penuide teiherei kegaidau RAMPAUBE dage hapgai, iciu eh Pa kelikebeube ge nah gumkebeube ge langgai beu zie, nah Pa penuide kelilu zie. <verse eid="ISA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 19:21" />Egypt ga RAMPAUBE de ci gwang dizie, nah cipau nai Egyptme RAMPAUBE kebam ci luzie. Penui ratak nah mapeudung teu eh reca zie, nah RAMPAUBE dage sampetdung teigai zie nah cidungde teicang luzie. <verse eid="ISA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 19:22" />RAMPAUBE Egypt de teikeherei zie, teikeherei nah teingkei gaizie. Penui RAMPAUBE da nreu gwang zie; pa penui kekie kingnei luzie, nah penui de teingkei beuzie.<verse eid="ISA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 19:23" />Cipaunai Egypt gade Assyria ga puidi ge bam dizie, nah Assyriame Egypt ga gwang zie, nah Egyptme Assyria ga; nah Egyptme Assyriame de ngngwa reca ncüt dizie. <verse eid="ISA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 19:24" />Cipau nai, Israel au Egypt penai Assyria de ngngwa dih nsam dizie, nah kideu pelane ziemne samlam ge dizie; <verse eid="ISA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 19:25" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE penuide samlam beu zie nah rang eh, “Samlam kepung Egypt, a minadung; Assyria, a ba le tei kelu; nah Israel, a mapwamedung.”<verse eid="ISA 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ISA 20" />
  <para style="s">Egypt penai Cush de Kemmau Caiha ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 20:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">20:1 </char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">Tartan </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">muiteube ditube.</char>
    </note> Ashdod ga Tartan kegwang bekum, Assyria gwangpei Sargon ne pecu lang kegaidau, pa Ashdod de renia nah ngamlu. <verse eid="ISA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 20:2" />Cidau RAMPAUBE Amoz napei Isaiah da de rang eh, “Miecu nah n kia gade rosopai de lwakdi, nah n pi gade picum keu di.” Pa cinzwa teilu, paaula eh nah picum pung mene tetla di. <verse eid="ISA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 20:3" />RAMPAUBE rang eh, “A kilabe Isaiah mmi kecum pe picum pung mene nah paaula eh tet kegwangde au, cide au Egypt penai Cush ziemne marengei ge, <verse eid="ISA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 20:4" />ainzwa eh Assyria gwangpei Egypt gade tui kelume nah Cushme pak kelame hecing hena paula nah picum pung mene nah penui ndang gum mene, Egyptme de tei hengam gai kera. <verse eid="ISA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 20:5" />Penui lungpang nah ngngam dizie, kedanemene penui Cushme da keregui bam nah Egyptme le penui gie tei kelane. <verse eid="ISA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 20:6" />Cipau nai duikung ga lungh kelame rang zie, ‘Kesang, aide anui keregui da, kengha ziemne cika anui pakkai da Assyria gwangpei dade anuide gumlu beu kera, nah cu, anui dainzwa pak lulai?’”<verse eid="ISA 20:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ISA 21" />
  <para style="s">Edom de Kemmau Caiha ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 21:1" />Jaaidi kung ga hetaideu ziemne ndu kegai ge. (Tinggwang dade marengei kengau).</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:1">Heratingkai Negev gui kah kegwang nzwa cide gwang zie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:1">renaamkang kahgwang zie, kehing deu gade gwang zie.<verse eid="ISA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 21:2" />Ih zaisiet teugwang kera rengei ge ngau da:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:2">pezai kesiabe ma tei msia, nah tei kengkappe matei ngkap eh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:2">Hang cu nah regi cu, Elam; twagwalu, Media;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:2">Ih pe riedung pelane tei mtak dizie da.<verse eid="ISA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 21:3" />Ciziemne a kia de teei dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:3">mipui ge kemna tetteei nzwa eh ada bam dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:3">Ih kesiu dene acu keheu dida; Ih kengau dene acu kebwak dida.<verse eid="ISA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 21:4" />A mlung keherei dida; Ih hing eh mbeu di.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:4">Ih peu tinghegi gwang neu bam dida, dede cide acu kengngi teugwang beu.<verse eid="ISA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 21:5" />Penui taktyeibam mteilu, bamkamdung kamlwe ma tyei saklu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:5">cuhlu, hegwangnadung, nnui geudung maca keniaklu.<verse eid="ISA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 21:6" />Aide Tinggwang ne a dage rang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:6">“Mie, reketme ge kai nzeulu; pa kengaudung paubeu maisia.<verse eid="ISA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 21:7" />Pa minadung bagi, mina hangnana hekwendung, utdung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:7">nah gadadung reu gade kegwang ngau cai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:7">pa cidungde pie siakte lu maisia mriakmrak eh.”<verse eid="ISA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 21:8" />Kekwabe sah gai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:8">“Kedibo, Ih tingba ramsangne reketbam ga sap kwa bamla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:8">nah tingmui zie pelane a bam ga sap eh kwa bam.”<verse eid="ISA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 21:9" />Hekwen bagi ge mige ne teu gwangla nah hekwen keteume hangna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:9">Pa sah gai, “Babylon kau dida, kau dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:9">nah penui reca kela rabe mamiedung hangdeu ga pang bam dida.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 14:8, 18:2</char></note><verse eid="ISA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 21:10" />A mina neu nah gui kelumedung, a hecaipung bam namedung!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:10">Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang dade Ih dai siulu di bi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:10">Ih n dage ndugai da.<verse eid="ISA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 21:11" />Dumah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dumah: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edom</char></note> ha ndu kegai ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:11">mige Seir<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Seir: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edom kenlwetle bie</char></note> gade acu qu eh cu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:11">“Kekwabo, tingmui zie daitei ge bam reu no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:11">Kekwabo, tingmui zie daitie ge bam reu no?”<verse eid="ISA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 21:12" />Kekwabe rang eh, “Tingcang gwang kela nzwa tingmui de gwang la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:12">Nang keteu neu cai keteu lu, nah gwang dai lu.”<verse eid="ISA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arabia de Kemmau Caiha ge</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 21:13" />Arabia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Arabia: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hetaideu</char></note> ha ndu kegai ge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:13">Nnui Dedanme hebeu tei kela maadung, Arabia hetaideu ga nnui zeu mtaklu.<verse eid="ISA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 21:14" />Hereu kelame ziemne dui pwagwang beu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:14">Tema deu ga lungh kebamme, pakkelame de redau lu eh tangku pwa peulo.<verse eid="ISA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 21:15" />Kedanemene penui kingtie dade, kingtie pwa hwa kebam dade,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:15">lakpi kapgai kera mteipwa kebam gade, hereu kengngi pelane gade pak la. <verse eid="ISA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 21:16" />Aide ziemne Rampaube adage ranggai, “Mmi ge gage, mmi ge ziemne mata tei kera likelube nzwa eh ngau zie, Kedar leuhme kendu de cang dizie. <verse eid="ISA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 21:17" />Kedar reugwame Lakpi kepwame kecamnage gwale bam ta dizie,” kedanemene RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang rangdi delu.<verse eid="ISA 21:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ISA 22" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem ha caiha ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 22:1" />Marengei Langkam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Marengei Langkam: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jerusalem</char></note> ha ndu ge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:1">Daipai kie ziemne nnui pelane ki reu ga nghang cio dino?<verse eid="ISA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 22:2" />Iciu eh nang namdi ga mina suiyi kwa le puih kebam kwa siulu kera ziemne ni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:2">N minadung kingtie gade tsaima, nah penui hereu gade tsaima.<verse eid="ISA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 22:3" />Nnui reu kedihme pelane pakdi, dede lakpitsi gede kapgai mene penuide tuihlu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:3">Penui kemdei pak mie dide, Penui pelane de tuih ncütlu.<verse eid="ISA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 22:4" />Ciziemne Ih rangdi, “Acu pie helo, I hapsüt di zielu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:4">a leuhme napuime de tei msia kedine acu kemak kera tei helo.”<verse eid="ISA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 22:5" />Cika tingbazie ge bam makwa kehebwak ge, lungrei nah hengngam ge reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ne aide langgai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:5">Mangdak Langkam ga, namdi be kiriedung kaudi zeu dida, nah minadung lamlwadung gage sah mra gaizie.<verse eid="ISA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 22:6" />Elam lakpitsibung keupung lu, hekwen bagi tet kelame nah hekwen reu cwa kelame de ngngwalu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:6">nah Kir namdi hegeu de gum ma.<verse eid="ISA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 22:7" />Peting gwang zie nnui suitube langkam dungga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:7">hekwen bagidung puih dizie, nah hekwen (cwa) kepung kelame herieki ga penui saplu zie.<verse eid="ISA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 22:8" />Pa Judah de kegum dungde keugi di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:8">nah nnui cipaunai Hegung Hegwangbam ga hereunetdung de piegai.<verse eid="ISA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 22:9" />Nnui David namdi de, kekiee ge tiep kebam ngau,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:9">nah tekwa ngkangbe gade nnui dui hekwalu.<verse eid="ISA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 22:10" />Nnui Jerusalem ga kidung peilu, nah nnui herie hekwa kerane kidung rah di.<verse eid="ISA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 22:11" />Kirie kena kakgage tekwa kehegwabe dui kai nzeulu kerane tekwa teilu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:11">Dede nnui namdi tei kera cet kebeube de cetgai ma, pa ndaa de cetpwa ladi da.<verse eid="ISA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 22:12" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang cipaunai qugai</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:12">hap kerane, heilu kerane, peu taidi kerane nah rosopai ba kerane.<verse eid="ISA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 22:13" />Dede pielu, cinzwa meliene, henui tei, hengyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:13">hetum, nah meurün teitsetlwe langtyei, nah zausak; anui tyeisak lugo, kedanemene ncünne anui tsaidi zielu.<verse eid="ISA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 22:14" />Aide a kwen gage reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ranglia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:14">“Aipau mau de au gibeu gailak, nang tsai kecu dau de,” Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ranggai.<verse eid="ISA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 22:15" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, aide rang, “Shebna, hegwangki pie kerengeibe dage mie ranglo,<verse eid="ISA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 22:16" />‘Nang aika daitei zeuno nah caune ncu n rau bungh lulo beu no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:16">kecehu ga herau su eh nah tangtsu ga kemtak ni ge bungh eh?’”<verse eid="ISA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 22:17" />Pielo, Tinggwang ncu kelien gidi zieda, kengking mina; pa ncu herak ntiprip lwe kelien (heling) ngkei zie da.<verse eid="ISA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 22:18" />Pa ncu teu kerui rui eh nsuiduikang ge nzwa deudi langkie gage kelien gai dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:18">Cikade nang tsaidi zie, nah ngu kemdu hekwen bagidung de cika bam zie; nang n mpaube kelak de de tei hengam zie!<verse eid="ISA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 22:19" />“Ih n diki gade nah n bam kehu gade. Ncu teu ngkau dizie.<verse eid="ISA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 22:20" />Cide nai gwang sangne Ih a kilabe Hilkiah napei Eliakim de qugai zie.<verse eid="ISA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 22:21" />Ih n kedi paini pecu kaibeu zie nah n kiakang pecu peuzie, nah n kengking kebam pecu peu dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:21">Pa Jerusalem ga kelungme pei tei zie nah Judahme ki gade si eh.<verse eid="ISA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 22:22" />Ih David ki cabi pe hekeutu gage kai dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:22">pa ne ngkei zie, nah migede ngkui gailak; pa ne ngkui zie, nah migede ngkei gailak.<verse eid="ISA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 22:23" />Ih pecu kang ntiprip dizie, kegwak ge pe bamga ntiprip eh bam kelanzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:23">nah pa au pe pei kiga hetwa kepung bamge dizie.<verse eid="ISA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 22:24" />Penui pe pei kiga hetwa kepung leune pecu mpüt beuzie, hename nah heleuhdung, mabung keceu leu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:24">duipiak gade hepiak kedi cang. <verse eid="ISA 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 22:25" />Cipau nai, aide reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne ndu kegai, magwak ntiprip eh kebam de sia dizie, kau dizie, nah cika hepüt kerüt kebam de kau dizie, kedanemene RAMPAUBE rang kebeune.<verse eid="ISA 22:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ISA 23" />
  <para style="s">Tyre de Kemmau Caiha ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 23:1" />Tyre ha ndu kegai ge:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Mralu, Tarshish ga liemdung; ki nah liemtaubam gah da,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Cyprus<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cyprus: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kittim</char></note> deu gade penuide peu ci dida.<verse eid="ISA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 23:2" />Zing delu, duidi kungga kelunghmedung, Sidon ga heli keteimedung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:2">jaaidi ga hebeuh tei kelame ne nnui reu puih dida.<verse eid="ISA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 23:3" />Dui kedi reu gade Shihor mei gwang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:3">Nile reukung gade penui tah kelu nah luhlüt keludung le;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:3">heleuh pelane teu helila teidi.<verse eid="ISA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 23:4" />Ngngamlu, Sidon; jaaidi rang dida, jaaidi kengkingbe. Pa rang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:4">“Ih madaude a na lungh ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:4">Ih madaude a napeidung mede a napuidung de nkwet cuh ma.”<verse eid="ISA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 23:5" />Egypt ga Tyre ha ci gwang lude, penuide penui sui sia dizie.<verse eid="ISA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 23:6" />Tarshish gage tet gailu; haplu, dui kedi kungh ga kelungmedung.<verse eid="ISA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 23:7" />N dage aide teigai nei, suiyi namdi, ndaa de bamla kela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:7">penui pile kemdei sangme deu ga mie lungh di kera?<verse eid="ISA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 23:8" />Caune Tyre nam de renia eh aide riam lu no, peurwadung peu kelabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:8">heliketei gwangdung, heli keteime kideu ga hetwa kepungme.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:1">Eze. 28:1</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 28:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 28:6-8">6-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 23:9" />Penui hegie nah penui kemdu pelane tei hena di kerane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:9">reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne cide riemlu kideu ga hetwa kepungme de hengam tei kerane.<verse eid="ISA 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 23:10" />Tarshishme Nile kungga hangdeu puhlwe kelung nzwa, nnui deu puhlu. Tyre ga cu au litakni ketei gah da.<verse eid="ISA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 23:11" />Tinggwang jaaidi reu gage pe ba hwagai lwe hegwangramdung kecung dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:11">Phoeniciame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Phoeniciame: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Canaan</char></note> ziemne pa aja ge kaigai, kengking bamdung de tei msiadi kerane.<verse eid="ISA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 23:12" />Pa rangdi, “Nnui suiyi dai lakta, Sidon ga relei kemci keherei kebamme;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:12">cuhlu, Cyprus ga mie cu; dede cikade nnui mtak lak.”<verse eid="ISA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 23:13" />Chaldeeme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Chaldeeme: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Babel</char></note> deu de pielo. Aipaume cang dida; Assyriame ne cide makaune ziemne hetaideu ge tei dida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:13">Penui gwakelu reneidung kwalu; hegwangkidung tei msiadi; penui cide ralie ge teidi.<verse eid="ISA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 23:14" />Mralu, Tarshish ga liemdung; kedanemene nnui liemtaubam tei msia dida. <verse eid="ISA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 23:15" />Cipau nai Tyre de mmi riakhena nsungta dizie, hegwangme ge tingba dau nzwa eh. Mmi riakhena cang kedi cai Tyre au lei ga helipui de nzwa dizie.<verse eid="ISA 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 23:16" />N leibung pwalu, namdi ga rwa mie cu, nsungta kedi nang helipoi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:16">kwa hemi gai, lei kekiee teigai, ncu nsunglu kerane. <verse eid="ISA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 23:17" />Mmi riakhena cang dide, RAMPAUBE Tyre de ngha beu zie, nah pa helipui ta tei eh rangkang teidai zie, nah pa kideu ga hegwangram pelane dage pecu ligai zie. <verse eid="ISA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 23:18" />Pa heli tei mmi nah gie kelube RAMPAUBE de kai ntsam beu dizie. Pa cidungde kebau gailak, pa gie kelube RAMPAUBE de reca kelame de peu dizie nah taktyei kekiee penuide pwa peulu kerane teulu zie nah iciu eh paiheni yitube lulu kerane.<verse eid="ISA 23:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ISA 24" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube Kideube de Teimtadi kera</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 24:1" />Pielo, Tinggwang kideu tei mta di lau da, cide ngkapdi kera, cide peureu teimsiadi, nah cika kelungme de teuzangra di kera.<verse eid="ISA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 24:2" />Cide cinzwa gwangzie, mina da, cingkume da;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:2">nkwetme da nzwa, penui mpaume dade;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:2">nkwetpuime da nzwa, pe mpau puime dade;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:2">keluime da nzwa, kezwa dade;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:2">hepok kebeume de nzwa, hepok kelume dade;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:2">pekai keu kelame nzwa, pekai kepeume dade.<verse eid="ISA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 24:3" />Kideu teimsia nah tei nggah cangsiak dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:3">RAMPAUBE aipau sam de rangdi de kecune.<verse eid="ISA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 24:4" />Hangdeube cang nah ki dida, kideube mnei cuh nah huidi zeuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:4">kideu ga kenlangme kemta tei dida.<verse eid="ISA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 24:5" />Hangdeu ga kelungme ne tei hera dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:5">kedanemene penui hezai gikah, kesangbe teilu tadi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:5">nah kelungta samkak kelube teipangdi delu.<verse eid="ISA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 24:6" />Ciziemne reset ne kideu de mnwa lu nah cika kelunghme petau kemak ngau.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:6">Kideu ga kelunghme de ru cuhdi nah mina kiee kemak ge gwale tadi.<verse eid="ISA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 24:7" />Zau kehecibe cang di zeuda, kubebang de ki dida, pesuiyi kela leune mra dida.<verse eid="ISA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 24:8" />Suiyi tambourine kwa nah kenlwa suiyi kwa mtak dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:8">nah lyre suiyi dede mtakdi.<verse eid="ISA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 24:9" />Penui zau sak eh lei tei meda nah zau de sak kegaime dade ka dida.<verse eid="ISA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 24:10" />Kebwak kebam namdi de pang dida, ki leune ngkuilwe nah mrwa dida.<verse eid="ISA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 24:11" />Lampui gadung zau ziemne kehap bam dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:11">suiyi pelane mui dida, kideu ga suiyi de bam ta dida.<verse eid="ISA 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 24:12" />Namdi be ga zing de dida, nah herieki de pangmsia dida.<verse eid="ISA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 24:13" />Kedanemene kideu pelane ga deudidung ga ainzwa dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:13">olive bang dap kegai nzwa, kubetsi raidi eh pe dang pa kelanzwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 24:14" />Penui kwa mrung sahbak eh kengkieng RAMPAUBE de eh sah</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:14">nah jaaidi gade de suiyi kwa sah zie.<verse eid="ISA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 24:15" />Cine naimiak kepetle Tinggwang de hetwa peu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:15">nah jaaidi kung ga kelungme RAMPAUBE Israelme Tinggwang zi hetwa peu zie.<verse eid="ISA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 24:16" />Hangdeu mdeitu le de anui lei kwa ge siu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">“Hetwa peu lu kemzeu be de.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">Dede I rangla, “I tei ngkap dida, I tei ngkap dida, I keregui gah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">Samsang kemakme dage samsang kemak ta teigai da;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">yeo, samsang kemakme dage siasüt eh teigai da.”<verse eid="ISA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 24:17" />Kehing, hekwa nah baih nnui da bam, kideu ga kelung medung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:35">Luk. 21:35</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 24:18" />Caugame keheu kecu kwa siuhing eh pak labi, hekwa ga cakmie zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:18">nah hekwa sum gade mpet kelume, hebai gega keu dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:18">Tinggim bakidung ngkei zie nah kideu bangbe mbeu dizie.<verse eid="ISA 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 24:19" />Kideu be teipang cang dizie, nah pang kecai dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:19">kideu teu msiasüt dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 1:5">Nah. 1:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 24:20" />Kideu be sak kemieme nzwa tetkenok dizie nah haki ge nlai mpet nlüt kelanzwa dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:20">Pe mau kerüt dene kaudi eh cuhdai gailak dizie.<verse eid="ISA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 24:21" />Cipau benai RAMPAUBE tinggimdung reu tinggim reugwame de saja peuzie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:21">nah kideu ga hegwangme dede.<verse eid="ISA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 24:22" />Penui de hekwa ncüt lu eh, hekwaki gage hebaang teilwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:22">nah hebaangki ge gage kai cio dizie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:22">nah peting ketie caine penuide saja peuzie.<verse eid="ISA 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 24:23" />Iciu eh hekei ngngam dizie, nah tingnaimiak de hetwa pung tadi zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:23">kedanemene Zion Deutu nah Jerusalem ga reugwame reu RAMPAUBE hegwang tei dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:23">nah hangkiame dwagade pe kemdu ngau dizie.<verse eid="ISA 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ISA 25" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube de Twalu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 25:1" />RAMPAUBO, nang au a Tinggwang; Ih ncu rüt zie, Ih n zi de twa zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:1">kedanemene nang miswakegahdung teigai, petau cangsiak kecu kenlum gade ndaa ge de riem teu keladung de.<verse eid="ISA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 25:2" />Kedanemene nang namdi de pwa ralie tei dida, kengking namdi be, ngkap dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:2">nah sang cikemakme riekelu namdi de namdi tei meda.<verse eid="ISA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 25:3" />Cine mina kengkiengme ncu twa zie; ngaugia kegah namdi ga heleuhdung ncu hing zie.<verse eid="ISA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 25:4" />Kedanemene nang kegahme de gum kwak kebeu ni ge lu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">keherei kebamme ge teu maikesia kegumbe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">rahang gade gum kebeube nah tingcie gade sung kebeube.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">Ngaugiakegah cuingi de au rahang ge hangbie de ketang kecu dau nzwa,<verse eid="ISA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 25:5" />nah kideu kecang ga kelum nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:5">nang sangme kwadung tei nggah dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:5">hemwa sung ne tingkelum de tei nggahdi kelanzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:5">iciu eh ngaugia kegahmedung lei de tei samli peu beuzie.<verse eid="ISA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 25:6" />Aipau deutu gage reugwame reu RAMPAUBE mina leune ziemne maca taktyei ngyi ge tei zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:6">pesuibe zaudung, kenciep heteihdung, zau yitube ngyi ge.<verse eid="ISA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 25:7" />Pa aipau lamlwa gade minadung reu gumpung kebamde ngkap dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:7">heleuh pelane reuga kebam him kebam ra de.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:18">Eph. 4:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 25:8" />Pa ketsai de kelunghta mnwa dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:8">nah RAMPAUBE Tinggwang minadung zu gade miakduidung neu dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:8">kideu pelane gade pa pe minadung hengam de keugi dizie, kedanemene RAMPAUBE rang dide kecune.<verse eid="ISA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 25:9" />Cipau nai rang zie, “Pielo, aide anui Tinggwang da; anui pecu kwabam, nah pa anuide keli luzie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:9">Aide au RAMPAUBE; anui pecu kwabam, pe kelikelu gade anui suiyi nah renga zie.”<verse eid="ISA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 25:10" />Kedanemene aipau RAMPAUBE Zion deutu gum luzie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:10">dede Moab de au pe bam gage dau kau dizie, reigau de hekwaki makaune teu le kaipui kebam gage dau ketangdi kela nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 25:11" />Cipau kakgade penui penui ba hwacuh zie, dui kezakme ge gade zak kera pe ba hwacuh kela nzwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:11">Dede RAMPAUBE penui ngang kela de tei hena dizie penui ba ciem keyi penui da lalie de.<verse eid="ISA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 25:12" />N kuda riekelu tsukwa kehudung de hangdeu gage tei ngkau dizie, rebui gage.<verse eid="ISA 25:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ISA 26" />
  <para style="s">Ketwalei ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 26:1" />Cipaunai Judah deuga aipau lei de teigai zie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:1">Anuida namdi kengkieng ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">namdi kengkieng ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jerusalem</char></note> bam; Tinggwang ne tangdeu dungde kelikelu teilu.<verse eid="ISA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 26:2" />Kiriedung ngkeilu, iciu eh kenlum kaineu kela masang kela heleuhbe lütlu kerane.<verse eid="ISA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 26:3" />RAMPAUBO, helung n da kaipwa kebambe de, nang pecu lungciep yicangsiak kecu kai luzie, kedanemene pa ncu nlum kelane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:7">Php. 4:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 26:4" />Kelungta RAMPAUBE de nlumlu; kedanemene RAMPAUBE au kelungta tsurabe da.<verse eid="ISA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 26:5" />Kedanemene pa ngang eh lungh kelame de tei henah dizie; riekelu namdi de</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:5">pa teungkau dizie, pa hangdeu gage teungkau dizie; pa cide rebui nsam gage tei dizie.<verse eid="ISA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 26:6" />Cide kegahme pi ne nah teumai kesiame pikiet ne daucim dizie.<verse eid="ISA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 26:7" />Masang kelame lampui au mzui, Masang kela RAMPAUBO; nang masang kelame lampui tei mzuila.<verse eid="ISA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 26:8" />Yeo, n tutiak lampui ga, RAMPAUBO, anui ncu kwabam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:8">n zi nah n kendu de au anui hengin da.<verse eid="ISA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 26:9" />Ih tingmuidau ncu reguila; yeo, a lungga a rabe ncu lungsang gade peeila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:9">Kedanemene n tutiakdung kideu ga kegwangdau, kideu ga kelunghme n masang ci lula.<verse eid="ISA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 26:10" />Tinggwang kesiame dage ngaugia keulia la, dede pa masangbe ci gailak. Pa samsang kecu deuga pa peta sia sütla</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:10">nah RAMPAUBE kendu kedide ngau lama.<verse eid="ISA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 26:11" />RAMPAUBO, n ba au hwacuh bam, dede penui ngau lama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">Dede n ngauraume n minadung ziemne leu dila kemak zaide ngau zie nah ngngam dizie, kedanemene n ngauraume miheu dene penuide mnua luzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mic. 5:9, Heb. 10:27</char></note><verse eid="ISA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 26:12" />RAMPAUBO, anui ziemne nang kezuyibe teugwang beuzie; kedanemene, nang au anui ziemne heta leune teicang beu delu.<verse eid="ISA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 26:13" />RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang, nang kemak keda mpaume ne anui reu kedi teigwang; dede anui n zi rünne twala.<verse eid="ISA 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 26:14" />Penui au tsai dida, penui au ring gailak; penui au tsai kedime, penui au cuh dailak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:14">Kesang, nang tutiak teigwang nah penuide ngkapdi, nah penuide nsungkela leune teingah dida.<verse eid="ISA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 26:15" />Nang heleuhbe de teingkiee gai, RAMPAUBO, nang heleube de teingkiee gai; ncu herüt peula;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:15">nang hangdeube rai leune teimdi gai beuda.<verse eid="ISA 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 26:16" />RAMPAUBO, keherei kecudau penui ncu piegai; nang penuide ledeu kegaidau penui kekie teila.<verse eid="ISA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 26:17" />Telak kela puige mna kera tingba gwang nna dige,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:17">pa keherei kecudau nah kemna tet teei tei eh hap dila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:17">cinzwa eh Rampaubo, anuide n dwaga bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 48:6">Lei. 48:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 26:18" />Anui tetlakla dida, anui kehereila dida, dede anui tingkai de nna gai kecuge gwale sima. Anui kideu gage kelikelu teugwang gaima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:18">nah kideu ga kelunghme kau dima.<verse eid="ISA 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 26:19" />N mina tsai kedime ring luzie; penui ketsaipaaudung ringcuh luzie. Rebui ga lungh kebammedung, mraklu nah suiyi lei teilu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">kedanemene n hezin au kebaa zin, nah kideube ketsaime de teucuh luzie.<verse eid="ISA 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 26:20" />Miecu, a minadung, nnui kibungdung ga lütlu eh nnui caiga kikamdung ngkui di;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:20">tingkakge mbailu, RAMPAUBE rata kahdi kemaktane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 91:4, 32:7</char></note><verse eid="ISA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 26:21" />Kedanemene, pielo, RAMPAUBE pe bam gade tetpet eh kideu ga kelunghme de penui kesia ziemne saja peulai eh gwangla dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:21">kideube hejai lwa kegaide peei mpet gaizie, nah daptset kedime de kebai nzeu sita dizie.<verse eid="ISA 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ISA 27" />
  <para style="s">Israel de lungkempet</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 27:1" />Cipaunai RAMPAUBE pe ketak, kedi kengkieng kiengtie teu eh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:1">Neidi de saja peuzie, nlai kebam heneide de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:1">nah pa jaaidi ga kebam neidide de teitset dizie.<verse eid="ISA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 27:2" />Cipaunai: Kubetsiluh ge pe lei teizie.<verse eid="ISA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 27:3" />“Ih, RAMPAUBE, cide kegumbe; Ih cide de dui hetau mui bamla.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:3">Ih tingmui tingba cide de kwala migede cide de tei rejam dilak kera.<verse eid="ISA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 27:4" />Ih a rata ma, Oh, cide acu pe tudung nah pe kiakdung peu lacai!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:4">Ih penuide hereu gade gwaketang zie; Ih penui pelane de runcüt dizie;<verse eid="ISA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 27:5" />A ngauraume acu peu gum kebeude ga ntip bamlu mecai nah acu ngngwa kezuyilu kemakta; penuide peu acu kezuyi lulo.<verse eid="ISA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 27:6" />Gwangkela tingba ga, Jacob pe mah him luzie; Israel pe nei bwa luzie nah pa luzie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:6">nah penui kideu zu ga petsi le kepui tei luzie.”<verse eid="ISA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 27:7" />Tinggwang pecu reniakela leuh dungde kerenia nzwa Jacob penai Israel de reniadi deni? Heleuh dungde penui ne teitset kedinzwa Jacob penai Israel de teitsetdi deni?<verse eid="ISA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 27:8" />Anui pe mdet petausiak gade renia da, Jacob penai pe minadung de lang gidi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lang gidi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">deudi gade gwadi</char></note> eh; pa pe cuingi kehingde teu penuide gwagi di, naimiak kepetle tingkai kegui benai.<verse eid="ISA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 27:9" />Ainzwa eh Jacob gu kemauta de teimci beuzie, kedanemene aide le pe mau keugidi kera tsibe zielu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:9">pa recabam tsukangdung chalk kang nzwa tiedi eh niak kecai dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:9">nah herabepui Asherah miedung mede perim kehengui recabamdung gede sap bamlak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom. 11:27</char></note><verse eid="ISA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 27:10" />Kedanemene riekelu namdibe de gidi da, kelungh bamde mta mrwa dida nah pütkedi hetaideu de nzwa dida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:10">Cika hetumna ma peei tyei nah zeu eh pe kiakdung tyeila la.<verse eid="ISA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 27:11" />Tsingkiak hui kedidau, cidungde cum dizie. Mipuidung gwang cidungde pwa mi teizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:11">kedanemene mina aidungde macilu kebuime melu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:11">Cine penuide Damkegaibe penui Tinggwang penuide kulak, nah penuide tei kegaibe Tinggwang penuide ngaunggia lak.<verse eid="ISA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 27:12" />Cipaunai</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:12">RAMPAUBE Euphrate Reuki gade Wadi Egypt ga kecang ciumei neu luzie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:12">nah nnui, Israelme, hangge ge eh hekwa ncüt luzie.<verse eid="ISA 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 27:13" />Cipaunai telui kedi ge kwagai zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:13">nah Assyria deuga gah kedimedung gwang zie, nah Egypt deuga mina gwagi kedimedung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:13">penui Jerusalem kemci deutu ga RAMPAUBE de reca zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:31">Mat. 24:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 27:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ISA 28" />
  <para style="s">Ephraim da kehing</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 28:1" />Ephraim zausak kelame dungne kekai kehegie peurwa, nah huidi kezeu kendu mapa de ziemne suisiet ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:1">mapa peurwa hangdeu keyi Langkam ga zau ne ngam kedime peu ga kebam!<verse eid="ISA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 28:2" />Ainie, Rampaube kengkieng nah kedige de langgai la; tangheu cui nah kengkap tingkai cui ge nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:2">tingrui cui ge nah puikenlim duidung nzwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:2">nah pa kendu peurwa ramsang kideu gage kelien nghung dizie.<verse eid="ISA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 28:3" />Ephraim zausak kemieme kehelia peurwa de mi pidau tei dizie.<verse eid="ISA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 28:4" />Ma lungh keyi langkam peuga pe kendu pa huidi kezeude,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:4">tinglum dwa tangzüttsi meu keraibe nzwa, mige cide ngau eh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:4">pe ba ga kebamdau, pa mnua lula.<verse eid="ISA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 28:5" />Cipaunai pe mina bang kelumedung ziemne reugwame reu RAMPAUBE hezu keyi peurwa ge nah pe mina depeu nusunglu kera kendu peukangria ge dizie,<verse eid="ISA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 28:6" />tutiak bam ga kebamme ziemne teu kensam rabe ge, nah penui riekidung ga ngauraume de gwacaili kedimedung ziemne kengkieng ge.<verse eid="ISA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 28:7" />Dede aidungde liede zau gade tet mlia la, nah kengkieng zau gade tanglia la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">Cingkupei nah caihakecibe kengkieng zau gade tetmlia la, nah zau ne penuide mnwa lula.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">Penui kengkieng zau gade tanglia la, mangdak gade nah kecet gade mnei eh.<verse eid="ISA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 28:8" />Kesangde, taktyeibamdung pelane penui mrui le gum pwabam, iciu eh kemci ni gede gah eh.<verse eid="ISA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 28:9" />Cau dage RAMPAUBE maci ledeu lai, nah cau dage pa sambe rangmci lialai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:9">Tungdui peu ta kedime dage mede tung gade keu kedime dage ni?<verse eid="ISA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 28:10" />Kedanemene cide aja reu aja, aja reu aja; peuteu reu peuteu, peuteu reu peuteu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:10">aika kieekemak ge, luga kieekemak ge.<verse eid="ISA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 28:11" />Kesangda, helet ketsam kerangme de teu eh pa mina aidung dage marang zie.<verse eid="ISA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 28:12" />Ndaa pa penui dage ranggai, “Aide kemtak, leu kelame de kemtak peulo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:12">nah aide teikemcang,” dede penui au kingnei lak<verse eid="ISA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 28:13" />Cine RAMPAUBE samde penui dage</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:13">aja reu aja, aja reu aja; peuteu reu peuteu, peuteu reu peuteu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:13">aika kieekemak ge, luga kieekemak ge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:13">iciu eh penui mie eh kau caili, nah pangdi eh, hetak gage keu, nah tuilu kerane.<verse eid="ISA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 28:14" />Cine nnui mide kii kelamedung, RAMPAUBE sam kingneilu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:14">nnui Jerusalem ga kebam mina aidungde reu kedi tei kelame.<verse eid="ISA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 28:15" />Aide teicang luzie kedanemene nnui rangla, “Anui ketsai de ngngwa samkak luda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:15">nah ketsaime deu de ngngwa samting luda. Cine ngkiengsüt kecu saja kah kegwangdau, anuida gwang canglak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:15">Kedanemene anui kemret ge keu anui kensiube teilu, nah petau kemak gage nsiulu.”<verse eid="ISA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 28:16" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE rangla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:16">“Ainie, Ih Zion gade tsubam ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:16">pemi kehung kimiak tsuge, bangdwa kesang ge kaigai zie. Nlum kelume ngngam dilak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom. 9:33, 1 Cor. 3:11, Eph. 2:20, 1 Pet. 2:4,6</char></note><verse eid="ISA 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 28:17" />Ih kemzuibe pwa kemdet tuitie teizie, nah makesangbe pwa mdet zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:17">Kemretdung gum kwak kebeu de tangheu ne diapung gi dizie nah duididung ne kembai bam de gumpung dizie.<verse eid="ISA 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 28:18" />Ketsai de ngngwa n samkak tei kelude nsungta dizie, nah ketsaime deu de ngngwa samting kelude sap bamlak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:18">Duidiet kah kegwangdau, nnuide gumpung dizie.<verse eid="ISA 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 28:19" />Cide kah kegwangdau, cide ne nnuide gumpung dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:19">nah tingcang cai tingcang cide kahgwang zie nah tingmui tingbadau cide gwang zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:19">Sambe ci keludau, cide kengkap teigai zie.<verse eid="ISA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 28:20" />Kedanemene mide nzanggai kera zeu be duizu nah pai be pecu kezui gai kera nrum zu.”<verse eid="ISA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 28:21" />RAMPAUBE Perazim Deutu nzwa cuhzie;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Sam. 5:20, 1 Hel. 14:11</char></note> pa Gibeon Langkam ge nzwa eh pekatei cuhzie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:21">pe ta tei kera,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jos. 10:10-11</char></note> pe tatei ketsam ge, nah pe ta ketsam teigai zie.<verse eid="ISA 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 28:22" />Cine nnui henui teiso, mecai nnui gu kangria de tei ntipki dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:22">Ih Rampaube reugwame reu RAMPAUBE dade kideube de ngkapdi kera hezai ge siuda. <verse eid="ISA 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 28:23" />Nnui lung kai eh a kwa kingneilu; mting eh a kwa kingneilu.<verse eid="ISA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 28:24" />Heta ketame ge heleuh gi kerane tingba pelane de hangdeu puh lani? Pa pe luh ga tangdei tei takcai bam jüja lani?<verse eid="ISA 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 28:25" />Heta ketame hangdeu mtei luge, caraway tsileuh teizang gaila meni, cumin linggai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:25">wheat pesau tei eh kaigai nah barley pebam petau gage, nah mei keda luh tudung gage?<verse eid="ISA 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 28:26" />Pe Tinggwang pecu ranglia la; pa pecu ledeu mteusüt beula.<verse eid="ISA 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 28:27" />Cipau reude, caraway tsileuh tsingtie kerüt ge le dap lama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:27">mede cumin tsileuh de keniak gari le niak lama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:27">dede caraway de tsingtie gele dap nah cumin de hegeutie gele dapla.<verse eid="ISA 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 28:28" />Meitsi au tangku ziemne taulu dede yi cangsiak ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:28">nah pe tum gari ta nah pe hekwendung cide teizang dide, pe hekwendung cide daumsiadi lama.<verse eid="ISA 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 28:29" />Aide de reugwame reu RAMPAUBE dade gwangla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:29">pa keledeudung au miswagah nah maci reu yicangsiak.<verse eid="ISA 28:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="ISA 29" />
  <para style="s">David namdi da kehing ge</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 29:1" />Ainie Ariel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ariel: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jerusalem</char></note> reuga suisiet, Ariel, David kebam namdi de!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:1">Mmi gecai mmi ge hekwalu; peu hengyi dungde gwanglu.<verse eid="ISA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 29:2" />Dede Ih Ariel de twagwa luzie, nah pa hap nah hei eh hap bamzie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:2">nah pa a ziemne Ariel nzwa zie.<verse eid="ISA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 29:3" />Ih ncu twagwalwe renia zie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:3">nah Ih ncu rietwagwa gwang zie, nah renia eh gumlu kera ta tei cuhzie.<verse eid="ISA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 29:4" />Ih ncu teingkau dizie nah nang hangdeu gade marang zie; kehenah rebui gade n samrang de gwang zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:4">N kwa rabe kwa ge hangdeu gade kerang nzwa zie, nah rebui gade n samrang rang mtei mene rangzie.<verse eid="ISA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 29:5" />N reugwame maadi rebui yitube nzwa dizie, nah ngaugia kegah hemaa maadidung ciurie gahdi kelabe nzwa dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:5">Cide peting keduinage ga zette eh tei dizie.<verse eid="ISA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 29:6" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:6">tingceu, nluiteu, makwa kwadi, tingkai keci nah rahang kesia, nah ngkapdi kera miheu teu nnuida gwang zie.<verse eid="ISA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 29:7" />Cide hemang ge nzwa zie, tingmui mangdak ge:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:7">Rwakela heleuh leune de Ariel</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:7">nah pe kengkiengde de renia zie. Penui pecu nah pe kengkieng bamdung de gwaketang zie.<verse eid="ISA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 29:8" />Cide kemzeume ge pe mangle de matyei kebam nzwa zie, dede pa mrakcuh de, pe za au mrwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:8">Cide hereu kelame ge pe mangle de kesak nzwa zie, dede pa mrak lude, pecai cita dizie, pe hereu gahdi mene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:8">Yeo, heleuh kekiee ge Zion Deutu de renia kelame cinzwa dizie.<verse eid="ISA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 29:9" />Nnui swagah eh nnui swagahsüt dilu; nnui katei nnui miakcit dilu nah cit lalu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:9">Sak mielu, dede zau le so; tanglialu, dede zau le so.<verse eid="ISA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 29:10" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnuide peu zipzing di kera rabe ruigai beu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:10">Pa nnui miakdung ngkuidi, caihakecime dungde, nah nnui peudung kezuidi, caiha kerangmedung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:8">Rom. 11:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ISA 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 29:11" />Keuliakegai leune nnui dade ngkui kedi laisiukwak samdung ge dida, cide minadung makecime depeu, rang eh, “Aide peilo,” de zie. Pa de rang eh, “Ih pei gailak, kedanemene cide ngkuidi delu,” de zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 5:1-3</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 29:12" />Magade laisiukwak pwa peigai kelakme de peugai eh, rang eh, “Aide peilo,” pa rangzie, “Ih pei gailak.”<verse eid="ISA 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 29:13" />Rampaube ranggai, “Mina aidungde pe mui gade a da gwang nna la</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:13">nah penui muileu gade acu rütla, dede penui mlung au a dade mdei la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:13">Penui acu kerüt au ledeu eh kaikebeu mina zai gade rünne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 15:8-9</char></note><verse eid="ISA 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 29:14" />Cine, pielu, Ih mina aidungde dage mning kemak ta ge teigai zie, miswakegah caide miswakegah ge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:14">Penui makecime maci de gah dizie nah penui kemteume ngang kela kecikecet dungde gah dizie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Cor. 1:19</char></note><verse eid="ISA 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 29:15" />Ainie penui mariemdung RAMPAUBE dade kebai ncok kelame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:15">nah penui batadung kemui ga kelame. Penui rangla, “Cau anuide ngau lano, nah cau anuide ci no?”<verse eid="ISA 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 29:16" />Nang maleune pwa kedet dida! Li keteibe de pwa lidei nzwa cetgai zieni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:16">iciu eh tei kelube nia ne tei kegaibe dade, “Pa ne acu tei ma,” de zieni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:16">mede mania tei kelube tei kegaibe dade, “Pa ci lama” de zieni?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:20">Rom. 9:20</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 9:21">21</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 29:17" />Matie mene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:17">Lebanon de teipwa luh ge tei dizie nah luh de hegung ge dizie.<verse eid="ISA 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 29:18" />Cipaunai kwenpangme laisiukwak samdung de siu luzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:18">nah muiting kecu gade miakcitme ngau luzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 11:5, Bat. 26:18</char></note><verse eid="ISA 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 29:19" />Mine keherei kelame RAMPAUBE gade pesui yidai luzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:19">nah mina kakgade kegahme Israel Kemcibe gade pesui yizie.<verse eid="ISA 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 29:20" />Ngaugia kegahme nli dizie, nah mide hegah kelame gah dizie. Ma kesiabe teineu kelame leune de teinggah dizie,<verse eid="ISA 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 29:21" />samkie ge gade migede tei mmaudi kelame. Penui pe ziemne hetak ge kainzeu la</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:21">pa kiriebe ga kemzuibe peeila nah masangbe de kemret le teingkau dila.<verse eid="ISA 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 29:22" />Cine ainzwa eh RAMPAUBE Jacob ki ha rangla, RAMPAUBE, Abraham de kelikelube,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:22">“Jacob depeu ngngam si lakta, nah pe zu depeu hamda la lakta.<verse eid="ISA 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 29:23" />Dede pa a bale teikelu pe name de kengaudau, penui a zide teimci zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:23">Penui Jacob Kemcibe zi teimci zie nah penui Israel Tinggwang de kerüt gade sapzie.<verse eid="ISA 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 29:24" />Rabe gade mau kelame keci kecet ngau luzie, nah mcam kelame maci luzie.”<verse eid="ISA 29:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="ISA 30" />
  <para style="s">Kengkoi leuh da kehing</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 30:1" />“Co renia kela namedung,” aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:1">“Penui au penui mariem riemlu, dede a dade ma; penui heleuh kedadung de ngngwa ket teilu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:1">dede penuide a rabe ne saubeu ma, cine penui kemau reuge ga kemau silu.<verse eid="ISA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 30:2" />Penui Egypt ga nghung kera tetcuh, dede a puisau de keteu ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:2">Pharaoh de peu penuide gumbeu kera peei, nah Egypt mie kangga nsiu.<verse eid="ISA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 30:3" />Cine Pharaoh gum kebeude nnuida hengam ge dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:3">nah Egypt mie kangga kensiu de, nnuide tei kehengam ge,<verse eid="ISA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 30:4" />penui hegwangnadung Zoan namdi ga bam liede, nah penui samgwame Hanes namdi ga gwang de.<verse eid="ISA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 30:5" />Penui pelane ngngam dizie kedanemene Egypt penuide ngha gai kelak ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:5">penui kengha mede kemmi gede peula kemakme, dede hengam ge, nah herüt kegah ge.”<verse eid="ISA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 30:6" />Tingbangle bie hetaideu ga makaunedung ha ndu kegai ge:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">Keherei nah kengngi deu ga hinghopui nah hinghoseu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">neidui nah henei kerabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">penui mahei gadadung cai gage pung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">nah penui mabamdung utdung reu gage pung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">penuide ngha gai kelakmedung dage.<verse eid="ISA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 30:7" />Kedanemene Egypt ngha de au pemi gah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:7">cine Ih pecu Rahab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rahab: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jaaidi neidi</char></note> lie qu, zing de bam kelabe.<verse eid="ISA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 30:8" />RAMPAUBE Isaiah dage rangbeu: Cu miecu, penui kebam gade tangtsukwak ge gage raulu, nah kehezui laisiukwak gage raulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:8">iciu eh cide kaipwa paucai ting ga zierang gelu kerane.<verse eid="ISA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 30:9" />Kedanemene aidungde kerenia minadung kenret namedung kecune,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:9">RAMPAUBE rang kebeudung kingnei kelak namedung.<verse eid="ISA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 30:10" />Penui marengei kengaume dage rangla, “Pie so;”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:10">nah caihakecime dade, “Caiha kesangbe anui dage rangso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:10">siu keyibe samdung anui dage ranglo, kesang kemak caihasam ranglo. <verse eid="ISA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 30:11" />Lampui gade mzialu, lampui gade mpet dilu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:11">peu Israel Kemcibe Tinggwang de anui dwa gade marang mtakti lu.”<verse eid="ISA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 30:12" />Cine Israel Kemcibe rangla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:12">“Kedanemene nnui sam aide luu kemakne</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:12">nah kemneu nah kecwa de nlum eh cide de ngngei kedine,<verse eid="ISA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 30:13" />cine aipau maude nnui da lazie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:13">pang kempet ge nghai mie kera mteikelu nzwa, kirie kehu ga makang ge</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:13">zette nghai kelwa mie kera nzwa.”<verse eid="ISA 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 30:14" />Li keteibe li pang kedi nzwa pa cide teipang zie; pa cide bang beulak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:14">iciu eh pang takcai kelu kakgade ketakcai gede ngau gailak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:14">mimang gade mi pwa mpet kera mede duibung gade dui twak mpet kera ziemne.<verse eid="ISA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 30:15" />Kedanemene ainzwa eh RAMPAUBE, Israel Kemcibe rangla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:15">“Cailigwang nah mtak lude nnuide kelilu zie; ziune kecu nah nlum kecude nnui kengking zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:15">Dede nnui neu lama.<verse eid="ISA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 30:16" />Nnui rangdi, ‘Lak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:16">anui hekündung gade pak dizie,’ iciu eh nnui pak dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:16">nah, ‘Anui hekwen pak kemzetbedung reu gade pak zie,’ iciu eh nnuide ziu kelame nzetlu kerane.<verse eid="ISA 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 30:17" />Hangge keheu gaide cangge pak zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:17">hang mengei keheu gaide nnui pak zie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:17">nnui bangkelume lamlwatu peu ga pailim tsia ge nzwa mede kideutu ga pailim ge nzwa di kemaktane.”<verse eid="ISA 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 30:18" />Dede RAMPAUBE au nnuide hung eh kwabam, cine pa au nnuide ngaugia keulia kera mtei pwabam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:18">Kedanemene RAMPAUBE au kemzui Tinggwang; pecu kwa kebamme samlam pungtu.<verse eid="ISA 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 30:19" />Minadung Zion ga nah Jerusalem ga lungh zie, nah nang hap silak ta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:19">Nang kengha kie gai cai pa au ncu ngaunggia bizie. Pa cide siu lude, pa ncu kelibeu zie.<verse eid="ISA 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 30:20" />Tinggwang ncu keherei kecu tangku nah keherei kecu dui peu liede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:20">iciu liede, n keledeube pekatei pecu hebai silak ta, dede nkatei n miakle n keledeube de ngau zie.<verse eid="ISA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 30:21" />Nang zetle ge nreu gai mede hile ge nreu gai liede n cai gade sam rang eh pe kwa siu zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:21">“Aide lampuibe da, aika tetlu,” de eh.<verse eid="ISA 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 30:22" />Ngu mamie rangkanggeu nah kecakle teilwe kai kenzeu de gi dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:22">Nang cidungde pai kehera ge nzwa kelien gi dizie. Nang cidungde dade, “Aika de tetdi lu,” de rang zie.<verse eid="ISA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 30:23" />Ngu heleuh ziemne pa tingrui peu zie nang kideu gage ling kegaidau,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:23">nah kideu gade tangku kekiee ge, nah meitsi kekiee ge peu zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:23">Cipaunai n kauruine tsehei deu gade ma peei tyei zie.<verse eid="ISA 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 30:24" />N luh puu kela ketum nah gadadung taktyei keyi tyei zie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:24">peitwak nah kehwatie le hepet ntsam kelube.<verse eid="ISA 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 30:25" />Reketbam kaumie eh mina kekiee de tei ketset benai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:25">lamlwatu kehu nah kideu kehu leune gade reuceu nah reuceunadung gade dui lwa zie.<verse eid="ISA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 30:26" />Hekei kebaa tingnaimiak nzwa zie nah tingnaimiak kebaa pia hena kiee ge baa ki zie, lang henane ba nzwa zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:26">RAMPAUBE pe mina rezam kebam de kang dizie nah penuide rejam kedi zamdung teingkei beuzie.<verse eid="ISA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 30:27" />Pielo, RAMPAUBE zi heni kemdei gade gwangla, pe rata heu eh nah mika nzwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:27">Pe muileudung au rata le pui, nah pe mleu au tyei zette di kelabe mi nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 30:28" />Pe ngicui au puikenlim rata lwa pwa pe ngngwang sumbe ga kecang nghang kebam nzwada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:28">heleuh dungde kengkap teu eh zangra di kera. Pe ngicui au mina tangkei ga keuteu kela heria ge nzwa, peu penui lam tsam tetdi kera.<verse eid="ISA 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 30:29" />Nnui tingmui kemci hengyi kemnei nzwa lei tei zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:29">nah mige terwaine teu eh RAMPAUBE Kerecaki, Israel Tsura ga kehang nzwa, nnui mlung sui yizie.<verse eid="ISA 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 30:30" />RAMPAUBE peu pe kwa kemdu de siu luzie nah pe ba mlai de keulia zie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:30">rahang rata nah miheu gade, tingkai kaici, tingruicui nah tangheu gade.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:13">Lei. 18:13</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 18:14">14</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 30:31" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE kwa gade Assyria au takcai dizie; pa penuide tsingtie gele dap zie.<verse eid="ISA 30:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 30:32" />RAMPAUBE penui reu gage dap kegai msangne</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:32">tambourine kwa nah leibung kwadung si zie, pa penuide hereu gade regi kecudau.<verse eid="ISA 30:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 30:33" />Kedanemene keru bam ge nda ge de mtei teula. Kesangbe au cide hegwangpei ziemne telei teula nah Tinggwang ne cide teimza nah tei ncok gai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:33">Tsing kekiee ge nah mi teu eh kerubam mtei luda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:33">RAMPAUBE ngicui, miheu reuki nzwa, cika mi mtau gai zie.<verse eid="ISA 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="ISA 31" />
  <para style="s">Egypt de ngngei kelame kehing</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 31:1" />Ainie Egypt ga kengha ziemne nghung kecumedung nah hekwendung da ngngei kecumedung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">nah bagi dungde nlum eh (cidungde au kiee kecune) hekwen keteume dungde (cidungde au peikap gai kelak ge kecume).</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">Dede penui au Israel Tinggwang Kemcibe de helung kaima, mede penui RAMPAUBE de peei ma!<verse eid="ISA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 31:2" />Iciuliede RAMPAUBE au mteu, nah pa kengkap teugwang gaizie nah pe samdung teucaili dilak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:2">Pa kesiame ki de renia cuhzie nah kemau ketei kenghame dungde renia zie.<verse eid="ISA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 31:3" />Egypt au mina ge nah Tinggwang ma, penui hekwendung au pumteeibe nah rabe ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:3">RAMPAUBE pe ba hwapet kegaidau, kenghabe hangna nade kau dizie, nah ngha kebeube liede kau dizie; hangna na ngngwa tsai dizie.<verse eid="ISA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 31:4" />RAMPAUBE a dage ainzwa ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">“Hingho ge nzwa, heriheret hingho ge liede, pe taktyei tui kelube dade mra la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">meurün kekwamedung maa gene cide ncau eh sahbak kegaidau,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">dede penui kwadung ne pa mbeu dima, mede penui kwa ne nriatet dima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">cine reugwame reu RAMPAUBE Zion Deutu ga regi kera nghung, cipau deutu ga.<verse eid="ISA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 31:5" />Nruinedung lim kelanzwa, cinzwa eh reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ne Jerusalem de gum beuzie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:5">pa ne gum nah kelilu zie pa cipaureu tetkak nah cide kaizeu lula.<verse eid="ISA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 31:6" />Israelme nnui ngngwa reniasüt kegaibe RAMPAUBE da cailigwang lu. <verse eid="ISA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 31:7" />Kedanemene cipaunai hangge ge kecu pegu rangkanggeu gu mamiedung</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:7">nah pegu kecak gu miedung nnui katei nnui ba kemau gele tei kelude keliengi dizie.<verse eid="ISA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 31:8" />Assyria au kiengtie gade kau dizie; mina ne keula kemak kiengtie gene pecu ngkap dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:8">Pa kiengtie dade pak dizie, nah pe mina heriheretme depeu tahung tei kera ketang zie.<verse eid="ISA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 31:9" />Penui ngngisüt kecu ziemne teilu kera kenlum kebam leune gah dizie, nah pegu hegwang napeidung RAMPAUBE gu hereu pailim ngau kegaidau ngngi dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:9">aide au RAMPAUBE ne ndu kegai ge, Zion ga pe mi kebambe nah Jerusalem ga pe mibung kebambe.”<verse eid="ISA 31:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="ISA 32" />
  <para style="s">Kesamsang Gwangram</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 32:1" />Pielo, hegwangpei ge kesamsang gade hegwang teu zie, nah hegwangname kemzeube gade teu zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 19:11, Heb. 1:8-9</char></note><verse eid="ISA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 32:2" />Hangge ge kecu au tingkai gade kensiu ki ge nzwa zie nah rahang gade kensiu ge nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:2">kecangh bam ge ga reuceudung lwa kebam nzwa, leu kedi deu ga tangtsukang kedi ge mie nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 32:3" />Pecai pie kegaime miakdung miakmai dilak, nah kingnei kegaime kwendung kingnei sünne luzie.<verse eid="ISA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 32:4" />Macet teune kemakme maci bam eh macet sünne dizie, nah pelet nsii cume rang nci nah rang relui dizie.<verse eid="ISA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 32:5" />Kemieme de rüt lubui lie qu si lak, mede mide kecwa mede makesangme lie qu si lak.<verse eid="ISA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 32:6" />Kedanemene kemieme au kemie sam rang la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">nah pe mlung ga kesiabe nah nlum kemak tahdung riam la, nah RAMPAUBE de renia eh petau kemakpe rang la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">Pa mzeu kelame de tei mrwa dila, nah hereu kelame de peu dui sak melu kera tei la.<verse eid="ISA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 32:7" />Mide kecwame keteibedung au kesiabe. Pa kenretdung le kegahme de</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:7">tei nsia kera heciem kesiabedung riem la, kegahme petau be rang kegai dau liede.<verse eid="ISA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 32:8" />Dede rütlu kebuime ge au rütlu kebuidung riem la; nah pa rütlu kebui tahdung tei kegai de ziemne pa sap bam luzie.<verse eid="ISA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem Mipuidung</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 32:9" />Cuhlu, nang mipui relui kebammedung, nah a kwa kingnei lulo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:9">nnui lungrei kegah napuidung, a kwa kingneilu.<verse eid="ISA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 32:10" />Kedanemene mmi ge swa kiee nakke kecudau n kenlum de gah dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:10">nnui lungrei kegah puidung, kubetsi luhlüt kera teilu ta dizie kecune, keu hekwa kecu de gwang lak.<verse eid="ISA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 32:11" />Mbeulu, nnui relui kebamme puidung; kehereilu, nnui madedu melie kebammedung;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:11">nnui paini keyidung radi nah nnui katei nnuide tei paaula lu; rosopai le nnui kiakang gage kailu.<verse eid="ISA 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 32:12" />Nnui luh keyidung ziemne hap zie, kubetsi bui süt kebam ziemne.<verse eid="ISA 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 32:13" />A minadung deu au hetu nah hetubang ne lungh pui dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:13">nggwa kenlwang namdi ga ndaa suiyi kepui kidung pelane ga liede.<verse eid="ISA 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 32:14" />Hegwang ki gi dizie kecune, mina ne kepui tei kebam namdi de püt dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:14">kideutu nah reketbam au kelungta tsupopdung dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:14">renaam gadadung ziemne suiyi ge zie, kauhaudung taktyei bamge zie;<verse eid="ISA 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 32:15" />Nreu le de anui dage Tinggwang pe Rabe ruigai kemaktane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:15">nah hetaideu au luh petsi buisüt cuge dizie, nah luh petsi bui süt kecu gede hegung ge lie dizie.<verse eid="ISA 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 32:16" />Pecai kemzeube hetaideu ga lungh dizie; nah kesamsangbe luh petsi bui süt cu ga lungh dizie.<verse eid="ISA 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 32:17" />Kesamsang ta au kezuyi zie; nah kesamsang tah ne ziune kecu nah kenlum kelunghta peula.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom. 14:7, Jam. 3:18</char></note><verse eid="ISA 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 32:18" />A minadung lungciep bam ga lungh dizie, kwak eh bamlu kera kidung ga, nah ziune eh kemtak bamdung ga.<verse eid="ISA 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 32:19" />Dede magade tangheu kei liede nah hegung tei nsia di liede, nah namdi tei nsia ciak dide, <verse eid="ISA 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 32:20" />nnui cau reuceudung leune tai ga gi kegaime samlam pung luzie, nnui hetumseu nah gadadung petak tyei kera lang mpet kegaime.<verse eid="ISA 32:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="ISA 33" />
  <para style="s">Keherei nah Kengha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 33:1" />Co nang, tei kengkapbe tei ngkapdi kemakbe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">Co mide kecwame penuide cwadi kemak!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">Nang tei ngkap ta kedi dau, ncu tei ngkap dizie.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">Nang mide cwa ta kedi dau, penui ne ncu cwa zie.<verse eid="ISA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 33:2" />RAMPAUBE, anuide ngau nggia lo; anui ncu kwa bam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:2">tingcang ramsang anuide gum lu, keherei ting dau anui de keli lu.<verse eid="ISA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 33:3" />RAMPAUBE kwa sah mtei kegai gade ngauraume pak dizie; nang cuh keludau, heleuhdung zangra dizie.<verse eid="ISA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 33:4" />Nnui gu ma tui keludung tangrimdung mbau kecu nzwa kebau dizie; tangrimdung nsau lim tet kecu nzwa, minadung de nsau lim tet zie.<verse eid="ISA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 33:5" />RAMPAUBE au disüt. Pa tinggim ga lungh la. Pa au Zion de kemzeube nah kesamsangbe le tei pui pung zie.<verse eid="ISA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 33:6" />Nnui tingdau pa au kentippe zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:6">kelikelu kepui, kemteu, nah maci zie; RAMPAUBE de kehing au pe mabam da.<verse eid="ISA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 33:7" />Pielo, penui gwaketeime lampuikidung ga hap bam dida; heleuhding keteimedung kezuyi ziemne regui eh hap süt bam dida.<verse eid="ISA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 33:8" />Puidikidung nkam zing dida; hebeuh keteimedung bam si meda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:8">Samkak keludung tei pang dida, zierangdung de mlai dida<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">zierangdung de mlai dida: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kesa laisiu ga zierangmedung de mlai dida de mene, namdidung de mlai dida de bamla. </char></note>, nah mina de herüt peu ta dida.<verse eid="ISA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 33:9" />Hangdeube hei eh hap nah hui nggah dida; Lebanon au ngngam dida nah hui nggah dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:9">Sharon au hetaideu langkam ge nzwa dida; nah Bashan penai Carmel au penai neidung nhai kap dida.<verse eid="ISA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 33:10" />“Cu au Ih cuh zie da,” RAMPAUBE rang eh; “Cu au acu teu cuh zie da; cu au acu teu cehu luzie.<verse eid="ISA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 33:11" />Nang meiciu kwarie de tetlaklu, nah nang reigau de nna; n cuingi au ncu tei ngkap kera mi ge.<verse eid="ISA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 33:12" />Minadung de ru pwa mimüt tei dizie, hetuu ziudung bi ngkei nah cidung de ru kedi nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 33:13" />Nnui kemdei ga kebammedung, Ih daipai tei gai bi kingnei lulo; nah, nnui kemna ga kebammedung, a kengkieng ci lulo.”<verse eid="ISA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 33:14" />Zion ga kemaumedung ngngi bam; Tinggwang de si kemakmedung mbeu bam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:14">Anui kakga cau mi heusüt kebam ga kaknage bam lubui no? Anui kakga cau kelunghta heu kebam ga kaknage bam lubui no?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heb. 12:29</char></note><verse eid="ISA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 33:15" />Samsang eh tet kelame nah makesangbe rang kelame;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:15">mide tei keherei kecu gade kemmi ngau kecume de ngkau kelame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:15">hetau henim ge lu kelakne ba teu kecume,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:15">hejai teilwa kera kerang de kingnei ta kedime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:15">nah ma kesiabe pie kerane pe miakdung ziangmui kedime,<verse eid="ISA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 33:16" />aipau mina de au kecehu ga lungh zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:16">pa kwaklu kera bam au tsura ga renei kwa kelu ni ge zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:16">pe taktyei au pwa peu zie, nah pegu dui au peu jüja zie.<verse eid="ISA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 33:17" />Hegwangpei hangdeu kemdei ge ga hegwang tei kebam pe hezu keyi de n miak le ngau zie. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 17:2, Jhn: 1:14</char></note><verse eid="ISA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 33:18" />Ma kehing aide nang nsung dai luzie; keraube daiga bam no, rangkang ndet kecume daiga bam no? Reketbam kepeibe daiga bam no?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Cor. 1:20</char></note><verse eid="ISA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 33:19" />Samzai tei kemakme de nah helet nang cikemak minadung de de ngau si lakta.<verse eid="ISA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 33:20" />Zion de pie gailo, anui hengyi kelabedung namdi de;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:20">nnui miakdung le Jerusalem de ziune eh lungh kebam ni ge nzwa ngau zie, paiki cide au ra dilak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:20">cipau tsiadung au ma dau de züt mpet gai lak mede pe riadung tütti lak.<verse eid="ISA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 33:21" />Cinzwa meliene, RAMPAUBE pe kemdu gade anui da bam zie, hereuki kedi dung nah reuceudung bam gade.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:21">Hereuliem petiedung le cika kette tet gwang lak, nah liemdung kedi kette tet gwang lak.<verse eid="ISA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 33:22" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE au anui tutiakbe, RAMPAUBE au anui gu hezai kekaibe, RAMPAUBE au anui gwangpei; pa anuide kelilu zie.<verse eid="ISA 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 33:23" />Ngu heriadung au nla bam; penui hetsia de de pebam gage kai zeu gai lak; penui pe pailim de lim gailak;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:23">ma tui kelu nia kekiee de nzi kegai dau, pepi kesiame de ma tui kelu nia keu teu pwa dizie.<verse eid="ISA 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 33:24" />Lungh kebammedung ne rang lak, “Ih mra au;” RAMPAUBE cika lungh kebamme penui mau gi beuzie.<verse eid="ISA 33:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="ISA 34" />
  <para style="s">Heleuhdung de Kemmau</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 34:1" />Gwang nnalu, nnui heleuhdung, nah kingnei lu; helung kai lu, nnui minadung!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:1">Hangdeube nah cika pui kebam pelane kingnei maisia, kideube, nah cika de kegwangbedung pelane.<verse eid="ISA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 34:2" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE au heleuhdung pelane de pe rata bam dida, nah penui gu reugwamedung pelane de pe ratasüt bam dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:2">pane penuide tei nkap zing di, pane penuide gitset kera gage balie gai beu.<verse eid="ISA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 34:3" />Penui ketsaipaaudung kelien mpet dizie. Ketsai paaudung rim maleu ga nnam dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:3">nah lamlwadung ga penui jai jok nghang dizie.<verse eid="ISA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 34:4" />Tinggim ga hegidung pelane nnei mietmiet dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:4">nah tinggim au laisiudum nzwa kezui dizie; nah penui gu heghidung pelane nnei mietmiet dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:4">manei pebang gade gah mietmiet di kela nzwa, nah nzüt tsidung meu ntei zu eh nzüt bang gade nghai di kela nzwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 24:29, Mrk. 13:25, Luk. 21:26, 2 Pet. 3:12, Keu. 6:13-14</char></note><verse eid="ISA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 34:5" />Kedanemene a kiengtie tingkam gade sak pui kelu dau;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:5">pielo, cide cu au Edom ga nghung zie da, Ih ngkapdi kera ziemne kai ntsam pwa kebam minadung da.<verse eid="ISA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 34:6" />RAMPAUBE gu kiengtie au hejai le zau bam nah maca le cum pwabam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:6">meurünnadung nah hemeudung zai le zau bam, meurün seudung gu nkeudung ca le cum pwabam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:6">Kedanemene RAMPAUBE ne Bozrah namdi gade ratak ge tei gai nah Edom deu gade kekiee ge gitset kegaine.<verse eid="ISA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 34:7" />Renaam tumseudung penuide ngngwa kau zie, nah hena kebam tumseudung hecing ki kecubedung de ngngwa kau zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:7">Penui deu au hejai le sakmie zie, penui gu rebui de maca le tei ca lu.<verse eid="ISA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 34:8" />Kedanemene cipau nai au RAMPAUBE ziemne hekum kepeei tingba ge zie nah Zion de tei kegai ziemne penuide peu caili dai kecu tingkum ge zie.<verse eid="ISA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 34:9" />Edom ga reukidung au kehania mmi dizie, pe rebui au sulfur mmi dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:9">nah pe deu au kehania heu kebam nzwa dizie.<verse eid="ISA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 34:10" />Cide tingmui tingba ruzie; pe mika kelunghta ka cuh zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:10">ceheu ge gade ceheu ge cide nta kebam deu dizie; migede cika kelunghta nah kelunghta tetkah gwang lak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 14:11, 19:3</char></note><verse eid="ISA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 34:11" />Dede renaam ruinedung nah makaunedung cika lungh zie; biangkang nah hegak cika ge pe ciep teugai zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:11">Pa cipau reu gage tei nsia kera kemdet tie teu kezang gai zie nah tei ngkap kera petie kemdet tie de.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 18:2, Zep. 2:14</char></note><verse eid="ISA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 34:12" />Pe muiteumedung</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:12">hegwangram gelie qugai kera ma gede bamlak, nah pe hegwangnadung au ma gede lak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:15">Keu. 6:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 34:13" />Hetudung ne pe hegwangkidung lungh pui dizie, tambu bang nah hetu bang ne pe kengkiengbam dung ga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:13">Cide au maiserung kelungh bam ge zie, ruitie bam dizie.<verse eid="ISA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 34:14" />Renaam kaunedung nah heneudung cika redau zie, nah renaam meudung hangge ge dage hap gaizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:14">Tingmui kaunedung cika lungh zie nah penui katei penui ziemne kemtak bam ge ngaulu zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:2">Keu. 18:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 34:15" />Biangkangdung peciepdung teu zie, mbum gai zie nah penui na nkak zie, pena nkak zie nah penui na de gum zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:15">Yeo, cika heliedung ngkwa zie, ketket kecu pekang ngngwa lwe.<verse eid="ISA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 34:16" />RAMPAUBE gu laisiudum gade pei lo; aidung de kette gah dilak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:16">Kette pekang gah eh bam lak; Kedanemene pemui ne aja kai kebeune, nah pe rabe ne penuide hekwa kelune.<verse eid="ISA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 34:17" />Pa penui bamdung ziemne dacak tei gai, nah peba ne penui ziemne heria ge le cide mdet mpet gai beu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:17">Kelunghta cide penui gu zie; ceheu ge eh ceheu ge penui cika lungh zie.<verse eid="ISA 34:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="ISA 35" />
  <para style="s">Rikelume Suiyi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 35:1" />Renaamkang nah Arabah sui yi dizie; nah kecangh deu de pe suiyi nah pa dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:1">Rose pa nzwa eh,<verse eid="ISA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 35:2" />cide pepa pa hemisüt zie nah suiyi ramcim eh leitei zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">Lebanon lamlwatudung de pecu peu dizie, Carmel penai Sharon zuyi de;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">penui RAMPAUBE kendu de ngau zie, anui Tinggwang zuyi de.<verse eid="ISA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 35:3" />Nnei kebam badung de tei ngking lu, nah mbeu kebam ngkokpuidung de tei ngkinglu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:12">Heb. 12:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 35:4" />Penui mlung ngngi kebamme dage ranglo, “Ngkinglu, ngngi diso!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">Pielo, n Tinggwang hekum teu eh gwang zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">Tinggwang ziehi de teu eh. Pa gwang zie nah ncu kelilu zie.”<verse eid="ISA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 35:5" />Pecai miakcietme miakdung ma ngau dizie, nah kwenpangme kwendung ma siu di zie.<verse eid="ISA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 35:6" />Pecai pepi kesiame heti nzwa nsung dizie, nah marang gai kelakme lei tei dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:6">kedanemene Arabah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Arabah </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hetaideu</char></note> ga dui pet dizie, nah renaamkang ga dui reukidung pet dizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 11:5, Isa. 41:17-18</char></note><verse eid="ISA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 35:7" />Heciang ru kebam de rejaai ge dizie, nah hangdeu kecangh de duipwak le pui dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:7">maiserungdung kelungh heni gadung, penui kezeu gadung, tampeu, duiheidung nah hekuu lungh zie.<verse eid="ISA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 35:8" />Cika puidi Kemci Puidi ge bam zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">Mci kemakme cika mbeu gwang lak. Dede cide au cika tet kelame ziemne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">Kemieme cika nlüt lak.<verse eid="ISA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 35:9" />Hingho cika bamlak, teikuu ge de cika bam lak; penuide cika ngau gai lak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:9">Tinggwang ne langgi kedi gade keli kebeume cika tet zie.<verse eid="ISA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 35:10" />RAMPAUBE ne keli kelume cailigwang zie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">nah penui Zion ga leitei eh gwang zie, nah kelunghta suiyi penui da lazie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">suiyi penuide puipung zie; suisiet nah lungrei pak dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:4">Keu. 21:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 35:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="ISA 36" />
  <para style="s">Sennacherib Jerusalem de Keheukecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 36:1" />Hezekiah hegwang teikelu mmi kereimdai bekum, Assyria gwangpei Sennacherib Judah ga namdi kwa keludung gwaketang nah cidungde tuilu. <verse eid="ISA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 36:2" />Pecai Assyria gwangpei reugwamaa muibe de Lachish namdi gade Jerusalem ga hegwangpei Hezekiah dage langgai reugwamaa kedi gede si eh. Pa rezai nreube duipak nggwa kebamga gwang nnalu, paiketame luh puidiki ga, nah pa cika saplu. <verse eid="ISA 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 36:3" />Israel leuhme kakgade kedime namdi gwale pecu resiu kera kepetme becai Hilkiah napei Eliakim, hegwangki kerengei kedibe, Shebna, hegwangpei gu keraube, nah Asaph napei Joah, sorkari matiak kelubedung keraube.<verse eid="ISA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 36:4" />Reugwame kakgade ditube penui dade rang eh, “Hezekiah de rang beu lo, hegwangpei kedibe Assyria gwangpei ainzwa eh ranglie eh, ‘Dai gade n kekuu cide gwang bam no? <verse eid="ISA 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 36:5" />Nang lugai kelak samdung rünne rangla, hereu tei kera ziemne ciemyi nah kengking bam lie eh. Nang cu caude nlum la no? Acu ngngwa renia kera caune ncu kekuu peu no? <verse eid="ISA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 36:6" />Pielo, nang Egypt de nlum la, cide hekuu pangtakcai kebam nang hetuitie tei teula, dede cika mige ngngei gai cai, cide peba ga kau pwa lwe pecu kui zie. Pharaoh Egypt gwangpei de cinzwa da pecu nlum kelame dade. <verse eid="ISA 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 36:7" />Dede magade nnui a dade, “Anui au RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang de nlum la,” de eh rang liecai. Pa cide Hezekiah ne pe reca nidung nah reca bamdung keu tet kedibe de meni, nah Judah nah Jerusalem da pa rang, “Jerusalem ga recabam aikade nnui reca zie”? <verse eid="ISA 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 36:8" />Cine cu, Ih nnuide a mpaube Assyria gwangpei zi gade mapwa peu gaila. Ih nnuide hekündung cangna ge hazie, penui reu cwa kerame nnui ngau lu liecai. <verse eid="ISA 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 36:9" />Nui dainzwa a mpaube kilame kakgade ceutu nabe de de ngngwa regi lu meno? Bagidung nah hekwen teu kelame ziemne nnui nnui kenlum Egypt dage kai dida. <verse eid="ISA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 36:10" />Cine cu, Ih heni aide ga RAMPAUBE si mene mbeu hang lani hangdeu aide de ngngwa regi nah tei ngkapti kera? RAMPAUBE a dage rangdi, “Hangdeu aide de regi lu nah ngkap dilo.”’”<verse eid="ISA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 36:11" />Pecai Eliakim Hilkiah napei, nah Shebnah, nah Joah reugwame reu ditube dage rang eh, “Teikeherei de n kilamedung de Aramme let, Aramaic gade marang lo, kedanemene anui cide cibam. Judahme let gade anuida marang so herie ga kebam minadung kwen gade.” <verse eid="ISA 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 36:12" />Dede reugwame kakgade kedibe rang eh, “A mpaube acu langpwa n mpaube nah n dage sam aidungde rang kerane langgai ni? Pa acu langpwa herie ga kebam minadung dage langgai meni, nnuide ngngwa penui katei penui teu tyei nah penui zung sak kerame dage?”<verse eid="ISA 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 36:13" />Pecai reugwame kakgade kedibe cuhlu nah Judahme let gade pekwa sahbak eh, ranggai, “Hegwang kedibe Assyria gwangpei, hegwang kedibe samdung kingnei lulo. <verse eid="ISA 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 36:14" />Hegwangpei rangla, ‘Hezekiah de peu nnuide cwadi helo, kedanemene pa au nnuide keli gailak lu. <verse eid="ISA 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 36:15" />Peu Hezekiah de nnuide RAMPAUBE de nlum kera teiso, rang eh, “RAMPAUBE nnuide kelilu bi zie; namdi aide Assyria gwangpei ba gage peu di lak.”’ <verse eid="ISA 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 36:16" />Hezekiah sam kingnei so, kedanemene Assyria gwangpei ainzwa eh rangla: ‘Acu ngngwa kezuyi teilu nah a da mpetlu. Iciude nnui hangge kecu de pekatei pe kubebang gade nah pekatei pe tangzütbang gade tyei zie, nah pekatei pe tekwa gade dui sakzie. <verse eid="ISA 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 36:17" />Ih gwang eh nnui katei nnui deu kenzwage gage ngngwa tetdi kemak tane nnui ma aide teizie, meitsi nah zau keheci deuge, tangku nah kubetsiluhdung deuge.’ <verse eid="ISA 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 36:18" />Hezekiah de peu nnui lampui saumau diso, rang eh, ‘RAMPAUBE anui de kelilu zie.’ Assyria gwangpei ba gade mina kedame rabedung ket nede penui de kelibeu ni? <verse eid="ISA 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 36:19" />Hamath nah Arpad tinggwangdung daiga la no? Sepharvaim rabedung daiga lano? Penuine Samaria de a kengking gade kelibeu ni? <verse eid="ISA 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 36:20" />Hangdeu aidungde rabedung kakgade, tinggwang gede bamni a kengking gade pe hangdeu kelikelu kerane, RAMPAUBE Jerusalem de a kengkieng gade kelilu kera nzwa ni?”<verse eid="ISA 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 36:21" />Dede minadung zing de eh bam di nah penui sam gede rang ma, kedanemene hegwangpei aja au, “Pesam keli so,” de kecune. <verse eid="ISA 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 36:22" />Pecai Hilkiah napei Eliakim, hegwangki ga kedibe, keraube Shebna, nah keraube Asaph napei Joah, penui lung keherei eh penui niadung hietti eh Hezekiah da gwang nah reugwa muibe samdung peda pau gaibeu.<verse eid="ISA 36:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="ISA 37" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem Lungmpetlu kera Mrairang kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 37:1" />Hegwangpei Hezekiah penui pau kegaidung de siu kelu dau, pa pelung sia eh peniadung hietti, rosopai bahlu, nah RAMPAUBE ki ga miedi. <verse eid="ISA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 37:2" />Pa Eliakim, hegwangki ga kedibe, nah Shebna keraube, nah cingku hangkiamedung de, pelane rosopai bahlwe, Amoz napei Isaiah, caihakecibe da langgai. <verse eid="ISA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 37:3" />Penui peda rang eh, “Hezekiah rangla, ‘Henai aide lungrei, rata, nah kengngam tingbazie ge, hena nage mna kera kwa kebam nzwa, dede mipui be pena mna kera kengkieng gah kebam nzwa. <verse eid="ISA 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 37:4" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang reugwamaa muibe samdung kingneilu de cilak, pe mpaube Assyria gwangpei ne langgai eh ringkela Tinggwang de kii kera lang kegaibede, nah RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ngking kelu samdungde mmau dizie. Cu nnui kekie teigai gailu cika bang kebamme ziemne.’”<verse eid="ISA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 37:5" />Cine Hegwangpei Hezekiah kilamedung Isaiah da gwang, <verse eid="ISA 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 37:6" />nah Isaiah penuide dade ranggai, “Nnui mpaube da ranglo: ‘RAMPAUBE rangla, “Nnui samdung siu kelu dene ngngi di helo, Assyria gwangpei kilame acu kemneu sam kerangdung de. <verse eid="ISA 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 37:7" />Pielo, Ih rabe pedage kaigai zie, nah pa sam pau kegai dungge siulu zie nah pa pekatei pedeu ga cailigwang dizie. Ih pecu peu pekatei pedeu gade kingtie le tsaidi zie.”’”<verse eid="ISA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 37:8" />Pecai reugwame muibe ditube caili gwanglu, nah Assyria gwangpei Libnah namdi de ngngwa keregi bam eh ngaulu, kedanemene pa hegwangpei Lachish gade tetdi delie siu kelune. <verse eid="ISA 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 37:9" />Pecai Sennacherib Cush nah Egypt gwangpei Tirhakah pecu ngngwa regi kera mtei kebam siulu, cine pa samge teu eh sam teu kelamede Hezekiah dage langgai dai: <verse eid="ISA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 37:10" />“Judahme gwangpei Hezekiah da ranglo, ‘Nnui nlum kela nnui Tinggwang de peu nnuide cwa diso, rang eh, “Jerusalem de Assyria gwangpei ba gage peu di lak.” <verse eid="ISA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 37:11" />Pielo, nang Assyria gwangpeidung hangdeu pelanedung da daipai teigai dibi siulu da penuide ngkap zing kedi. Cine ncu kelilu zieni? <verse eid="ISA 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 37:12" />Namdidung rabedung ne penuide kelilu dini, a paumedung ne ngkap kedi heleuhdung: Gozan, Haran, Rezeph namdidung, nah Tel Assar ga Edenmedung? <verse eid="ISA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 37:13" />Daiga Hamath gwangpei, Arpad gwangpei, Sepharvaim, Hena, nah Ivvah namdidung gwangpei lano?’”<verse eid="ISA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezekiah Kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 37:14" />Hezekiah samgwame ba gade laisiu aide sam teu kelame ba gade keulu nah cide peigai. Pecai pa RAMPAUBE ki ga hanglu nah cide pe dwa gage kailu. <verse eid="ISA 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 37:15" />Hezekiah RAMPAUBE dage kekie teigai: <verse eid="ISA 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 37:16" />“Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, cherubim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cherubim: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makaune pe hesiu keteibe</char></note> reu kebambe, nang rünne kideu gwangram pelane reu Tinggwang. Nang tinggimdung nah kideu teigai. <verse eid="ISA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 37:17" />N kwen nreugai, RAMPAUBO, nah kingnei gailo. N miak nkeigai, RAMPAUBO, nah piegailo, nah Sennacherib samdung siu gailo, ringkela Tinggwang de teu henui tei kera pa lang kegai samdung de. <verse eid="ISA 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 37:18" />Cide kesanglie, RAMPAUBO, Assyria gwangpeidung ne namdidung pelane nah penui deudung de ngkap dida. <verse eid="ISA 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 37:19" />Penui penui rabedung de mi gage kai dida, kedanemene penui au rabedung ma dede mina ba le teikelu tahge, tsing nah tangtsu rünne. Cine Assyriame ne penuide ngkapti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 115:4-8, Gal. 4:8</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 37:20" />Cine cu, RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang, pe kengking gade anuide kelibeu lo, cinzwa eh kideu gwangramdung pelane de nang rünne RAMPAUBE lie kecu cilu kerane.”<verse eid="ISA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 37:21" />Ge Amoz napei Isaiah samge Hezekiah dage langgai, rangzeu, “RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang rang la, ‘Kedanemene nnui Assyria gwangpei Sennacherib ziemne a da kie kegaine, <verse eid="ISA 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 37:22" />sam aide RAMPAUBE pe ziemne ranggai:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:22">“Kemci Zion napui ncu ngau nghet bam nah ncu mlai eh nui bam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:22">Jerusalem napui ncu pepeu kengak bam.<verse eid="ISA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 37:23" />Nang caude kii nah rang msia no? Caude nang ngkwa kecehu le renia no</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:23">nah hegie eh n miak pwacu no? Israel Tinggwang Kemcibe de de.<verse eid="ISA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 37:24" />Nang n kilamedung dade Rampaube de kii nah ranggai, ‘A bagidung kekiee ge teu eh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Ih lamlwatu cehutu ga hang, Lebanon deutu hutubedung ga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Ih cedarbang hutu bedung nah cypress bang yitu bedung bikau dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">nah Ih heni kecehu deutu gadung mie zie, petsi kepui hegung ga.<verse eid="ISA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 37:25" />Ih tekwadung kui lu nah dui saklu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:25">Ih a pi kangga kebam Egypt reuki pelane tei cangh dida.’<verse eid="ISA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 37:26" />Ih ndaa gede cide riempwa kela nang ci meni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:26">nah ndaa gede tei kedi ci meni? Cu Ih cide teicang gwang zeuda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:26">Nang aika namdi kengkieng dungde de teimsia pwa ralie teidi kera bam.<verse eid="ISA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 37:27" />Cika kelunghme, kengking cam, nnei nah ngngam dida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">Penui au luhga ceheidung, cehei kemdiakdung, cehei ki reuga mede luh ga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">naimiak kepetle tingkai dwa kebam nzwa da.<verse eid="ISA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 37:28" />Dede Ih nnui bam kecu, nnui mie kecu, nnui gwang kecu, nah nnui rata a da kebam de cibam.<verse eid="ISA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 37:29" />Acu n rata kela, nah nang ngang kela a kwen ga gwang cang bam kecu ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">Ih n ngkie gage kagwak kailu zie, nah n mui gage kekang ria kailu zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">Ih nang kegwang lampui gade ncu ngngwa cailigwang dai dizie.”<verse eid="ISA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 37:30" />Pecai Isaiah hegwangpei Hezekiah dage rang, “Aide n ziemne ma rehi ge zie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:30">Hekum nang hegung ga lungkela be tyei zie, nah mmi pekena bekum de nang cika lung kela be tyei zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:30">Dede mmi pekecum bekum nang mabang ling zie nah luhlüt zie, kubetsibangdung lingzie nah petsi tyei zie.<verse eid="ISA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 37:31" />Judah leu bang kebam ringkelumedung penui mah him dai luzie nah petsi bui zie.<verse eid="ISA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 37:32" />Kedanemene Jerusalem gade bang kebamme ge pet zie; Zion Deutu gade ring kelume gwang zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:32">Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE lungning de ne aide teigai zie.”<verse eid="ISA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 37:33" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE Assyria gwangpei ziemne aide ranggai:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:33">“Pa namdi aika lütlak nah pa aika lakpitsi gede kap lak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:33">Pa hegeu punglwe cipau dwa ga gwanglak mede cika ge heni kecehu gede kwa cuh lak.<verse eid="ISA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 37:34" />Pa kegwang lampui gade pa tet dai dizie; pa namdi cika nlüt lak, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<verse eid="ISA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ISA 37:35" />Kedanemene Ih namdi aide de kwa lu zie nah keli beu zie, a ziemne nah a kilabe David ziemne.” <verse eid="ISA 37:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ISA 37:36" />Pecai RAMPAUBE gwame ge tetpet nah Assyriame ramzeuki gwa ketang eh reugwame 185,000 gede teitsetdi. Minadung tingcang nuge cuge, ketsaipaaudung zeu nlakie bam. <verse eid="ISA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ISA 37:37" />Cine Assyria gwangpei Sennacherib Judah de püt eh tetdi nah kilung gwang di nah Nineveh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nineveh: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Assyria namdi sumbe</char></note> namdi ga bam di. <verse eid="ISA 37:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ISA 37:38" />Pecai, pa Nisrok ki ga pe rabe de reca kebam dau, pe napeime Adrammelek nah Sharezer kingtie le pecu teitset di. Delwe Ararat deu gage pak gaidi. Pecai pe napei Esarhaddon pe bam leu eh hegwang teidi.<verse eid="ISA 37:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="ISA 38" />
  <para style="s">Hezekiah Mateeikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 38:1" />Cipau tingdau Hezekiah nra eh tsai di lai eh bam. Cine Amoz napei Isaiah, caihakecibe, pe da gwang, nah pecu ranggai, “RAMPAUBE aide rangla, ‘N ki kezeu teune dilu; kedanemene nang tsai zie delu, nang ringlak.’” <verse eid="ISA 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 38:2" />Pecai Hezekiah tangdeu ga zu nreu gailu nah RAMPAUBE dage kekie teigai. <verse eid="ISA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 38:3" />Pa ranggai, “Kehereide, RAMPAUBO, Ih a nlung kai cangsiak eh samsang eh n dwa gade tet kegaide nsung gailo, nah n miakngau gade makeyi tei kegaide.” Pecai Hezekiah hap mrunggai. <verse eid="ISA 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 38:4" />Pecai RAMPAUBE sam Isaiah da gwang eh ranggai, <verse eid="ISA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 38:5" />“Miecu nah Hezekiah dage ranglu, a minadung muiteube, ‘Aide RAMPAUBE, n pau David gu Tinggwang, rangla: Ih n kekie siu da, nah Ih n miakduidung ngau da. Pielo, Ih n teilung ga mmi kereiehmengei ge kaisi beu lai eh bam. <verse eid="ISA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 38:6" />Pecai Ih ncu nah namdi aide de Assyria gwangpei dade kelibeu zie, nah Ih aipau namdi de de gum luzie. <verse eid="ISA 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 38:7" />Aide n ziemne RAMPAUBE dade marehi ge zie, Ih a sampet teicang kera de. <verse eid="ISA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 38:8" />Pielo, Ahaz takswa ga tingkaumie kebam de peu pikiet kerei caisim dizie.’” Cine tingkaumie cide kepet gade pikiet kerei ge caisim di.<verse eid="ISA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 38:9" />Aide Judah gwangpei Hezekiah sia bam eh yidai keludau, pa ketwa lei raugai:<verse eid="ISA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 38:10" />“Ih a teilung ga peri tingdau</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:10">Ih Sheol kiriedung tetkah zie de eh ranggai; Acu cika a teilungh kebang de ziemne cikage langgai di.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:18">Mat. 16:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 38:11" />Ih RAMPAUBE de madaude ngau dai lak lie eh ranggai, RAMPAUBE de keringme deu ga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:11">Ih madaude minadung de mede kideu ga lungh kebamme de pie dai si lakta.<verse eid="ISA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 38:12" />Meurün kekwabe paiki keugi kedi nzwa a teilungh a dade keugidi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">Paidakme ge nzwa Ih a teilungh hedui dida; paidak bam gade nang acu keugidi zeu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">tingkeba nah tingmui kak gade nang a teilung ngkap bam zeu.<verse eid="ISA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 38:13" />Ih tingcang kecang hap bam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:13">hingho nzwa pa a radung teipang di.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:13">Tingkeba nah tingmui kakgade nang a teilungh ngkap bam zeu.<verse eid="ISA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 38:14" />Nruine ge nzwa Ih mra; Ih tamhau ge nzwa mra;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:14">Ih a miak kena nreule ge pie eh leudi. Rampaubo, Ih au keherei dida; acu nghalo.<verse eid="ISA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 38:15" />Ih dai ranglai? Pa a dage ranggai, nah pa teigai da;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:15">Ih a teilungh pelane tet nneu la dizie kedanemene lungrei ne acu ngam kelune.<verse eid="ISA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 38:16" />Rampaubo, nang a ziemne keherei lang kegaide au a ziemne yi; peu a teilung acu peu dailo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:16">nang a teilungh tei hemi dai beuda nah pumteih keyi kai dai beuda.<verse eid="ISA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 38:17" />Lungrei cide Ih ngau kecude au akatei a ziemne kemmi ge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:17">Kengkap hekwaki gade nang acu kelibeu da;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:17">kedanemene nang a kemau leune n caile bie ge kelien gaidi.<verse eid="ISA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 38:18" />Kedanemene Sheol ncu ketwa peu lama; ketsai ncu twa lama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:18">hekwaki ga nghung kedime au n kesamsang ga regui bam lama.<verse eid="ISA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 38:19" />Keringme, keringme, pane ncu twala, Ih henai tei kebam nzwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:19">mipei ge pe name dage n samsang de lia la.<verse eid="ISA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 38:20" />RAMPAUBE acu kelibeu zie da, nah anui helei le suiyi mzi zie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:20">anui RAMPAUBE ki ga kelunghta.” <verse eid="ISA 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 38:21" />Isaiah hegwangpei de ranggai, “Penuide peu tangzüttsi le tei kelu kangge keulu nah reteei gage kaigailu, nah pa yi luzie.” <verse eid="ISA 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 38:22" />Pecai Hezekiah Isaiah de keteu, “Ih RAMPAUBE kiga hang kera marengei de dai zieno?”<verse eid="ISA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="ISA 39" />
  <para style="s">Babylon gade Mina Kegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 39:1" />Cipau tingdau Baladan napei Marduk-Baladan, Babylon gu hegwangpei, Hezekiah da ge laisiu nah mapeu ge langgai; kedanemene pa Hezekiah nra bam eh yi dai lu delie siu kecune. <verse eid="ISA 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 39:2" />Hezekiah ma aidungde ziemne pe sui yidi; pa samgwame de pegu mania pemi kewhung kai kenzeu ki keulia gai, rangkanggeu, kecak, mosala nah maca pemi kewhung, pe reugwanetdung ki nah ma kehekwa ki ga maleu ngau kelu leu. Hezekiah, penuide keulia kemak ma gede ga, pe ki ga, mede pe hegwangram pelane ga. <verse eid="ISA 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 39:3" />Cipaucai Isaiah caihakecibe hegwangpei Hezekiah da gwang nah pecu keteu, “Cipau peidung de ncu dai rang no? Penui dai ga de gwang no?” Hezekiah rangdi, “Penui a da gwang la kemdei Babylon namdi gade.” <verse eid="ISA 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 39:4" />Iciu eh Isaiah pecu keteu, “Penui dai ngau no n ki gade?” Hezekiah keli eh, “Penui a ki ga ma pelane ngau da. Agu mania pemi kewhung kakga Ih penui de ma gede keulia kemak gah da.” <verse eid="ISA 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 39:5" />Cipaucai Isaiah, “Hezekiah dage rangdi, reugwame reu RAMPAUBE sam kingnei lu: <verse eid="ISA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 39:6" />‘Pielo, aipau tingba de gwang di lai zeu da, n hegwangki gade ma pelane, n paume mania henai kecang hekwa lwe kebam de, Babylon ga teupung gwang dizie da. Magede bang nzeu lak, RAMPAUBE cinzwa rangzeu. <verse eid="ISA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 39:7" />N napeidung n dade mna kelumedung, nkatei n name de, penuine penuide ngngwa tetti zie, nah penui Babylon hegwangpei ki ga eunuchme tei dizie.’” <verse eid="ISA 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 39:8" />Cipaucai Hezekiah Isaiah dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE sam nang rang kegai de au yi.” Kedanemene pa cet kecu, “A ting ga kezuyi nah ntiepriep kecu bam dizie.”<verse eid="ISA 39:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="ISA 40" />
  <para style="s">Tinggwang Minadung ziemne Kerelui</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 40:1" />“Helung taumla lu, a mina lung taumla lu,” anui Tinggwang rangla.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 85:8, 2 Cor. 1:4</char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 40:2" />“Jerusalem de rang sünne beu; nah pegu reutak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">cang di delie rang beu, penui maudung gi beudi delei eh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">RAMPAUBE ba gade pe maudung pelane ziemne kena kiee ge ngausilu da.”<verse eid="ISA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 40:3" />Makwa ge sah gai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:3">“Renaamkang ga RAMPAUBE ziemne lampui mtei lu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:3">anui Tinggwang ziemne Arabah ga lampui puidi mzuicing ge teilu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 3:3, Mrk. 1:3, Jhn. 1:23</char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 40:4" />Langkam leune teu ncuh dizie, nah lamlwa nah kideutu tei nsam dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:4">nah nsam kemak deu dungde tei nsam dizie, nah heni mdui kemakdung mdui dizie;<verse eid="ISA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 40:5" />nah RAMPAUBE kendu de liagai dizie, nah mina pelane pie ncüt zie; kedanemene RAMPAUBE mui gade ranggai dida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 3:6</char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 40:6" />Makwa ge sahgai, “Samlia ge sah gailo.” Ih keteu, “Ih daipai sam ge sah lai?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:6">“Mina pumteih au tsehei, nah penui gu samkakkelu samsang au luh gu mapadung nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 40:7" />Tsehei kii dila nah mapa hui dila RAMPAUBE cui cide de müt kegaidau. Kesang mina au cehei bwa ge.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:10">Jas. 1:10</ref>,<ref loc="JAS 1:11">11</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 40:8" />Cehei ki dila, mapa hui dila, dede anui Tinggwang sam au kelungta sap bamzie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:24">1 Pet. 1:24</ref>,<ref loc="1PE 1:25">25</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 40:9" />Samlia keyi kepungbe, zion lamlwatu kehu ga nghang lu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Sahbak gailo, Jerusalem. Nang samlia keyi teu kegwangbe, n kwa cehu gai, ngngi diso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Judah namdidung da ranggai, “Nnui Tinggwang aika bam!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 52:7-8</char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 40:10" />Pielo, RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ngkieng kelu reugwame ge tei eh gwangla, nah pecu pe ba kengking dene gum beu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:10">Pielo, pe ziehi au peda la, nah pa keli kelume pedwa ga tetla.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:7-12">Keu. 22:7-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 40:11" />Pa meurün kekwame ge nzwa pe meurünhau ma pie zie, pa meurünna dungde peba ga hekwa luzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:11">nah pe mlung taiga pwa luzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:11">nah meurünpui dungde nciep mnuo eh lampui sau beuzie meurünna dungde nepam eh.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eze. 34:23, Mic. 5:4</char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 40:12" />Cauge pe ba sum gage dui mdet no, mede peba nzang lwe tinggim mdet no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:12">mede kideube rebuidung marak gage kai no, mede lamlwadung mdet</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:12">mede kideutudung riangteukwak gage mdet no?<verse eid="ISA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 40:13" />Cauge RAMPAUBE kecet cino, mede pe keledeume ge nzwa pecu puisau teilu buino?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Cor. 2:16</char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 40:14" />Pa cau dade keledeu ngau luno? Caune ma petaube tei kera pecu ledeu liano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:14">nah pecu maci ledeu, mede cilu kebui lampui saulia no?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom. 11:34-35</char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 40:15" />Pielo, heleuhdung au marak ga dui kezau nage nzwa, nah riangteukwak ga rebui ge nzwalie cetla;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:15">pielo, RAMPAUBE duigwadeu de ma keceunage nzwa mdet.<verse eid="ISA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 40:16" />Lebanon tsingbangdung de pwa mi tei kera kiee ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:16">mede keru ratak tei kera renaam kaune dungde kiee ma.<verse eid="ISA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 40:17" />Heleuhdung pelane pe dwa gade au kiee ma; pa au penuide magede lie cet ma.<verse eid="ISA 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 40:18" />Ciude nang cau de Tinggwang de keda lai? Nang pecu mamie dai kenzwa le keda lai?<verse eid="ISA 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 40:19" />Mamie ge! Hegeu ta keteime ne teilu: Kecak ta keteime ne kecak teu cide reu pa pwa keniaklu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:19">nah cide ziemne rangkanggeu le tei kelu riadung teigai beu.<verse eid="ISA 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 40:20" />Ratak tei kera mige tsing rim di kelakbe kedet la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:20">pa heciem tei kecime de peilwe mamie kaudi kelak be tei lula.<verse eid="ISA 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 40:21" />Nang ci meni? Nang siu meni? Ncu kerai gade rang meni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:21">Kideu be bangdwa gade nang ci lu meni?<verse eid="ISA 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 40:22" />Pa au mige kideu penli pereu ga ntum kebambe; nah minadung au pedwa gade tangrimdung nzwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:22">Pa tinggim de kehezupai nzwa teu nzang pet nah lungh kera ramzeukidung nzwa tei zanggai beu.<verse eid="ISA 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 40:23" />Tinggwang kedi kengkiengdung de tei ntsam pwa tei nggahzing dila nah kideu kedi kengkieng dungde pwa kemta tei dila.<verse eid="ISA 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 40:24" />Penuide au ling kwa ma, nrok kwa ma, penui kiak au hangdeu ga pe mah him ncok luma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:24">pa penui reu ga müt gai kecu dau kii dila nah reigau nzwa tingkai ne gui pungtet dila.<verse eid="ISA 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 40:25" />“Ciciu cai nang acu cauge de keu keda lai, Ih cau nzwa nau?” Tinggwang kemcibe cinzwa rangzeu.<verse eid="ISA 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 40:26" />Tingkam ga ngang pie gailo! Caune aipau hegidung de dam gai no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">Pa penui hangge ge de teuswa nah penui pelane de hezi gade qula.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">Pe kedi gade nah pe kengkieng gade, kette gah dima!<verse eid="ISA 40:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 40:27" />Nang daitei rang no, Jacob, nah ndugai no, Israel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:27">“RAMPAUBE dade a lampui hebai dida, nah a Tinggwang a nzeu de ma pie ma”?<verse eid="ISA 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 40:28" />Nang ci meni? Nang siu meni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">Kelunghta Tinggwang, RAMPAUBE, kideube penli dam kegaibe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">madaude leu mede nnei lama; pe macet au pe nli tei lama.<verse eid="ISA 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 40:29" />Pa leu kelame de kengking peu la; nah kenneime de kengking keheci pwa peula.<verse eid="ISA 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 40:30" />Henamedung de leu nah nnei di la, nah rehangme ge pepi nrap eh kau dila:<verse eid="ISA 40:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 40:31" />Dede RAMPAUBE dade kengha nlum kecume au penui kengking tei heci dai lu zie; penui au heliedung nzwa lim cuh dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:31">penui pak zie nah leu dilak; penui tet zie nah nnei dilak.<verse eid="ISA 40:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="ISA 41" />
  <para style="s">Israel de Kenghabe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 41:1" />“A dwa gade zing de eh kingnei lu, nnui jaaidikung deudung; peu ge heleuhdung de penui kengking tei heci dai lu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">peu penui de gwang mna lwe marang lu; anui gwang ncüt lwe dai petau bi resiu gwang go.<verse eid="ISA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 41:2" />Naimiak kepet lede gwakelube de cau no, pecu makesangbe ga qu eh pe ta tei kera?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Pa heleuhdung pe reu gage kai beu nah hegwangdung de teu kera pecu ngha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Pa penui de pe kingtie le rebui tei di, pe heleilakpi ne reigau gui zangra kedi nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 41:3" />Pa penui caisui la nah kwak eh tet kahgwang la, pe lampui mzet zu kela ne pepi hangdeu tung tadi nage la.<verse eid="ISA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 41:4" />Caune aipau tadung de tei gai nah tei canglu dino? Cau ne raitu gade ceheudung de qulu dino?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:4">Ih, RAMPAUBE, raitube, nah kamtube de, Ih au pa.<verse eid="ISA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 41:5" />Duigwadeu cide ngau da nah penui hing bam dida; kideu penli dung mlai di;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:5">penui cika gwang.<verse eid="ISA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 41:6" />Migege de pekidame de ngha, nah migege de ket ket de rang, ‘Kuu bamlu.’<verse eid="ISA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 41:7" />Cine tsingta keteime kecak kerekime de tei kecung lu, nah cauge hegeu teisang ta tei kelame cai ge geu kerüt tah teila bi pecu de tei ngkuu lu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:7">geu ru kau kecu de rang eh, ‘Cide au yi’. Penui gojal le gia ncüt lu pereu ga kau kelak ne.<verse eid="ISA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 41:8" />Dede nang, Israel, a kilabe, Ih ne kedet kelube Jacob,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:8">a zangbe Abraham leuhme,<verse eid="ISA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 41:9" />Nang au Ih kideu penli gade ngngwa gwang dai kelube, nah Ih deitu henidung gade qu kelube,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:9">nah Ih ainzwa rang, ‘Nang au a kilabe;’ Ih ncu kedet luda nah ncu mlai dima. <verse eid="ISA 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 41:10" />Ngngi di so, kedanemene Ih nda la lu. N mlung ceu diso, kedanemene Ih n Tinggwang.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:10">Ih ncu tei ngking beu zie, nah Ih ncu de ngha beu zie, nah kesamsang a ba zetle le ncu de teu ncuh beu zie.<verse eid="ISA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 41:11" />Pielo, penui ngngam dizie nah hengam tei dizie, pelane cau ge ncu perata la bi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:11">penui au ma gede kemak nzwa gahdi zie, ncu renia kelame.<verse eid="ISA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 41:12" />Nang peei zie nah ncu renia kelame dung de ngau lu ta di zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:12">ncu regie kelame ma de kemak nzwa di zie, magede mezing.<verse eid="ISA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 41:13" />Ih, RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang, n ba zetle herak lu zie kecune,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:13">ncu rang eh, ‘Ngngi di so; Ih ncu ngha bam.’<verse eid="ISA 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 41:14" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “Ngngi di so, Jacob nang tangseu, nah nang Israelme pei;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:14">Ih ncu ngha beu zie, aide RAMPAUBE rang kegai be, n keli kelube, Israel Tinggwang kemcibe.<verse eid="ISA 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 41:15" />Pielo, Ih ncu ciuneutie pemui keyige nzwa tei beuzie, keheci nah pemui kena;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:15">nang lamlwatu neuzie nah penuide tei takcai dizie; nang kideutudung de ciurie nzwa tei dizie.<verse eid="ISA 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 41:16" />Nang penui dage tingkai guigai zie, nah penuide tingkai ne pung tetdi zie; tingkai ne penuide tei zang dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:16">RAMPAUBE gade nnui suiyi lu zie, nnui suiyi lu zie Israel Tinggwang kemcibe gade.<verse eid="ISA 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 41:17" />Mine kegahme nah keherei kelame dui peei, dede cika kette gah, nah penui mleudung hereu eh cangh di;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:17">Ih, RAMPAUBE, penui kekie dung keli beu zie; Ih, Israel Tinggwang, penui de pütti lak.<verse eid="ISA 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 41:18" />Ih reuceunadung lwa hung kera teibeu zie, nah duipindung langkamdung kakga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:18">Ih hangdeuketsai de tei pwa dui zai teidi zie nah kecang deudung de duipwak dui teibeu zie.<verse eid="ISA 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 41:19" />Renaamkang ga Ih cedar kai gai zie, acacia, nah myrtle, nah olive bang.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:19">Ih hangdeuketsai langkam ga cypress kaigai zie, helei nah cypress bangdung de si eh.<verse eid="ISA 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 41:20" />Ih aide teigai zie iciude minadung ngaulu kerane, cilu, nah cet nsamlu kera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:20">RAMPAUBE ba ne cide teigai lie kecu, Israel Tinggwang kemcibe ne cide teigai lie kecu.<verse eid="ISA 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 41:21" />“N ha ndu lia lu,” de RAMPAUBE rang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:21">“Nnui gu mamie dung ziemne nnui lungning yitu be ndu gai lu,” Jacob gwangpei cinzwa rangzeu.<verse eid="ISA 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 41:22" />Peu penuide penui lungningdung teugwang lu; penui de pe dwaga peu gwanglu nah anuide daitei zie bi peu ge ndu gai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">ciu eh anui ma aidungde ci mmi lu kerane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">Peu penuide anui dage ndaa mrai ndu kegai dung de rang gai beulo, ciu cai anui cika pie caili lubui nah dainzwa tei cang bi kecu ci luzie.<verse eid="ISA 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 41:23" />Aipau cai daitei di zie bi rang gai lo, ciu de nang rabedung lie kecu anui cilu kerane;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:23">makeyi mede kesia ge tei gai lu, cinzwa eh anui de tei ngngi nah anui ci nting lu kerane.<verse eid="ISA 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 41:24" />Pielu, nang mamiedung au kemta nah nnui batadung au kemta; ncu kedet kelube de au kemneeu.<verse eid="ISA 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 41:25" />Ih tingpeule de mige de teu cuhlu, nah pa gwang; tingnaimiak kepet lede Ih pecu qugai cauge a zi qu bi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">nah pa kengking keteume dungde tangdei nzwa pidau tei dizie, li keteime ge lidei keniak kecu nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 41:26" />Cau ge ne raitu gade ndu gai no, anui cibam lu kerane? Aipau ting dwa ga, anui rang lubui, “Pa au petau”?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:26">Kesang migede hezai mzai ma, yeo, migede nang marang kecu kette siu ma.<verse eid="ISA 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 41:27" />Ih, RAMPAUBE, Zion dage sam aide rang kebeu raitube, “Pielu aika penui bam da;” Ih Jerusalem ga samgwame gede langgai.<verse eid="ISA 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 41:28" />Ih herabe dung kakga pie kegai dau, migede gah, penui kakga migede samkeyi rang kerame gah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:28">cauge, Ih keteu kegai dau, sam kelilu kera bam no.<verse eid="ISA 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 41:29" />Pielo, hera aidung pelane au kemta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:29">and penui tadung au kemta; penui gu rekikelu hegeu miedung au tingkai nah mrwa cwa.<verse eid="ISA 41:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="ISA 42" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube Kilabe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 42:1" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “Ainie, a kilabe, Ih ne teu ncuh kelube; Ih ne kedet kelube, Ih pecu asui lie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:1">Ih pereu ga ge a rabe kai gai dida; pa heleuh dung de kemzui keugwang beu zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 3:17, Luk. 9:35, 2 Pet. 1:7</char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 42:2" />Pa ma sah mede nrung lak, mede puidikidung ga pekwa siu kera tei lak.<verse eid="ISA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 42:3" />Pa hekuu kiakmie kebam de teicum di lak, nah helei mmüt di lai eh kebam de pa tei mmüt di lak:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:3">pa samsang eh kemzui be tei gai zie.<verse eid="ISA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 42:4" />Pa au pe kengkieng mede keregui de gah dilak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:4">kideu ga kemzui be teu gwanglu kemak ta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:4">nah jaaidikung deudung pe keledeu kwa bam.<verse eid="ISA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 42:5" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang pe kilabe dage ainzwa rang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">Tinggimdung damgai nah teimdi kegaibe, kideu tei kegaibe nah cika lungh kepet pelane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">minadung de cuingi peu kegaibe nah lungh kebam dung de kering kepeube:<verse eid="ISA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 42:6" />“Ih, RAMPAUBE, ncu kemzeube gage qulu nah n ba kerak teula zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:6">Ih ncu kai nzeu zie nah minadung ziemne samkak kelu ge tei zie, Gentileme ziemne kebaa ge zie,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 2:32, Bat. 13:47</char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 42:7" />miakcitme miakdung tei mrak beu kera ziemne, hangdeu kang hebaangki ga kebammedung de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:7">nah kemui ga bam kela baang kenzeu ki gade lungmpet beu kera ziemne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 61:1, Bat. 26:18</char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 42:8" />Ih au RAMPAUBE, cide au a zi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:8">nah a kendu Ih kedame de mzi lak mede a ketwa de tei kelu mamiedung de mzi lak.<verse eid="ISA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 42:9" />Pielu, pedwa dung de gwang cang lada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:9">cu au Ih ma kehecidung de ndu lia zie da.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:9">Penui gwang di kemak dwa Ih penui ha ranglia zie.”<verse eid="ISA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 42:10" />RAMPAUBE dage lei keheci ge tei gai lu, nah pecu twa lu kideu penli gade;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:10">nang jaaidi kang hung kelabe, nah cika kebam pelane, jaaidikung deudung, nah cika lungh kebamme.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 96:1-3, 97:1</char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 42:11" />Peu hangdeuketsai deu nah namdi dung de mrung gai, Kedar lungh kebam renamdung de peu suiyi sah lu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:11">Sela namdi ga kelunghme dung de peu lei tei lu; peu penuide lamlwa twangdung gade sah lu.<verse eid="ISA 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 42:12" />Peu penuide RAMPAUBE de kemdu peulo nah pe hetwa jaaidikung deudung ga ndu gai lo.<verse eid="ISA 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 42:13" />RAMPAUBE reugwame ge nzwa tetpet zie; hereu keteibe pei nzwa pa ren de cuh dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:13">Pa sah zie, yeo, pa pegu hereu kwa sah mrung zie; pa pe ngauraumedung de pe kengking pwa lia zie.<verse eid="ISA 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 42:14" />Ih peting ketie ge mlei mene bam dida; Ih sünne eh akatei acu kezeu pwa bam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:14">cu au Ih mipui kemna tetteei kecunzwa mragai zieda; Ih ngngi mzetsüt dizie.<verse eid="ISA 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 42:15" />Ih lamlwa nah kideutuhdung ngkap dizie da nah penui gu tsehei gineidung pelane tei kii dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:15">nah Ih hereukidung de duigwadeu dung tei dizie kehwa deu langkamdung de tei cangh dizie.<verse eid="ISA 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 42:16" />Ih miakcietme de ngngwa gwang zie penui ci kemak lampui gade; lampuidung penui ci kemak ga Ih ne penui puisau tei zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Ih penui dwaga kemui de kebaa tei di zie, nah kenkoi nidung de tei mzui di zie. Aidung de Ih tei zie, nah Ih penui de gidi lak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 3:5, Isa. 29:18</char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 42:17" />Penuide teu caili dizie, penuide hengam ga ge kaidi zie, mamie de nlum kelame de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:17">hegeu mie de ainzwa rang kelabe de, “Nang au anui rabe.”<verse eid="ISA 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 42:18" />Kingnei lu, nnui kwenpangme; nah pielo, nnui miakcitme, nang ngau lu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:5">Mat. 11:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 42:19" />A kila swade cauge pe miak citgwa no? Mede pe kwen pang no Ih lang kegai a samgwame nzwa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:19">Cauge a samkak kelu zangna nzwa miakcit no, mede RAMPAUBE kilabe nzwa miakcit no?<verse eid="ISA 42:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 42:20" />Nang ma kekiee ge ngau, dede cide ci luma; kwen dung ngkei pwa bam, dede migede siu ma.<verse eid="ISA 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 42:21" />RAMPAUBE pe kemzeu de twa kegai pesui la nah pegu hezaidung tei ndu kegai de.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 5:17-18</char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 42:22" />Dede aipau minadung de au mine cwa nah süt teu kedime;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">penui pelane de hekwakidung gage baang nzeu dida, hebaangkidung gage kebai dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">penui au sütteu kedime ge mi de keli beu kera kegah ge tei dida, nah migede rang ma, “Penuide teu cailigwang lu!”<verse eid="ISA 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 42:23" />Cauge nnui kakgade aide kingnei lai? Caineu ne cauge kingnei nah siu lai?<verse eid="ISA 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 42:24" />Caune Jacob de sütketyeime reu gage ha di no nah Israel de keregame dage?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">RAMPAUBE ne meni, anui pedage kemau tei gai kedibe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">penui cau lampui ga tet gai kera mlai di no, nah cau gu hezaidung mzai lu ta dino?<verse eid="ISA 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 42:25" />Cine RAMPAUBE perata siasüt kecu Israelme dage ruigai nah hetei hereu de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">mi le penuide twagwalu, dede penui ci luma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">cide ne penuide ru ngkap di, dede cide penui penui mlung gage keu gai luma.<verse eid="ISA 42:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="ISA 43" />
  <para style="s">Israel de Kelikelu Ket Rünne</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 43:1" />Dede cu RAMPAUBE ainzwa rang, ncu dam kegaibe, Jacob, nah marehi gage ncu tei kegaibe, Israel:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:1">“Ngngi diso, kedanemene Ih ncu kelilu da; Ih ncu nzi gade qulu da, nang au agu.<verse eid="ISA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 43:2" />Nang duidung ga kahpet kecu dau, Ih ncu ngngwa la zie; nah hereuki dung kahpet kecu dau penui nreu ngam di lak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:2">Nang mi ga kah pet kecu dau ncu ru dilak, nah miheu dung ne ncu tei msia di lak.<verse eid="ISA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 43:3" />Kedanemene Ih RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang, Israel Tinggwang kemcibe, nnuide keli beu kelabe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:3">Ncu rilu kera pemi ziemne Ih Egypt de ha, Ethiopia nah Seba le ncu rehiak.<verse eid="ISA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 43:4" />Nang au a miakngau gade pemi hung nah mlang kecune, Ih ncu ku;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:4">ciziemne Ih ncu rehiak kerane mina de ha zie, nah n teilung ziemne mi kedamedung de rehiak zie.<verse eid="ISA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 43:5" />Ngngi di so, kedanemene Ih ncu ngngwa la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:5">Ih naimiak kepetle de n minadung de ngngwa gwang zie, nah ncu kenlwetle de hekwa lu zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eze. 36:24, Zec. 8:7</char></note><verse eid="ISA 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 43:6" />Ih tingpeule de rang zie, ‘Penui ba gage kaibeu,’ nah tingbangleme de, ‘Penuide teu caili so,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:6">Kemdei gade a napeimedung de ngngwa gwang lu, nah a napuime dungde kemdei renam kideudung gade,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 107:2-3</char></note><verse eid="ISA 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 43:7" />keheibe de a zi gade qu kegaime, Ih a kendu ziemne dam kegaime, Ih ne perehi tei kegaime, yeo, Ih ne tei kegaime.<verse eid="ISA 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 43:8" />Miakcitme de ngngwa mpet lu, penui miak bam liede, nah kwenpangme de, penui kwendung bam liede.<verse eid="ISA 43:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 43:9" />Heleuhdung pelane hekwa lu, nah minadung ngkwa lu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Cauge penui kakgade aide rang lubui no nah pedwa tei kedidung de rang lu kera?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Peu penui katei penui mzeu lie kecu zierang tei kera ngngwa gwang lu, peu penuide siu lu nah cilu eh ndugailu, ‘Cide au kesang.’<verse eid="ISA 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 43:10" />Nnui au a zierangbe,” RAMPAUBE ndu gai, “nah a kilabe Ih ne kedet kelube,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">ciu eh nnui ci lu nah acu nlum lu zie, nah Ih pa lie kecu ci lu zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">A dwa ga rabe kedadung gede gah nah a cai de kette bam lak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jhn. 1:7-8, keh. 45:6</char></note><verse eid="ISA 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 43:11" />Ih au RAMPAUBE, nah kelikelube keda gah dede Ih rünne.<verse eid="ISA 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 43:12" />Ih ndugai dida, keliluda, nah ranggai, nah nnui kakga rabe keda gede gah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:12">Nang a zierangbe,” RAMPAUBE ndu gai, “Ih au Tinggwang.<verse eid="ISA 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 43:13" />Henai tingba gade Ih au pa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:13">nah a ba gade migede mi keheibe de keli gai lak. Ih tei gai zie, nah cau ge cide teu caili lulai?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:17">1 Tim. 1:17</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 9:18">Rom. 9:18</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 9:19">19</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 43:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 43:14" />RAMPAUBE ainzwa rang, nnui gu Kelikelube, Israel gu Kemcibe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">“Nnui ziemne Ih Babylon ga langgai nah penui pelane de ngngwa gwang zie pak kelame de nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">Babylonme suiyi de tei nreu pwa kehap leidung tei di.<verse eid="ISA 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 43:15" />Ih au RAMPAUBE, nnui gu Kemcibe, Israel dam kegaibe, nnui Gwangpei.”<verse eid="ISA 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 43:16" />RAMPAUBE ainzwa rang (cau ne jaaidi ga lampui ngkei beu no nah dui kedidung ga lampui,<verse eid="ISA 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 43:17" />caune bagi nah hekwen de teu mpet beu no, reugwame de nah kengkieng minabe de. Penui kau mie nsam di;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:17">penui cuh dai silak; penuide tei ngkap dida, maca ru kebamde nzwa mmüt dida.)<verse eid="ISA 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 43:18" />Dede RAMPAUBE rangla, “Ndaa gwang kedibe hadung cet la so, mede ndaa tei kedidung de mning bam so.<verse eid="ISA 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 43:19" />Pielo, Ih ma keheci tei lai eh bam; cu cide tei ndeu bam dida; nang cide ngau meni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:19">Ih hangdeuketsai deu ga lampui tei zie nah renaamkang ga duireuki dung.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 107:35</char></note><verse eid="ISA 43:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 43:20" />Luh ga renaam kaunedung de acu rüt zie, maiserung nah ruitiedung de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:20">kedanemene Ih hetaideu ga dui peu la, nah hangdeu ketsai ga hereukidung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:20">Ih ne kedet kelumedung de peu sak kera,<verse eid="ISA 43:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 43:21" />aipau minadung Ih akatei ziemne tei kelume,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:21">penui a kendu de ndulu kerane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Cor. 10:31, 1 Pet. 2:9</char></note><verse eid="ISA 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 43:22" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “Dede nnui acu qugai ma, Jacob; nnui acu ngau leu dida, Israel.<verse eid="ISA 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 43:23" />Nnui nnui gu meuründung acu keru ratakdung tei kera teugwang beu ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:23">mede nnui ratakdung pwa acu rüt luma. Ih meiciu mapeudung le pwa nnui püt tei rüt dima, mede perim kehengui kie eh tei leu dima.<verse eid="ISA 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 43:24" />Nang a dage kekum rimdung keugwang beu ma rangkang de si eh, mede nnui ratak cadung rui mpet gai beu ma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:24">dede nnui maudung pwa a püt tei rütdi, nnui kemau tahdung tei eh acu tei leu dida.<verse eid="ISA 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 43:25" />Ih, yeo, Ih, au n mau akatei a ziemne keugi di kelabe; nah Ih n mau madau gede nsung si dai lakta.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heb. 10:17, 8:12, Jer. 31:34</char></note><verse eid="ISA 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 43:26" />Tei kedidung de peu acu nsung gai lo. Anui pekiebe ngngwa resiu nsam go; nnui tei kedidung de teugwang lu, nnui mzeu lie kecu cilu kerane.<verse eid="ISA 43:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 43:27" />Nnui pau raitume kemau tei di, nah nnui muiteumedung a dage kemau tei gai di.<verse eid="ISA 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 43:28" />Cine Ih nnui reu kedimedung de a kerecaki tei hera di; Ih Jacob reu gage ngkap zing kera teugwang gai, nah Israelme de peu hengam tei dizie.”<verse eid="ISA 43:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="ISA 44" />
  <para style="s">Israel Kedetkelube</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 44:1" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “Cu kingneilu, Jacob a kilabo, nah Israel, Ih ne kedet kelube:<verse eid="ISA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 44:2" />RAMPAUBE aide rangla, ncu tei kebeube nah neki gade ncu teigailu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">nah ncu ngha kerabe: “Ngngi so, Jacob a kilabo; nah nang, Jeshurun, Ih ne kedet kelube.<verse eid="ISA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 44:3" />Ih hangdeu hereu kelade gage hedui ruigai zie, nah hangdeu kecangh ga reuceudung peu lwamie zie kecune;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:3">Ih n dade lunggwang kelume dage a Rabe ruigai zie, nah n name dage a samlam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">44:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 21:6, Joe. 2:28</char></note><verse eid="ISA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 44:4" />Penui ceheibwa kakga lungh cuhzie, reuceunadung taiga willow bang nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 44:5" />Mige rangzie, ‘Ih RAMPAUBE gu,’ nah kedage Jacob zi qu zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:5">nah mi kedage pe ba gage, ‘RAMPAUBE gu dida,’ de eh rau zie nah pekatei pecu Israel zi teu eh qu zie.”<verse eid="ISA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rampaube, Mamie Ma</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 44:6" />Aide RAMPAUBE rangla, Israel Gwangpei nah pe kelikelube, reugwame reu RAMPAUBE:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:6">“Ih raitube, nah Ih kamtube; nah Ih rünne gwale Tinggwang keda kette gah.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">44:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 1:17, 21:6, 22:13</char></note><verse eid="ISA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 44:7" />Ih nzwa cauge bam no? Pecu peu cide rang ndu gailo nah acu ranglia lo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:7">Ih ndaa a minadung de teikegai gade hetadung tei kegwang dungde, nah peu penuide teigwang dai kera tadung depeu rang ndu gailo.<verse eid="ISA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 44:8" />Hingso mede ngngi diso. Ih nnui dage ndaa rang ndulia gai meni, nah ranglia meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">Nnui a zierangdung da: Ih si kemak Tinggwang keda kette bam si reuni? Tsura keda kette gah; Ih kette cima.”<verse eid="ISA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 44:9" />Mamie keteime leune au magede ma; nah hera aidungde penui sui keladung de au pemi gah;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:9">penui zierangdung ma ngau lama nah magede ci lama, nah penuide hengam tei dizie.<verse eid="ISA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 44:10" />Cauge pemi kegah hera ge mede mamie ge teigai lai?<verse eid="ISA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 44:11" />Pielo, mamie reca kelame leune de hengam tei dizie; mamie keteime au mina ge gwale ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:11">Penuide peu gwang ncütlu; penui ngngi dizie nah penuide hengam tei dizie.<verse eid="ISA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 44:12" />Hegeu ta keteime pe niadung teu eh heta teila, pe zu teila, miceu gade heta teila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:12">Pa hegeuteisang le perehi reki gaila nah pe ba kengking le hetah teila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:12">Pa mzeu la, nah pe kengking gah dila; pa dui sak lama nah pa nnei dila.<verse eid="ISA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 44:13" />Tsingta keteibe tsing mdetla, nah kerautie dele pegiak giak lula.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:13">Pa pe niadung teu eh perehi tei lula nah kemdet tie dele giak gai dila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:13">Pa cide mina rehi gage teigai la, hezu keyi mina ge nzwa, iciu eh kilung gage kailu kerane.<verse eid="ISA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 44:14" />Pa cedarbangdung bi ngkei dila, mede pa heleibang mede mhubang kedet lula.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:14">Pa pekatei pe ziemne hegung gade tsingbangdung keu lula. Pa fir bang linggai la nah tingrui ne cide depeu lungcuh lula.<verse eid="ISA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 44:15" />Pecai mipei ge cide keu tsingdiak teila nah pekatei pecu tei lum lula. Yeo, pa mi teila nah tangku ru la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:15">Pecai pa cidele pwa herabe ge teila nah cide de keukeimie reca la.<verse eid="ISA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 44:16" />Pa tsing kesa teu mi teila, pa cika heteih rula. Pa cide tyei eh mnung lula.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:16">Pa pekatei pecu teilum lula nah rangla, “Ah, Ih lum dida, Ih hemi de ngauda.”<verse eid="ISA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 44:17" />Tsing kebangbe le pa herabe ge teila, pane reki kelu mie ge; pa cide de keukei mie reca la nah herüt peula,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:17">nah cide dage kekie tei eh rangla, “Acu keli beulo, kedanemene nang a tinggwang lu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">44:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat. 17:29</char></note><verse eid="ISA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 44:18" />Penui ci lama, mede penui cide daibi cilu lama, penui miak cit kecune nah ma ngaula kemakne, nah penui mlung cide cilu lama.<verse eid="ISA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 44:19" />Migede macet lama, nah penui cilu eh aide ranglu lama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:19">“Ih tsing kesa mi gage ru dida; yeo, Ih mi gage tangku ruda. Ih mi gage heteih ruda nah tyei luda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:19">Nah Ih cu tsing kedadungde le mi ngau kemneeudung ge tei eh reca zieni? Ih tsing kangge de keukei mie reca zieni?”<verse eid="ISA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 44:20" />Cide au mimüt tyei kebam ge nzwada; cwa teu kela pe mlung ne pecu pe lampui sau mau beula. Pa pekatei pecu kelilu gailak, mede pa, “A ba zetle lebie kebam aide au kenret rabe,” de eh rang lama.<verse eid="ISA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 44:21" />Ma aidungde cetgailo, Jacob, nah Israel, kedanemene nang a kilabe kecune:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:21">Ih ncu teigai; nang a kilabe: Israel, Ih ncu nsungta dilak.<verse eid="ISA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 44:22" />Ih hemwa kedi ge nzwa nnui renia kela tahdung de guigi dida, nah hemwa ge nzwa, nnui maudung;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:22">a da cailigwanglu, Ih nnuide kelibeu delu.<verse eid="ISA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 44:23" />Helei teilu, nnui tinggimdung, kedanemene RAMPAUBE aide tei kegaine; sahlu, kideube kecokdung.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Helei tei sahlu, nnui lamlwadung, tsingbang leune kebam hegung;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">RAMPAUBE Jacob de kelibeu kecune, nah Israel ga pe kendu lia beuzie kecune.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">44:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 69:34-35, Isa. 49:13</char></note><verse eid="ISA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem ga Lung kera</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 44:24" />Nnui kelikelube, nnuide neki gage teigai kebeube RAMPAUBE aide rangla:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">“Ih au RAMPAUBE, ma pekiene tei kegaibe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">Ih akatei tinggimdung teimdi kegaibe, Ih akatei kideube de tei kegaibe.<verse eid="ISA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 44:25" />Pekie kegah reka sam rang kelame de Ih penui lunghop tei kegaibe nah ma kereka pei kelame de tei hengam tei kegaibe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:25">Ih maci kelame maci de de teu hekum di kelabe nah penui keledeu de de kemie tei dila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">44:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Job. 5:12-14, 1 Cor. 1:20</char></note><verse eid="ISA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 44:26" />Ih, RAMPAUBE, a kilabe samdung de teicang beu kelabe nah pe samgwame mrai rang kegaidung de teicang beu kelabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">Jerusalem dage rangla, ‘Cika mina lungh dizie,’ nah Judah namdung dage, ‘Penuide retak dai luzie, nah Ih kau kedi gade teu ncuh dai beuzie’;<verse eid="ISA 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 44:27" />jaaidi kecok dage, ‘Cangh dilu, nah Ih n reukidung teicangh dizie,’ de eh rang kegaibe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:36">Jer. 51:36</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 44:28" />Cyrus dage, ‘Pa a meurün kekwabe, pa Ih luu keneu leune tei zie; Jerusalem ga pa hezai teibeu zie, ‘Cide retak dai luzie,’ nah kerecaki de ziemne ranggai, ‘Peu pe bangdwa dwalu,’” de eh rang kegaibe au RAMPAUBE da.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:1-3">Ezr. 1:1-3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 44:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="ISA 45" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 45:1" />Aide RAMPAUBE pa keniak kelube, Cyrus dage ranggai, pe zetle ba Ih ne teu lala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">heleuhdung reu peu ngkinglu kerane, hegwangmedung kengking sütlu kerane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">nah pe dwaga kikamdung ngkeilu kerane, iciu eh kiriekidung ngkei pwabamlu kerane:<verse eid="ISA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 45:2" />“Ih n dwaga rai mie zie nah lamlwatudung tei nsam dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:2">Hetageu kikamdung de Ih tei takcai dizie nah pe hegeutiedung de Ih dang takcai dizie,<verse eid="ISA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 45:3" />nah Ih kemui ga kebam nah hebai kedi mabam pwa ncu peu zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:3">ciciude nang, Ih RAMPAUBE, Ih n zi teu eh qu kegaibe, Israel Tinggwang lie kecu ci lubui.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jer. 27:5, Col. 2:3</char></note><verse eid="ISA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 45:4" />A kilabe Jacob, nah Ih kedet kelu Israel ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:4">Ih n zi qu eh ncu hetwa kepung zi de peu zeu, nah nang acu ci meliede.<verse eid="ISA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 45:5" />Ih au RAMPAUBE lie, nah mi keda gede gah; Ih caile Tinggwang keda gah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:5">Hereu tei kerane Ih n reunet peu zie, nang acu ci meliede;<verse eid="ISA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 45:6" />ciciude tingnaimiak kepet gade, nah naimiak kenlüt gade, minadung Ih gwale hera keda gah lie kecu ci luzie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:6">Ih au RAMPAUBE, nah cika keda gede gah lie.<verse eid="ISA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 45:7" />Ih kebaa de teigai nah kemui de teigai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:7">Ih kezuyi teugwang la nah kensum de teigai la; Ih au RAMPAUBE ma ai pelane tei kegaibe.<verse eid="ISA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 45:8" />Nnui tinggimdung, nreu le de tingrui nghung lo! Peu ting gade kesamsang rui nghung lo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">Peu kideube de cide luulu, kelikelu lungh cuhlu kerane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">nah kesamsang de si eh lungh cuhlu kerane. Ih, RAMPAUBE, ci kenana de dam gai.<verse eid="ISA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 45:9" />Co mige penuide dam kegaibe de ngngwa kesamlim kera au, pe dade au hangdeu ga kebam lidei li pelane kakga de lidei li kedage nzwa da!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Lidei li keteibe dade, ‘Nang daipai tei au no?’ Mede ‘N bata ga au peki bam memi’ de eh keteu lani?<verse eid="ISA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 45:10" />Co mige pe pei dage kerang be au, ‘Nang daipai de nkwet zeu no?’ Mede mipui ge de, ‘Nang daipai ge de nna zeu no?’<verse eid="ISA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 45:11" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ranggai, Israel Kemci Tinggwang, pecu Dam kegaibe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:11">‘Nang daitei eh Ih a namedung dage daipai teigai ziebi de kecu acu keteu lano? Ih daitei ziebi nang ne acu ranglia zieni?’<verse eid="ISA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 45:12" />‘Ih kideu teigai nah cika mina de dam gai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:12">Ih a ba le tinggimdung teigai, nah hegidung leune de pet kerane Ih aja kaigai.<verse eid="ISA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 45:13" />Samsang kerane Ih Cyrus de kelunggai, nah Ih pe lampuidung tei mzui beu zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Pa a namdi teigai zie; pa a mina langgi kedime de pe ki riep ga peu mie dizie, nah rangkang nah hetau henim ziemne ma,’” de eh reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ranggai.<verse eid="ISA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 45:14" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">“Egyptme ne mahi kelu nah Cush nah Sabeanme maheidung, mina tie kedi kemlangme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">n dage teugwang beuzie. Penui ngu zie. Penui n cai sui zie, hegeuria le kangpung eh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">Penui n da keumie zie nah penui nggia kie eh rang zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">‘Tinggwang ncu ngngwala kesang, nah pa rünne gwale mi keda gah.’”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zec. 8:22-23, Keu. 3:9</char></note><verse eid="ISA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 45:15" />Nang au nkatei ncu hebai teu kela Tinggwang, Israel Tinggwang, Kelikelube.<verse eid="ISA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 45:16" />Penui pelane nggam dizie nah penuide tei hengam teiciak dizie; mamie tei kelame hengam ga tet zie.<verse eid="ISA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 45:17" />Dede Israel de RAMPAUBE ne rilu zie kelunghta kelikelu dele;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:17">nang madauge de ngngam di mede tei hengam dai dilak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom. 10:11, Joe. 2:26-27, Heb. 5:9</char></note><verse eid="ISA 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 45:18" />RAMPAUBE aide ranggai, tinggimdung tei kegaibe, kesang Tinggwang</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">kideu dam kegaibe nah tei kegaibe, cide tei ntip nah bam tie kelu tei kegaibe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">Pa cide dam gai, kemta ge eh teigai ma, dede peu mide cika lunghlu kerane riemlu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">“Ih au RAMPAUBE, nah hera keda kette gah.<verse eid="ISA 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 45:19" />Ih heni kembai bam ge gade ngkim eh marang ma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">Jacob leuhme dage Ih aide ranggai ma, ‘Kemta gage acu peeilu!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">Ih au RAMPAUBE, kesangbe rang kelabe; Ih kemzuibe peu cikegai teila.<verse eid="ISA 45:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 45:20" />Gwang ngkwalu nah gwanglu! Gwang ngkwa kwalu, heleuhdung kakgade nnui pak kelamedung!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">Penui maci gah, mamiedung tei kecume nah kelibeu gai kelak herabedung dage kekie tei kelame.<verse eid="ISA 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 45:21" />Gwang mnalu nah a dage ranglia lo, ci mcilu kebuibe ge teugwanglu! Penuide peu mariem ncütlu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Ndaa gede cide caune keulia no? Caune cide rangno?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Ih RAMPAUBE ne meni? Ih rünne gwale Tinggwang keda gah, kemzeu Tinggwang nah Kelikelube; Ih gwale keda migede gah.<verse eid="ISA 45:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 45:22" />A dage nreulu nah kelilu, kideu penli ga kebam leune;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:22">kedanemene Ih Tinggwang lu, nah keda gede gah.<verse eid="ISA 45:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 45:23" />Ih akatei a dage sampet la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:23">a kemzeu hezai rang eh, nah cide caili nreu dilak:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:23">‘Pelane a dage kwaktung mie zie, mleu pelane sampet zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heb. 6:13, Rom. 14:11, Phi. 2:10-11</char></note><verse eid="ISA 45:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 45:24" />Penui acu rangzie, “RAMPAUBE da rünne kelikelu nah kengking bam.”’”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:24">Caugamme pecu penui rata labi penui pelane nggam dizie.<verse eid="ISA 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 45:25" />RAMPAUBE dade Israel leuhme pelane de kelilu zie; penui pe ziemne hegie luzie.<verse eid="ISA 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="ISA 46" />
  <para style="s">Babylon Rabedung</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 46:1" />Isaiah rangla, “Bel keukei mie, Nebo koktung mie; penai gu mamiedung</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:1">makaunedung nah hepwet kerüt gu teikuu ne teupung. Nnui teupung kela mamie aidungde au leu kela makaune ziemne hepwet kerüt ge.<verse eid="ISA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 46:2" />Penui ncüt eh keukei mie, kwaktung mie; penui mamiedung de kelilu gailak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:2">nah penui be hebaangme ge teidi.<verse eid="ISA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 46:3" />RAMPAUBE rangzeu, “A kwa kingneilu, Jacob leuhme, bang pwa kebam Israel leuhme leune,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:3">nna lu kemakne gade Ih ne penui mapie, pe pui pok gade penui mapie.<verse eid="ISA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 46:4" />Nnui kecingting gade de Ih au pa da, nah nnui peu pu di kemaktane Ih nnui mapie lazie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:4">Ih nnui de tei ai nah Ih nnui mapie luzie; Ih nnui mapie zie nah Ih nnuide kelilu zie.<verse eid="ISA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 46:5" />Cau dage nnui acu keu keda zie no? Nnui Ih cau nzwa lie eh cet lano, iciu eh anai de keu keda lu kera?<verse eid="ISA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 46:6" />Pe bung gade mina kecak rui mpetla nah riangteukwak gage rangkanggeu teubeu la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:6">Penui hegeu ta keteime de li lula, nah pa herabe ge tei lula; penui keumie nah cide de reca.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:2-4">Tet. 32:2-4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 46:7" />Penui penui keutu gage cide pwa ncuh gaila nah cide de pung lula; penui cide de pebam gage kaigai, nah cide pe bam sap bamla nah cikade nlai lama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:7">Penui cide dage mra gaila, dede cide penui sam keli gailak mede migede de pe lungrei gade keli gailak.<verse eid="ISA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 46:8" />Ma aidungde nsunglu; aide nsung muila lu, nnui kemaume!<verse eid="ISA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 46:9" />Ndaa Ih tei kedidung de nsung gailo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:9">kedanemene Ih Tinggwang lu, nah keda migede gah, Ih au Tinggwang, nah Ih nzwa migede gah.<verse eid="ISA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 46:10" />Ih kekambe de raitu gade ranggai dida nah tei kemakdung de mrai ranggai dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:10">Ih ranggai, “Ih riem kegaidung de teigwang zie, nah Ih tei keneube nzwa Ih tei zie.”<verse eid="ISA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 46:11" />Ih naimiak kepetle de tui ketyei nruine ge de qu gai, hangdeu kemdei gade Ih a lungningbe pei de qu gai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:11">yeo, Ih ranggai dida; Ih cide teicang zie; Ih cet mning luda, Ih cide tei zie.<verse eid="ISA 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 46:12" />A kwa kingneilu, nnui nnui lung ketakme, petaube tei kera gade mdei la kecume.<verse eid="ISA 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 46:13" />Ih a kesamsang de teugwang nna zie; cide mdei la meda, nah a kelikelu kwa lama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:13">nah Ih a kelikelu Zion de peu zie nah Israel de a kendu teugwang beuzie.<verse eid="ISA 46:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="ISA 47" />
  <para style="s">Babylon Kekau</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 47:1" />RAMPAUBE rangzeu, “Nghunglu nah rebui ga bamlu, kemci Babylon napui;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">hegwangbam si mene hangdeu ga bamlu, Chaldeme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Chaldeme: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngamlu kemak namdi</char></note> napui.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">Ncu nciep nah mnwa de qu si lakta.<verse eid="ISA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 47:2" />Keniaktsukang keulu nah tokkui niaklu; n peuzui radi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:2">n pai lim kebam de radi, n pi ba kela pai de radi, hereukidung kahpetlu.<verse eid="ISA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 47:3" />Nang paula kecu ngau dizie, yeo, n ngngam de ngau dizie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:3">Ih hekum peei zie nah migede de gi dilak.<verse eid="ISA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 47:4" />Anuide kelikelube, reugwame reu RAMPAUBE de pe zi da, Israel Kemci Tinggwang.<verse eid="ISA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 47:5" />Zingde bamlu nah kemui ga miecu, Chaldeame napui;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:5">kedanemene ncu au hegwangram gwangpui de eh qu si lakta.<verse eid="ISA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 47:6" />Ih a minadung de a rata di; Ih a mapwa de tei hera di</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">nah n ba gage kaidi, dede nang penuide ngaunggia beuma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">nang hepwet kerüt ge hecingmedung reu gage kai.<verse eid="ISA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 47:7" />Nang ranggai, “Ih kelunghta kengkieng gwanpui teila zie.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:7">Nang aidungde cet ncok cang ma, mede aidungde dainzwa dizie bi kecude cet ma.<verse eid="ISA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 47:8" />Cine aide siulu, nang pumteih lungning nsui kelabe nah kwak eh bam kelabe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">nang n mlung ga aide rang kelabe, “Ih lungh bam, nah Ih nzwa migede gah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">Ih madauge de hemipui ge nzwa bam lak, mede Ih a namedung gah dilak.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zep. 2:15, Keu. 18:7</char></note><verse eid="ISA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 47:9" />Dede ai kena de n dage kak nage gage tingnaige gade gwang dizie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:9">hename ketsai nah hemipui ketei; n dage aide gwang zette dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:9">n kereka ciemdung nah kehemeu kelu nah kesia ngngamlu kera hetania bam liede.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 18:8,23</char></note><verse eid="ISA 47:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 47:10" />Nang n kesia de de nlum; nang ranggai, “Migede acu ngau ma”;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:10">n maci nah macet de ne ncu ngngwa n lampui pwa mau di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:10">dede nang nlung gade rangla, “Ih lungh bam, nah Ih nzwa migede gah.”<verse eid="ISA 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 47:11" />Kekap n reuga gwang zie; nang cide n kereka ciemdung le gwa gidi gailak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">N reu ga kekap gwang zie; nang cide keu gidi gailak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">Kekap n da gwang zette zie, nang cimezing kebam dau.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Thes. 5:3</char></note><verse eid="ISA 47:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 47:12" />N reka kekiee nah hekuhei kaikela de tei jüja lu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:12">nang n henane gade cide samsang eh pei kelade;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:12">nang ngking luzie, nang kekap de keu kezia di luzie.<verse eid="ISA 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 47:13" />N keledeu sam kekiee ge ne ncu tei leu dida; peu mina cidungde de cuhlu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:13">nah ncu kelibeu, tinggim cuikui sau tsamlu kelame nah hegidung pie kelame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:13">keici rang ndu kelame, peu penuide n dage tei lai eh kebam de gade keli beulu.<verse eid="ISA 47:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 47:14" />Pielo, penui au reigau tiedung nzwa dizie. Mi ge ne cidungde ru dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:14">Penui katei penuide mi gade kelilak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:14">Penuide tei lum kera miceudung gah nah mi taiga bam kera mide gah dizie!<verse eid="ISA 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 47:15" />Penui n dade ainzwa dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:15">nang nzang hetah tei kegwangme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:15">nah n henane gade penuide de ngngwa helila keteime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:15">penui penui katei penui lampui le miedi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">ncu kelilu kera migede gah da.”<verse eid="ISA 47:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="ISA 48" />
  <para style="s">Israel lung ketak</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 48:1" />Aide siulu, Jacob leuhme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">pe zi Israel de eh qu kelame, nah Judah leuhme gade kegwangme;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">RAMPAUBE zi gade nnui sampet kelame nah Israel Tinggwang de qu kelame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">dede lungsang gade mede samsang gade tei la kemakme.<verse eid="ISA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 48:2" />Kedanemene penui penui katei penuide kemci namdi gu minadung liede eh qu la</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:2">nah Israel Tinggwang de nlum la. Pe zi au reugwame reu RAMPAUBE.<verse eid="ISA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 48:3" />RAMPAUBE Israel dage rangla, “Tei kedibedung ndaa ge Ih ndu lia dida; cidungde a mui gade mpet, nah cidungde de Ih peu cigai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:3">ge cidungde Ih zette teigai, nah cidungde teigwang.<verse eid="ISA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 48:4" />Kedanemene nnui au nnui lungh tak kecu Ih ci kecune,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:4">nnui ngwang teih hegeu nzwa tak, nah nnui sipie hetageu nzwa,<verse eid="ISA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 48:5" />cine Ih ma aidungde nnui dage mrai ranggai la; aidungde tei di kemakne Ih nnuide ranglia dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">iciu eh nnui, ‘A mamiedung ne cidungde teigai da,’ mede ‘Ih ne tei kelu mamie nah tei kelu hegeu mie ne aidungde keniak luda,’ de eh ranggai kelak ne.<verse eid="ISA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 48:6" />Nnui aidungde ha siu da; kesangbe cilu kebui ma aidungde piegai pielo; nah nnui, Ih rang kegaidung de kesang lie de eh nnui mnei lak ni? Cu gade, Ih nnuide ma kehecidung keulia la, hebai pwa kebam nnui ci kemakdung de.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:19">Keu. 1:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 48:7" />Cu, nah ndaa gade mene, cidungde teigai, nah cu kecang nnui cidungde ha siu ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:7">iciu eh nang, ‘Yeo, Ih cidungde cibam,’ de eh rangdau kelak ne.<verse eid="ISA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 48:8" />Nnui piage de siu ma; nnui cima; aidungde nnui mrai siu ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:8">Kedanemene nnui mide cwa kelame ge kecu Ih cibam, nah nnuide mna kelu gade nnui mide kereniame ge tei eh gwang.<verse eid="ISA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 48:9" />Ih a zi ziemne a rata ketip zie, nah a herüt ziemne Ih nnuide ngkap dilak.<verse eid="ISA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 48:10" />Pielo, Ih nnuide tei mci luda, dede rangkanggeu nzwa ma; keherei mi dele nnuide Ih tei nci luda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 66:10, 1 Pet. 1:7</char></note><verse eid="ISA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 48:11" />Akatei a ziemne, akatei a ziemne Ih teigai zie; kedanemene Ih dainzwa peu a zi de rang msia lu lai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:11">Ih a kendu migede de peu lak.<verse eid="ISA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel de Lungmpetkebeu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 48:12" />A kwa kingneilu, Jacob, nah Israel, Ih ne qu kelume:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:12">Ih pa da; Ih raitube, Ih ne kamtube de da.<verse eid="ISA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 48:13" />Yeo, a ba le kideu bangdwa teigai, nah a ba zetle bie le tinggimdung teu kamlu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:13">Ih penuide de qugai kecudau, penui sap nsam lula.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:10">Heb. 1:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 48:14" />Gwang ngkwa lulo, nnui pelane, nah kingneilu! Nnui kakgade aidungde caune mrai ranggai no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:14">RAMPAUBE minadung Babylon dage teigai zie lie eh kebam de teicang luzie. Penui RAMPAUBE sui lungningbe Chaldeanme dage teigai zie.<verse eid="ISA 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 48:15" />Ih, Ih ranggai dida, yeo, Ih pecu qugai dida, Ih pecu ngngwa gwang luda, nah pa ngking luzie.<verse eid="ISA 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 48:16" />A da gwang mna lu, aide kingneilu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">Raitu gade Ih ngkim eh marang dima; cide tei kegaidau, Ih cika bam.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">Cu RAMPAUBE acu nah pe Rabe langgai.<verse eid="ISA 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 48:17" />Aide RAMPAUBE, n Kelikelube, Israel Kemci Tinggwang ne ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">“Ih au RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang, ncu ngkinglu kera ledeu beu kelabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">nnui gwang kera lampui le ge nnuide ngngwa gai beu kelabe.<verse eid="ISA 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 48:18" />Nnui a ajadung mzailu liecai!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:18">Iciu lucai nnui kezuyi nah teilung keyi de hereuki ge nzwa lwa dizie de nage, nah n kelikelu de jaaidi cuidung nzwa dizie de nage.<verse eid="ISA 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 48:19" />Nnui leuhme heciangdung nzwa kiee dizie de nage, nah nnui neki ga nnui namedung heciangdung nzwa kiee dizie de nage;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:19">penui zi a dwa gade dang tütti mede hemai gidi lak de nage.<verse eid="ISA 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 48:20" />Babylon gade mpetlu! Chaldeanme dade paklu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">Suiyi kwa teu cide rang ndu lialu! Aide peu ci gailu, Kideu pelane ga peu ci gailu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">‘RAMPAUBE pe kilabe Jacob de keli luda,’ de eh ranglu.<verse eid="ISA 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 48:21" />RAMPAUBE pe minadung de hangdeuketsai gade penuide ngngwa mpet kecudau penui hereu dima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:21">tsurakang gade pa penui ziemne peu hedui lwa mpet;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:21">pa tsurakang de teipang di, nah dui lwa mpet.<verse eid="ISA 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 48:22" />Kemaume ziemne lungciep gah, de eh RAMPAUBE rangla.”<verse eid="ISA 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="ISA 49" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube Kilabe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 49:1" />A kwa kingnei lu, nnui jaaidikung deudung! Cu a dage nnui lung kailu, nnui kemdei ga lungh kela minadung.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:1">RAMPAUBE acu nna kelu gade a zi teu qu luda, a pui acu kideu aika nna gai kebeu gade.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal. 1:15</char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 49:2" />Pa a mui kingtie kenzaube nzwa teibeu; pa pe ba mie kangga ge acu kebai pwabam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:2">pa acu lakpitsi teimdui kelu ge nzwa teibeu; pe lakpitsibung gage acu kebai pwabam.<verse eid="ISA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 49:3" />Pa a da rangdi, “Nang au a kilabe, Israel, Ih a kendu keulia kelabe.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:10">2 The. 1:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 49:4" />Dede Ih keligai, “Ih kemta gage mri kegai de Ih cetgai liede, Ih magede kemak gage a ziepum ngkap dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:4">ciuliede a mzeu au RAMPAUBE da bam, nah a ziehi au Tinggwang da bam.”<verse eid="ISA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 49:5" />Cu RAMPAUBE ranggai dida, pa pe kila tei kerane nna kelu gade acu teigai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">Jacob de peda ngngwa cailigwang dailu kerane, ciu eh Israel pe da gwang ngkwa lu kera ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">kedanemene RAMPAUBE miakngau gade Ih au hetwapung, nah a Tinggwang au a kengkingbe dida,<verse eid="ISA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 49:6" />RAMPAUBE ada ge rang, “N ziemne a kila tei eh Jacob leuhme de teu ncuh dai kera au keceu nage lie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:6">nah bangkelu Israelme de teingkei beu kera. Gentileme dade Ih ncu kebaa ge teibeu zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:6">kideube cang kecu dau nang a kelikelube teilu kerane.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 2:32, Bat. 13:47, Lei. 98:2-3</char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 49:7" />RAMPAUBE ainzwa ranggai, Israel de Kelikelube, penui gu Kemci Tinggwang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">pe teilungh de ngkau kelame, heleuhdung ne ngkau, nah kedime baang keteime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">“Hegwangmedung ncu ngau nah cuh sap zie, nah hegwangnadung ncu ngau nah keumie zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">RAMPAUBE samsang kecu ziemne, Israel gu Kemcibe, ncu kedet kelube liede.”<verse eid="ISA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 49:8" />RAMPAUBE ainzwa ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">“Ih ncu a sui eh keulia kera ting dau Ih ncu keli beuzie, nah kelikelu tingba kegwang dau Ih ncu ngha beuzie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">Ih ncu gum beuzie, nah minadung ziemne samkak ge nzwa ncu peu zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">hangdeu de teucuh dailu kerane, gi kedi mapwa de peu dailu kerane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 69:13, 2 Cor. 6:2</char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 49:9" />Nang hebaangme dungde rang zie, ‘Mpet lu;’ kemui baangki ga kebamme de, ‘Nnuikatei nnuide keulia gai.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:9">Penui lampuidung gade mapeei tyei zie, nah kwak kebam lamlwa de penui taktyeibam zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 4:18</char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 49:10" />Israel langgi kedi gade caili kegwang dau penui mzeu mede hereu di lak; meliede tingnaimiak mede tingcie ne penui de teimnei dilak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:10">kedanemene penui da ngaugia kebambe ne penui de teuswa zie; pa penui de duipwakdung ga ngngwa gai zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:16">Keu. 7:16</ref>,<ref loc="REV 7:17">17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 49:11" />Ciu eh Ih a lamlwadung pelane lampui ge tei dizie, nah a puidiki kehu ga bamzie.”<verse eid="ISA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 49:12" />Pielo, aidungde kemdei gade gwang zie, kesa tingpeule de nah kenlwetle de; nah kedadung Sinim deu gade gwang zie.<verse eid="ISA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 49:13" />Lei teigai, tinggimdung, nah nnui suiyi lu, kideube; lei tei sahbak lu, nnui lamlwadung!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:13">Kedanemene RAMPAUBE pe minadung de tei relui beula, nah pe mina rei kelame de ngau ngngia zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 96:11-13, Jer. 31:13</char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 49:14" />Dede Zion rang eh, “RAMPAUBE acu gi dida, nah Rampaube acu nsungta dida.”<verse eid="ISA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 49:15" />“Mipui ge pe na de nsung tadi lubui ni, pe tung gade tungbam kecudau, cine pa ne nna kelu pe na da ngaugia bam meni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:15">Yeo, penui nsung tadi lubui, dede Ih au ncu nsung tadi lak.<verse eid="ISA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 49:16" />Pielo, Ih a badeu gage n zi rau pwabam; n kiriedung de a dwaga bammui la.<verse eid="ISA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 49:17" />N namedung caili kelwa gwangla dida, ncu teingkap kedimedung be mdei tetti zeu.<verse eid="ISA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 49:18" />Pie tegwa gailo, penui pelane gwang ngkwa lwe n da gwangla.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:18">Ih ring kebamtane, RAMPAUBE aide ndugai, nang hetei hetah nzwa cidungde keu eh rwa luzie, nah nang lakciubepui nzwa cidungde kailu zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:11">Rom. 14:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 49:19" />Nang piage ngkapdi nah gidi eh bam liede, hangdeu kaudi eh kebam de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:19">cu nang au ceu ham dizie da lunghbam kerame ziemne, nah ncu teingkau kedime au mdei süt ladi zieda.<verse eid="ISA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 49:20" />N sui kesia tingdau nna kelu henamedung nang kesiu gade rang zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:20">‘Aipau ni de au anui ziemne nrum ham dilei, anui ziemne kibung teigai lo, ciu eh anui aika lungh kerane.’<verse eid="ISA 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 49:21" />Pecai nang nkatei ncu keteu zie, ‘Cau ne hena aidungde de acu nna beu no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Ih au a suisia la nah hena lung ma, gwadi nah ngngwa lungh tadi. Cau ne hena aidungde de nkwet beu no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Pielo, mileune acu gidi eh Ih akatei bam; dai gade aidungde gwang no?’”<verse eid="ISA 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 49:22" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ainzwa ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">“Pielo, Ih heleuhdung dage a ba hwacuh gai zie; Ih minadung dage pailim keucuh a rehi teilia zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">Penui n napei dungde penui bapum gade pwa gwang zie nah n napuidung de penui hekeutu gade.<verse eid="ISA 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 49:23" />Hegwangmedung ncu kengha peidung zie, nah hegwangpuidung n ma kepieme tei zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">penui nda keumie penui zudung hangdeu tung zie nah n pi ga rebui de mniak zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">nah Ih RAMPAUBE lie kecu nnui cilu zie; acu kwa eh kebamme de peu hengam teidi lak.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 72:9-11, Joe. 2:27</char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 49:24" />Reugwame gade tui kelu mabamdung de süt lubui ni, mede lunghop<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">lunghop: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lunghop gade de mene Hebrew laisiu ga makesangme de bamla, dede keheci laisiu kekiee ge ga lunghop gade de bamla. </char></note> gade hebaangme de kelilu bui ni?<verse eid="ISA 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 49:25" />Dede RAMPAUBE ainzwa ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">Yeo, reugwame dade hebaangme de keumpet dilu bui, nah tui kelu mabamdung de keli lubui;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">kedanemene nang renia kelame de Ih renia nah n namedung de keli beuzie.<verse eid="ISA 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 49:26" />Ih ncu teikeherei kelame de penuikatei penui teih tyei zie; nah penuikatei penui jai sak mie zie, cide hezau nzwa eh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:26">Ciu eh mina leune Ih, RAMPAUBE, nnui gu Kelikelube nah nnuide Kelikebeube, Jacob Ngkiengtube Tinggwang lie kecu ci luzie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:6">Keu. 16:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50" />
  <para style="s">Israel Mau nah Kilabe Samzaiketei</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 50:1" />RAMPAUBE ainzwa ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">“Ih n puide tah kedi lakchak tei kebeu laisiu daiga bam no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">Ih hepaupung kelame cau dage ncu zwa beu dino?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">Pielo, n maudung ziemne ncu zwa di, nah n takesia ziemne, n pui de langgi dida.<verse eid="ISA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 50:2" />Ih kegwang dau daitei migede cika bam meno? Ih qu kegai dau daitei migede keli beu meno?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Ncu heriak lu kera a ba ceu ham dini? Ncu kelilu kera a da kengkieng bam meni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Pielo, Ih a rata gade jaaidi tei canghdi; Ih kereukidung hangdeuketsai ge teidi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">penui gu heka dui kegah ziemne tsai di nah tim di.<verse eid="ISA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 50:3" />Tsaibai tariem ga nang bah kela rosopai de; Ih cide rosopai le teu bahcim di.”<verse eid="ISA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 50:4" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang rang kerabe acu ledeubeu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:4">ciu eh rei kelame dage kehecung sam ge ranglu kerane;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:4">tingcang ramsang pa acu nkia ncuh beula; ledeu kelume nzwa peu siu kera pa a kwen ngkei beula.<verse eid="ISA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 50:5" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang a kwen ngkei beu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:5">nah Ih keregi tadi, mede Ih caisim tetti ma.<verse eid="ISA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6" />Acu dap kebamme de Ih a caile ndwa beu, nah a muimai pai kebamme de a zu tu punglie beu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:6">Ih hengam nah kemneeu tah ketei gade a zu kebai dima.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">50:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 26:67, Heb. 12:2</char></note><verse eid="ISA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 50:7" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang acu ngha beu zie kecune; cine Ih ngngam di ma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:7">cine Ih a zu tangtsu nzwa tei taklu, kedanemene acu hengam gage kaidi kelak Ih cibam.<verse eid="ISA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 50:8" />Tinggwang acu kemzeube pwapeu kerabe au mna bam. Cau ge acu renia zie no? Anui sap eh hangge ge de renia go.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:8">Acu mmau kelabe cauno? Peu pecu a taiga gwang nna lo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">50:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom. 8:33-34</char></note><verse eid="ISA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 50:9" />Pielo, RAMPAUBE Tinggwang acu ngha zie. Cauge acu kemau ndam lulai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:9">Pielo, acu mmau kelame pelane paiheni ge nzwa hegwa dizie; taklei ne penuide tyei ciak dizie.<verse eid="ISA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 50:10" />Nnui kakga cauge RAMPAUBE de hing lano? Cau pe kilabe kwa kingnei lano?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">Cau muiting kecu ga kebaa teu mene tet lano?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">Pa RAMPAUBE zi gade nlum nah pe Tinggwang da ngngei eh bam maisia.<verse eid="ISA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 50:11" />Pielo, nnui mi ketaume leune, kebaa bungdung teu eh mtei kelume:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">n miheu baa ga tetlu nah nang teiheu kelu miheudung baa gade.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">Aide nang a dade ngau luda: Keherei kecu ni ga nang zeumie zie.<verse eid="ISA 50:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="ISA 51" />
  <para style="s">Zion ziemne Kelungta Kelikelu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 51:1" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “A kwa kingneilu, nnui makesang de zui kelame, nnui RAMPAUBE de peei kelame:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:1">ncu heruikelu tsukang de de pie gailo nah tsupang bam gade ncu pang kelu de.<verse eid="ISA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 51:2" />Nnui pau Abraham de pielo, nah Sarah nnui pe dade lungh gwang kelu; kedanemene</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:2">Ih pecu qu gai, pa au hena gah. Ih pecu samlam gai nah pecu tei ngkiee beu.<verse eid="ISA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 51:3" />Yeo, RAMPAUBE Zion de teirelui beu zie; pa pe deu kemta teikedi ni leune teirelui beu zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">pe hetaideu pa Eden nzwa teilu, nah hangdeu ketsai langkie deu Jordan Reuki langkam taiga kebamde RAMPAUBE gurie nzwa teilu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">pe da suiyibe nah misuikeyi ngaulu zie, hetwakepeu, nah lei ketei kwa.<verse eid="ISA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 51:4" />“Acu kingnei sünne lu, a minadung; nah a kwa kingneilu, a minadung!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:4">Kedanemene Ih hezai ge peugai zie, nah Ih heleuhdung ziemne a kemzeu de kebaa ge teibeu zie.<verse eid="ISA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 51:5" />A masangbe au nna bam; a kelikelube tet pet zie, nah a ba heleuhdung tutiak zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">duigwadeudung acu kwa zie; penui a ba de neunga eh kwabam zie.<verse eid="ISA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 51:6" />Tingkam le nnui miak pie cuh gai, nah hangdeu lambie pie hung gai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">kedanemene tinggimdung au mika nzwa gah dizie, hangdeu au paiheni nzwa rim dizie, nah cika kelunghme tamainedung nzwa tsai dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">Dede a kelikelu au bammui zie, nah a masangbe madaude mtakti mene hetah teibam muizie.<verse eid="ISA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 51:7" />Acu kingneilu, kesangbe dai bi nang cibam, nnui mlung ga a zai kaipwa kebam nnui minadung:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:7">Mina ncu kii kecune ngngi diso, mede penui kemneuta tei kegaine nlungsia diso.<verse eid="ISA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 51:8" />Kedanemene taklei ne penuide tyei ciau dizie paiheni ge nzwa, nah penuide tangseu ne mamai pai nzwa tyei dizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:8">dede a masangbe au kelunghta zie, nah a kelikelu ceheudung pelane da bam zie.”<verse eid="ISA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 51:9" />Mraklu, mraklu, RAMPAUBE ba, nkatei ncu kengking le cumlu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">Ndaa tingbadung nzwa cuhlu, ndaa ceheudung tingdau nzwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">Rahab de nangne tei kecai meni, nang neidi de dang kedibe?<verse eid="ISA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 51:10" />Nang jaaidi de teicangh meni, cok süt eh kebam duidung de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:10">nah jaaidi gu pecok de gade peu keli kelume de tetkah kera lampui ge teibeu meni?<verse eid="ISA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 51:11" />RAMPAUBE ne kelikelume cailigwang zie nah Zion da suiyi lei tei eh gwang zie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:11">nah penui peusui ga suiyi kelunghta bam zie; nah suiyi nah misuikeyi penui da gwang dizie, nah misuikesia nah lungrei gah dizie.<verse eid="ISA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 51:12" />“Ih, Ih, au n lung taumla kebeube.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:12">Nnui daitei mina de hingla no, penui tsai zie, mina napeidung, tsehei nzwa tei kelume de?<verse eid="ISA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 51:13" />Daitei nnuide Teikegaibe RAMPAUBE de nsungta dino, tinggimdung tei kegaibe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">nah kideu bangdwa dwa kegaibe de? Nang au tingba ramsang ngngi bam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">mide teikeherei kelame rata de ziemne pa ngkap di kera cet kegai dau. Mide teikeherei kelame rata de daiga bam no?<verse eid="ISA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 51:14" />Tui baang kebamme de, RAMPAUBE kelwa eh lungmpet zie; pa tsai eh hekwaki ga nghung dilak, mede tyei kera gah dilak.<verse eid="ISA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 51:15" />Kedanemene Ih au n RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, jaaidi cuidung kwa de tei mlai kegaibe, pe zi au reugwame reu RAMPAUBE.<verse eid="ISA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 51:16" />Ih a samdung n mui gage kai dida, nah Ih ncu a ba mie kang gage gum pwabam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:16">ciu eh Ih tinggimdung de linglu, kideube bangdwa dwalu, nah Zion dage rang eh, ‘Nnui au a minadung.’”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">51:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jer. 31:33, Heb. 8:10</char></note><verse eid="ISA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rampaube Lunghop piak</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 51:17" />Mraklu, mraklu, cuhsap lu, Jerusalem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:17">nnui RAMPAUBE ba gade sakmie kelame pe rata kwak gade;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:17">nnui hekwak gade sakmie kelame, mide tei tanglia kela piak hung pesing gade sak kelume.<verse eid="ISA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 51:18" />Pa ne nna kelu pe namedung leune kakgade migede pe lampui saubeu kera gah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:18">pa ngkwet cuh kelu namedung leune gade peba teubeu kera migede bam ma.<verse eid="ISA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 51:19" />Aipau keherei kena n da gwang, caune ncu nggia zie no?,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:19">Suisiet nah kengkap, nah rapia nah kingtie. Cau ne n lung taumla zie no?<verse eid="ISA 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 51:20" />N napeidung kauzeu dida; penui kenret la lampui kung leune gade, baih ga heti ge nzwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:20">RAMPAUBE rata ne penui da pui eh bam, N Tinggwang gu rata.<verse eid="ISA 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 51:21" />Dede cu aide kingneilu, nang hangge de teikeherei nah sakmie eh kela ge de, dede zau sak eh mie ma:<verse eid="ISA 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 51:22" />N RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, n Tinggwang, pe minadung pe nggiadung kie beu kelabe, ainzwa rang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">“Pielo, Ih n ba gade ncu tei tanglia di kela piak keuteu dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">hekwak, a rata piak de, ciu eh nang cide sak si tadi lu kerane.<verse eid="ISA 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 51:23" />Ih cide ncu teikeherei kelame ba gage kaibeu dizie, n dage rang kecume, ‘Zeu mielu, ciu eh anui n reuga tetlu kerane’;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">nang n gim de hangdeu nzwa tei nah penui tet kera ziemne lampui be nzwa.”<verse eid="ISA 51:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="ISA 52" />
  <para style="s">Kilabe Keherei kecu nah Kendu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 52:1" />Mraklu, mraklu, n kengking bahlu, Zion;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">nnui gu hezukeyi paihenidung kailu, Jerusalem, kemci namdi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">kedanemene madaude hegeurum kemak mede mcikemak n da nlüt dai laklu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:2">Keu. 21:2</ref>,<ref loc="REV 21:10">10</ref>,<ref loc="REV 21:27">27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 52:2" />Rebui gade nkatei ncu kecung di; cuhlu eh bamlu, Jerusalem;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:2">n ngwang gade teiria de keumpet ti, hebaangmedung, Zion napui.<verse eid="ISA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 52:3" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE ainzwa ranggai, “Ncu pemi tei mene zwadi, nah ncu rangkang keu mene lungmpet beuzie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 44:12, 1 Pet. 1:18</char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 52:4" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ainzwa ranggai, “Keraidau a minadung Egypt ga tingtiekemak ge ziemne lungh kera mie hung; nah Assyria ne pekie kegah gade penui de teikeherei.<verse eid="ISA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 52:5" />Cu aika Ih a da dai bam no, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, a minadung de pekie kega gade keuteu di kecu? Penui reu kedi tei kebamme ne rangmsia gai, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, nah a zi au tingbazie leune rangmsia bammui la.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eze. 36:20-23, Rom. 2:24</char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 52:6" />Cine a minadung a zi cilu zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:6">cipau benai penui au penui cilu zie Ih ne ainzwa rang kecu, “Yeo, cide au Ih lie!”<verse eid="ISA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 52:7" />Samgwabe pidung lamlwadung ga daihiage de hezuyi no sam keyi teugwang kebeube,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">kezuyi ndu kegaibe, sam keyidung teugwang kelabe, kelikelu ndu kegaibe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">Zion dage, “N Tinggwang au hegwang lie!” De eh kerangbe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat. 10:36, Rom. 10:15, Nah. 1:15</char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 52:8" />Kingneilu, namdi kekwame penui kwadung sah zeu, penui ngngwa suiyi teu sah zeu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:8">kedanemene penui ngau zie, penui miakdung leune, RAMPAUBE Zion ga cailigwang kecu.<verse eid="ISA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 52:9" />Ngngwa eh suiyi lei tei sahbak lu, nnui Jerusalem sia kedime;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:9">kedanemene RAMPAUBE pe mina lung taumla beu; pa Jerusalem de kelibeu da.<verse eid="ISA 52:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 52:10" />Heleuhdung leune miakngau gade RAMPAUBE pe kemci ba peu ngau gai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:10">kideu leune Tinggwang gu keli kelu ngau zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 98:3, Luk. 3:16, 2:30-31</char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 52:11" />Tetdi, tetdi, Babylonia gade tet mpetdi; mcikemak kette tungso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:11">pe dade tetdi lu; ngkatei ncu teimci lu, nnui RAMPAUBE lidung pung kelamedung.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Cor. 6:17, Keu. 18:4</char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 52:12" />Kedanemene nang kelwa eh tet pet lak, mede nang lungrei ge bam eh tet lak;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:12">RAMPAUBE n dwaga tet zie kecune; nah Israel Tinggwang ncu kegumbe zie.<verse eid="ISA 52:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 52:13" />Pielo, a kilabe mriak eh heta teizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:13">pa au dizie nah teucuh luzie, nah pecu hetwa peuzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jer. 23:5</char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 52:14" />Kekiee ge ncu ngau hing bam dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:14">pe pum rehi mina kedame nzwa ta hamdi kecune, nah pe rehi mina nzwa mezing di.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 22:6-7, Isa. 53:2-3</char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 52:15" />Ciuliede, a kilabe heleuhdung kekiee dage kezin gai zie nah pe ziemne hegwangmedung kekiee ge penui mui ngkui dizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:15">Kedanemene penui da ranglia kemak de, penui ngau zie, nah penui siu kemak de, penui cilu zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom. 15:21, 1 Cor. 2:9</char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 53:1" />Minadung keligai, “Anui dade siulu eh penui cau nlumlu dino, nah RAMPAUBE ba cau dage keulia no?<verse eid="ISA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 53:2" />Kedanemene pa RAMPAUBE dwa gade mabang leuh ge nzwa lungh cuh, nah hangdeu kecangh gade tsehei pwak pet kecu nzwa da;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">pecu kengau dau ngaukemcha mede hezukeyi gede bam ma; anui pecu ngau kecudau, hezuyi eh anui ngau misuilu kera gah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mat. 2:23</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mrk. 9:12</char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3" />Mina ne pecu masipei tadi nah luulu tadi; lungrei pei ge, nah pa au keteei ngau bammui kelabe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:3">Mige dade minadung penui zudung kebai kedi nzwa, pecu masipei tadi; nah pecu le magede kemak nzwa di.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:12">Mrk. 9:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4" />Dede pane anui mateeidung lia beu nah anui lungreidung pungbeu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:4">ciuliede Tinggwang ne pecu saja peu lie eh anui cetla, Tinggwang ne kedeu lie, nah teikeherei liede eh.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 8:17, 1 Pet. 2:24</char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5" />Dede anui tahdung kesia ziemne pecu reu dida; anui maudung ziemne pecu teitset dida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:5">Anui kezuyi ziemne pecu saja peu, nah pe jai gade anui yi ngkeilu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom. 4:25, 1 Pet. 2:24</char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 53:6" />Anui pelane au meurün gah kedibe nzwa da; anui hange ge kecu pekatei pe lampui gage nreu tetdi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:6">nah anui pelane kemau de RAMPAUBE pe dage pwa gai dida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat. 10:43, 1 Pet. 2:25</char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7" />Pecu teikeherei di; ciuliede pa pekatei pecu tei hena keludau, pa pe mui ngkei ma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">meurünna ge de gitset kera ngngwa kemie nzwa, nah meurün ge pemai tai kera dwa matu kemak nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">ciu eh pa sam gede rang ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jhn. 1:29, Matt. 27:12, Mrk. 15:4-5, 1 Cor. 5:7, 1 Pet. 2:23, Keu. 5:6,12</char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 53:8" />Ketang kecu nah tutiak gade pecu rangmsia; cipau ceheu ga cauge pe ha cet si no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:8">Dede pecu keringme deu gade daptsetti; a minadung kemau teikegai ziemne saja pe da gwang di.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:32">Bat. 8:32</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 8:33">33</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jhn. 1:29, Matt. 27:12, Mrk. 15:4-5, 1 Cor. 57, 1 Pet. 2:23, Keu. 5:6,12 </char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9" />Penui pe rau kemauketeime taiga kai, keheime ge tsit taiga ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:9">pa kemau ge de tei pwabam melie de, mede pe mui gade mide kecwa sam ge de rang meliede.<verse eid="ISA 53:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 53:10" />Ciuliede cide RAMPAUBE pecu teikeherei nah teimsia kera pelungning di kecune. Pa pe teilungh teu kemau ziemne reca tei kegaidau,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">pa pe namedung de ngau zie, pa pe tingbadung de nsung zie, nah RAMPAUBE mariem de pe dade teicang luzie.<verse eid="ISA 53:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 53:11" />Pe teilung gade keherei kelu cai, pa kebaa ngau zie nah pe maci gade mnung luzie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:11">A samsang kilabe kekiee gede tei mzeu beuzie; pa penui teimau kedidung de lialu zie.<verse eid="ISA 53:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12" />Cine maadi kakga Ih pecu pe kwa peu zie, nah pa ma tui keludung de kekiee ge de mzi zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">kedanemene pa ketsai dage pekatei pecu pwalia gai nah kemauketeime de ngngwa pei ncüt lu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">Pa kekiee ge mau liabeu nah kemau keteime ziemne hekak tetbeu.<verse eid="ISA 53:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="ISA 54" />
  <para style="s">Zion Paucai Kendu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 54:1" />RAMPAUBE Jerusalem da rangzeu, “Lei teigai, nang nagahpui, nang hena nna kemakpui; lei tei n suiyi lu nah hap sahbak lu, nang hena kenna rei ci kemakpui.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">Kedanemene hemeu meukelu pui namedung swade gi kedibe namedung be kieeki,” de eh RAMPAUBE ranggai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">54:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 113:9, Gal. 4:27</char></note><verse eid="ISA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 54:2" />“N paiki tei mdi lu nah n paikidung de tei mtie pet lu, cide tei kudi mene;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:2">n riadung tei tielu nah pe pakdung tei ngking lu.<verse eid="ISA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 54:3" />Kedanemene nang zetle kezang pet zie nah hile de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:3">nah n leuhme heleuhdung reu ngking zie nah gikedi namdidung tei ncuh dai zie.<verse eid="ISA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 54:4" />Ngngi so kedanemene ncu tei hengam tei dilak, mede n lung ceu diso kedanemene ncu ngaunggia tadi lak;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:4">nang hena kecudau n ngngam de nsung tadi zie nah ncu gikedi ngaunggia kemak de. <verse eid="ISA 54:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 54:5" />Kedanemene ncu Teikegaibe au n naapei; pe zi au reugwame reu RAMPAUBE.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:5">Israel Kemci Tinggwang au ncu Kelikelube; pa au kideu pelane reu Tinggwang.<verse eid="ISA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 54:6" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE ncu qu caili luda takedi nau nah rabe kilam suisia kela nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:6">mipui hena dau mmeulu eh ta kedi nzwa,” de eh n Tinggwang ranggai.<verse eid="ISA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 54:7" />“Peting tie kemakge ziemne Ih ncu gidi, dede Ih ngaugia kedi teu nnuide teuhekwa luzie.<verse eid="ISA 54:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 54:8" />Rata kepui kebam gade Ih n dade a zu tingkakge ziemne kebai di;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:8">dede kelungta samkak kesamsang teu Ih ncu ngaunggia lamui zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:8">RAMPAUBE ncu keli kebeube rangla.<verse eid="ISA 54:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 54:9" />Kedanemene a dade aide Noah gu duilwa kedi nzwa da:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:9">Noah gu duidung kideube reu kah gwang dai kelak Ih sampet kaikebeu nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:9">ciu eh Ih a sam petgai la Ih nnuide a rata mede kesiu lak.<verse eid="ISA 54:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 54:10" />Lamlwadung kaumie lubui nah kideutudung nlai di liede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:10">ciuliede a keku kesang de n dade nreu tetti lak, mede a kezuyi samkak de nlai dilak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:10">RAMPAUBE ncu ngaunggia kelabe rangzeu.<verse eid="ISA 54:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 54:11" />Teei eh rei kelabe, rahang ne guigi kedi nah relui kemakbe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:11">pielo, Ih tangtsu pemi kehung le n lampui teibeu zie, nah n bangdwa sapphire le kambeu zie.<verse eid="ISA 54:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 54:12" />Ciu eh Ih tangtsu pemi kehung le pwa n kudadung peureu teibeu zie nah ngu kirieki tangtsu kemzaibe le teibeu zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:12">nah ngu hegwale hezukeyi tangtsudung le.<verse eid="ISA 54:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 54:13" />Ciu eh n name pelane de RAMPAUBE ne ledeu zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:13">nah n name kezuyi de yiki luzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">54:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mac. 16:4, Rom. 9:22</char></note><verse eid="ISA 54:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 54:14" />Masangbe gade ncu tei ngking beu zie, nah nang keherei gade mdei dizie, kedanemene nang ngngi tadi zie; nah kengngi gade, kedanemene cide n da gwang mna tadi zie.<verse eid="ISA 54:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 54:15" />Pielo, keheibede mide teikeherei kecu tei cai, cide a dade gwang lak; keheibe de ncu teikeherei cai kau dizie<verse eid="ISA 54:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 54:16" />Pielo, Ih hebaciem keyime de damgai, miceu tei heu kelame</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:16">nah reunetdung teimpet kecu pe tah, nah Ih tei ngkap kerane kengkapbe de dam gai.<verse eid="ISA 54:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 54:17" />Ncu renia kera reunet teikelu kette ngking gailak;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:17">nah ncu kemau ndam kelame leune de mmau zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:17">Aide RAMPAUBE kilame mapwa, nah a dade penui kemzeu ngau zie, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.”<verse eid="ISA 54:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="ISA 55" />
  <para style="s">Hereukelame de Qukegai</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 55:1" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “Gwanglu, hereu kelame leune, dui ga gwanglu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">nah nnui rangkang bam kemakme, gwanglu, luilu nah tyeilu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">Gwanglu, rangkang teu mene zau nah tungdui luilu nah pemi tei mene.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">55:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jhn. 7:37, Keu. 21:6, 22:17</char></note><verse eid="ISA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 55:2" />Daitei eh tyei kemak be gage rangkang mpet lano, nah daitei n mnung teilu la kemak ziemne hairei tei lano?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:2">A kwa kingnei sünne lu nah ma keyibe tyeilu, taktyei keyi ga nnui suiyilu.<verse eid="ISA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 55:3" />A minadung, kingnei lu delwe a da gwanglu! Ciu eh nnui ring luzie!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:3">Ih kelungta samkak nnui da teibeu zie, a kumedung, Ih David dage keku kenlum sampet kai kebeude ncu de peu zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">55:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 89;28, Mac. 4:20, Bat. 13:34</char></note><verse eid="ISA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 55:4" />Pielo, Ih pecu heleuhdung dade nlumlu kebui ge, muiteu ge nah minadung reu kedibe teibeu dida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">55:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heb. 2:10, 5:9, Keu. 1:5</char></note><verse eid="ISA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 55:5" />Pielo, nang cikemak heleuh gede qu zie; nah heleuh ncu cikemak ge n da pak gwang zie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:5">N RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ziemne, Israel Kemci Tinggwang, ncu tei ndu kebeube.”<verse eid="ISA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 55:6" />RAMPAUBE de peei lu kebui dau peei lu; pa mna kebam dau pecu qulu.<verse eid="ISA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 55:7" />Peu kesiaketei de pe lampui putdi, nah kemau ketei minabe de pe kecetdung.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:7">Pecu peu RAMPAUBE da cailigwang lu, nah pa pecu ngaunggia zie, nah pe mau gi cangsiak beu kerabe anui Tinggwang da.<verse eid="ISA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 55:8" />“Kedanemene a kecetdung de n kecetdung ma, mede n lampuidung de a lampuidung ma, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">55:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:33">Rom. 11:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 55:9" />kedanemene tinggimdung au kideu swade hu ki kecu nzwa, cinzwa a lampuidung de n lampuidung swade hu ki, nah a kecetdung liede n kecetdung swade hu.<verse eid="ISA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 55:10" />RAMPAUBE rangzeu, Israel, “Tingrui nah buising tinggim gade hung kela nzwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:10">nah penui hangdeu ga jok di kemakne cika cailigwang lama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:10">nah lungh keyi peula nah pwakcuh nah hetaketame de petsi leuh nah ketyeime de taktyeipok peula,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">55:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Cor. 9:10</char></note><verse eid="ISA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 55:11" />cine a mui gade kepet a sam liede cinzwa zie, cide a da mta mrwa eh cailigwang lak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:11">dede cide Ih langkegai mariem de teicang luzie.<verse eid="ISA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 55:12" />Kedanemene nang nsuiyi eh Babylon püt dizie nah kezuyi nda lazie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">lamlwadung nah hangdeutudung n dwa gade suiyi ne puih eh sahbak gaizie, nah luhdung ga tsingbangdung pelane penui badung bapeu zie.<verse eid="ISA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 55:13" />Hetu ziudung be mene, cypress bang lunghcuh zie; nah hetubang be mene, myrtle bang be lunghcuh zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:13">nah cide RAMPAUBE ziemne zie, pe zi ziemne, kelungta marengei ge nzwa cide dangtüt dilak.”<verse eid="ISA 55:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="ISA 56" />
  <para style="s">Kedame ziemne Kelikelu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 56:1" />RAMPAUBE Pe minadung de ainzwa ranggai, “Petaube pie heling lu, kemzuibe teilu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:1">kedanemene a kelikelu au mna dida, nah a samsang keulia lai bam dida.<verse eid="ISA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 56:2" />Mina cide tei kelume samlampung, nah cide herak ntip kelume.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:2">Pa Sabbath mnei la, cide tei heradi lama, nah kesia ketei gade pe ba ketip lula.”<verse eid="ISA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 56:3" />RAMPAUBE caisui tei kelu sangme de peu ainzwa rang diso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:3">“RAMPAUBE pe minadung gade acu gidi bi zie.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:3">Eunuch ainzwa rang kerabe ma, “Pielo, Ih au kecangh bang ge.”<verse eid="ISA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 56:4" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE ainzwa ranggai, “Eunuchme a Sabbathdung mnei kelume</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:4">nah a suiyi ketei de kedet kela, nah a samkak herak ntip kela Eunuchme,<verse eid="ISA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 56:5" />napeidung nah napuidung lungh kelu swade yiki kecu ge penui ziemne a kiga nah a kirie lungle kensungbam ge tei beuzie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:5">Ih penuide madaude gahdi kelak kelungta kensungbam ge peu zie.<verse eid="ISA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 56:6" />RAMPAUBE da mna gwang kelu sangme de liede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:6">pe ta teikera, nah RAMPAUBE zi de hung kelame, pecu reca kera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:6">Sabbath mnei kelu leune nah cide teihera di kemankme, a samkak ga bam kelume,<verse eid="ISA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 56:7" />Ih a kemci lamlwa ga ngngwa gwang zie nah a kekie ki gade de peu penui suiyi zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:7">penui gu keru recadung nah penui gu ratakdung a recabam gade luulu zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">56:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mal. 1:11, Mrk. 11:17, 1 Pet. 2:5</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:7">Kedanemene heleuhdung pelane ziemne a ki de kekie ki de qu zie,<verse eid="ISA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 56:8" />aide RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ne ndugai, langgi kedi Israelme de teuhekwa kelube,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:8">Ih mina kedame de liede penui da teuhekwa silu zie.”<verse eid="ISA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenlienme de Tinggwang Kesiukecu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 56:9" />Israel ngauraumedung gwang delwe Israel pe muiteumedung de ngkap dilu!<verse eid="ISA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 56:10" />Penui gu kekwame pelane miakciet, penui au daitei au bi cima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:10">Penui au pelane heteudung zingde tang lula kemakpe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:10">Penui hemang mmi, nah zeu mie eh zip kecu penui suila.<verse eid="ISA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 56:11" />Heteudung de penui taktyei dih sütla; madaude penui mnung ngau gailak;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:11">penui au keci kecet kegah kekwame;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:11">penui pelane penui lampui riep gage nreu tet dida, hangge ge kecu petaukemak mahei hengim la.<verse eid="ISA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 56:12" />“Gwanglu,” penui rang, “Zau kengking le anuikatei anuide teipui lugo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:12">Ncünne au henai swade yi zie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">56:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 12:19-20, 1 Cor. 15:32</char></note><verse eid="ISA 56:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="ISA 57" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 57:1" />Makesangme kap gah dila, dede migede cide cet lama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:1">nah samkak kelu kesamsang minadung de ngngwa tetdi, dede migede cilu ma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:1">makesangme kesiabe dade ngngwa tetdi kecu.<verse eid="ISA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 57:2" />Keheibede masangbe ga tet kelame;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:2">ketsai gade lungciep ngaulu nah mtak lula.<verse eid="ISA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 57:3" />Dede aika mmau kera gwanglu, nnui reka ta keteipui napeidung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:3">kemmha ta ketei namedung nah mipui pekatei kemmha tatei kelame.<verse eid="ISA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 57:4" />Cau de nnui suiyi eh henui teibam no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:4">Cau de renia eh n mui ngkei nah mleu hetwa pet bam no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:4">Nnui keregi kebamme name meni, kecwa taketei name meni?<verse eid="ISA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 57:5" />Nang mhudung kangga ngngwa zip kebam gade nkatei ncu teimmau, kemdiak bang kang leune gade,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:5">tsupop nzukebam kang, kecang reuki singdung gade nnui nnui name de pwa ratak tei beula.<verse eid="ISA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 57:6" />Kemdui niadung hereuki langkam kakga kebam niadung de ncu nlum gai pwabam da. Penui ncu reca kera nia da.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:6">Nang penuide zau reca rui gai beu nah mei reca tei cuh gai. Aidungde gade a sui yilu zie ni?<verse eid="ISA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 57:7" />Nang lamlwatu kehu ga mamie ratak tei kera mteilu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:7">nang cika de reca ratakdung tei kerane hang.<verse eid="ISA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 57:8" />Kikam cai nah kikamtsiadung ga nang ngu mamiedung tei nzeu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">nang acu gidi, ngkatei n nia gau di, nah tet hang; nang n zeulie teimdi lu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">Nang penui de ngngwa samkak lu; nang penui zeulie de nsui la; nang penui pum ga ngaubui kemakpe ngau da.<verse eid="ISA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 57:9" />Nang ngu perim keyi nah macadung pütlu delwe Molech rabe de reca kera miela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:9">Nang n samgwame de kemdei ga langgi dida; nang Sheol ga nghung dida.<verse eid="ISA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 57:10" />N beu kedei gade nang leu dida, dede madaude rangma, “Cide keregui ga.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:10">Nang n ba gade teilung ngaulu; cine nang nnei di ma.<verse eid="ISA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 57:11" />“Cau ziemne nang nlungkeherei bam no? Cau de hing süt eh nang mide kecwa tah teila no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">ciu eh nang acu nsung tadi mede acu mning tadi kera?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">Kedanemene Ih sau tiege zingde bam di, nang acu hing sita dida.<verse eid="ISA 57:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 57:12" />Ih n masang tadung pelane rang zie nah nang tei kegai leune ranglia zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:12">dede penui ncu ngha gailak.<verse eid="ISA 57:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 57:13" />Nang kengha kie kegai kecudau, ngu hekwakelu mamiedung de peu ncu kelilu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">Meliene tingkai ne penui pelane de pung tetti zie, ngicui ge ne penui pelane de pung tetti zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">Ciuliede cauge a da nsiulu di bi hangdeu de gumlu zie nah a Kerecaki ga acu reca zie.<verse eid="ISA 57:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 57:14" />RAMPAUBE rangzeu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:14">‘Teigai, teigai! Lampui teimci gai! A minadung lampui gade puikam leune keugi di!’”<verse eid="ISA 57:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 57:15" />Kedanemene kehu ga Kebambe ne aide ranggai, kelungta ringkebam be, pe zi kemci be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">“Ih hutu nah kemci ni ga lungh, peda liede pangkedi nah pezai kehena rabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">pezai kehenamedung rabe de tei mring beu kerane, nah helung keherei kelame rabe tei mring beu kera.<verse eid="ISA 57:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 57:16" />Cine Ih a minadungde mmau bam muilak, mede Ih a rata bam muilak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:16">kedanemene minadung rabe a dwaga de siakau di lubui, keringria Ih tei kegai de.<verse eid="ISA 57:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 57:17" />Pe zaisiet gade kemau tei kedi ziemne, Ih a rata di, nah Ih pecu saja peu gai; Ih a zu kebai nah a rata bam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:17">dede pa pe lungningbe tei eh caisim di.<verse eid="ISA 57:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 57:18" />Ih pe lampuidung ngau,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:18">dede Ih pecu teingkei beu zie. Ih pecu teuswa nah tei relui beuzie nah pe ziemne pe suisia kelame lung taumla beuzie,<verse eid="ISA 57:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 57:19" />nah Ih muileudung tsi damgai beu. Kezuyi, kezuyi, kemdei ga kelame de nah kemna ga kelame de de, RAMPAUBE ranggai, Ih penuide tei ngkei beuzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">57:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eph. 2:13, 17, Rom. 2:39, Heb. 13:15</char></note><verse eid="ISA 57:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 57:20" />Dede kesiame au jaaidi cuidung nzwa, mtak gailak eh bamla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:20">nah cipau duidung nah tangdei de pung nswak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">57:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:13">Jud. 1:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 57:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 57:21" />Kesiame ge ziemne kezuyibe ga, de eh Tinggwang ranggai.”<verse eid="ISA 57:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="ISA 58" />
  <para style="s">Kemmwang Kesangbe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 58:1" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “Mra sahbak gai; kezeu diso. Telui nzwa n kwa keu cuh gai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:1">A Israel minadung de penui teimau kedi ranglia gai, nah Jacob kilungme de penui maudung.<verse eid="ISA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 58:2" />Ciuliede tingba ramsang penui acu reca la nah a lampui cineu eh penui sui yila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">heleuh ge makesangbe teireli kecu nzwa nah penui Tinggwang gu hezai de gidi lama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">Penui a dade kesang tutiak keteu; penui Tinggwang gwang mna kela de mning eh penui suiyi bam.<verse eid="ISA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 58:3" />Minadung keteu, ‘Anui daitei mmwang no,’ penui rang, ‘dede nang cide ngau ma? Daitei anui zai henah bi kecu, dede nnui cide ci luma?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:3">RAMPAUBE penui dage rangla, “nang mmwang kecu benai nang nkatei n suiyi ngaulu nah n ta keteime leune de teikeherei la.<verse eid="ISA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 58:4" />Pielo, nang kesamlim nah keregi kerane mmwang la, nah helungkesia bazum teu mide teigai kera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:4">nang henai mmwang kecu nreule de n kwa siulu kerane ma.<verse eid="ISA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 58:5" />Aikenzwa kemmwang de Ih a sui lu zieni: Mikeheibe de pekatei pecu teihena lu kera tingba ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">hekuu nzwa eh pe peu keumie kera, nah rosopai nah mimüt pekatei pekangga kamlu kera?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">Nang aide de mmwang kecu rangla deni, RAMPAUBE suiyi teikela tingba ge?<verse eid="ISA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 58:6" />Kemmwang aide Ih kedet kelube meni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:6">Kesiabe de riangkeu kelade keugi di kera, ngwanggai ria hiak di kera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:6">keherei kelame de peu lungmpet beu kera, nah ngwanggai leune teupang di kera?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">58:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 4:18-19, Mac. 21:3, Jam. 1:27</char></note><verse eid="ISA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 58:7" />Cide nzeu kelame de ngu tangku pangbeu kerabe meni nah kegame nah peki kegahme de n kiga ngngwa gwang kerabe meni?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:7">Nang migede paaula bam eh ngau kecudau, nang pecu penia kaibeu kerabe; nah nang nkatei n kibaume dade mbai di kerabe ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">58:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heb. 13:2-3, Mac. 25:21, 28:27, Matt. 25:35-36 </char></note><verse eid="ISA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 58:8" />Ciucai n kebaa de tingnaimiak nzwa pang zangra pet zie, nah n keteei zam de yi ngkei zette luzie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:8">N kesamsang de n dwaga tet zie, nah RAMPAUBE kendu dene n ma piela luzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">58:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 37:6, Jer. 33:6, Luk. 1:78:79</char></note><verse eid="ISA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 58:9" />Ciu eh nang qu zie, nah RAMPAUBE keli zie; nang kengha luneu eh sahgai zie, nah pa rang zie, “Ih aika bam.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:9">Nnui katei nnui kakgade ngwanggai de keugi lucai, mide kemmau zurang de, nah sam kesia rang kecude,<verse eid="ISA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 58:10" />magade nang nkatei mzeu eh kebamme de peulu nah lungrei kebamme de tei relui beu cai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:10">ciu cai n kebaa de kemui gade baa petlu zie, nah n kemui de tingna nzwa dizie.<verse eid="ISA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 58:11" />Ciu eh RAMPAUBE ncu teuswa jüja beu zie nah cuikuidung dui kegah gade n mnung teibeu zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:11">nah pa n radung tei ngking beu zie. Nang gurie duitau kegai nzwa dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:11">nah duilet dui, madaude duidung cang dila kemakpe nzwa zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">58:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:38">Jhn. 7:38</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 58:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 58:12" />Nnui kangge ndaa tingdau sia kedi de teicuh dai zie; ceheudung kekieege sia kedidung de nang teicuh dai zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:12">ncu ainzwa qu zie “Kirie keretakme,” “Lungh bamlu kerane lampuidung tei kehemibe.”<verse eid="ISA 58:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 58:13" />Magade nang Sabbath benai hebeu tei kera gade caisim dicai, nah a kemci tingba dau nsuibe ketei gade ketip lucai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">Magade nang Sabbath de suiyi ge lie qulu, nah nang RAMPAUBE tadung de kemci nah hetwakepung lie qulu cai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">Magade nkatei n tahdung de pütti eh Sabbath de herüt peu cai, nah nkatei n suiyibe peila nah nkatei n suibe samdung rang meliecai.<verse eid="ISA 58:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 58:14" />“Ciuciu cai nang RAMPAUBE dade n suiyi ngau luzie; nah Ih ncu kideu kecehu ga ngngwa gai beu zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:14">N pei Jacob leuhme gade Ih n pok teibeu zie, kedanemene RAMPAUBE rang dida.”<verse eid="ISA 58:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="ISA 59" />
  <para style="s">Kemau, Kemaukepet nah Rikelu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 59:1" />Pielo, RAMPAUBE ba au dui ham eh keli gailak dilak; mede pe kwen ham dima, iciu eh cide siu gailak di kera.<verse eid="ISA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 59:2" />Iciuliede, n kemau tadung, dene n Tinggwang dade ncu teu lamcam dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:2">nah n maudung ne n dade pe zu kebai nah n kekie keli beuma.<verse eid="ISA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 59:3" />Kedanemene n badung au hejai ne hera dida nah n ba zurangdung kemau ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:3">N muileukung kenret rang nah n mleu makesiabe rang.<verse eid="ISA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 59:4" />Migede masangbe gade qu ma, nah migede pe ziemne kesangbe gade ngaugia kie ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:4">Penui kemrwa samdung de nlum la, nah kenret rangla; penui keherei tetlak lu nah kemau de nna beu la.<verse eid="ISA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 59:5" />Penui henei ra kecu bumdung mbum gai nah tamriakpe ra dak la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:5">Penui gu bumdung tyei kelume tsai zie, nah magade bum ge pang dicai, cide henei ra kecu ge mmi dila.<verse eid="ISA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 59:6" />Penui gu peradung de paiheni ziemne keu gailak, mede penui tahdung teu penuikatei penuide hacim gailak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:6">Penui tadung au kemau tahdung, nah zaisiet tahdung au penui ba ga la.<verse eid="ISA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 59:7" />Penui pidung kesiabe gage pak gai dila, nah penui mina maukemakme jai tei lwa gai kera zui la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:7">Penui lungningdung au kemau lungningdung; keregi nah kengkap de penui lampuidung da.<verse eid="ISA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 59:8" />Penui kezuyi lampui ci lama, nah penui lampui ga kemzeube ga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:8">Penui lampui tei nkoi pwabam; cipau lampui ga ketetme leune kezuyi de ci lama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:15-17">Rom. 3:15-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 59:9" />Minadung rangla, “Cine kemzeube au anui dade mdei bam, kesangbe liede anui da gwangcang ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:9">Anui kebaa de kwabam, dede kemuibe ngau; anui kebaa de peeila, dede anui kemui ga tetla.<verse eid="ISA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 59:10" />Anui miakcietme nzwa tangdeu hemiet la, mina mangau kemakme nzwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:10">Tinghegi dau nzwa anui tingna dau ma nrap la; kengkingme kakga de anui au ketsaime nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 59:11" />Anui hegumdung nzwa mrung nah tamhaudung nzwa mra la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:11">anui kemzeube de kwa la, dede kemzeube bam ma; kelilu kera ziemne, dede cide au anui dade mdei dida.<verse eid="ISA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 59:12" />Kedanemene anui teimau kedidung kekieege n dwaga bam, nah anui maudung anuide kemmau zierang tei;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:12">kedanemene anui teimau kedidung anui da la, nah anui maudung anui cibam.<verse eid="ISA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 59:13" />Anui renia, RAMPAUBE de mlai nah anui Tinggwang caisui ketei gade mreu tetdi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:13">Anui kemneu rang nah mria tet, helungbe gade lungcet kesia pung nah kenret samdung.<verse eid="ISA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 59:14" />Kemzeube au keu caili dida, nah masangbe au kemdei ga sapbam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:14">kedanemene hemaabe kengkwa bam ga makesangbe puikam teila, nah kesangbe gwang gailak.<verse eid="ISA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 59:15" />Nlumlu kebui de gah dida, nah kesiabe dade mria kelume pecu le kemaube lie di.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:15">RAMPAUBE cide ngau nah kemzeube bam kemakne pesui lu tadi.<verse eid="ISA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 59:16" />Migede bam kemak pa ngau gai, nah migede ngngwa kangzang lu kera gah kecune pe swagah di.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:16">Cine pekatei pe ba ne pecu kelikelu teugwang beu, nah pe masangbe ne pe teilung tei mtie beu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">59:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eze. 22:30, Heb. 7:25, Lei. 98:1</char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 59:17" />RAMPAUBE masangbe le hekarakcum nzwa kailu nah pe peu ga kelikelu le peurwa teilu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:17">Pa hekum peei kecu niadung le pecu cumlu nah neungga kedi lungning cwatie nzwa bahlu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">59:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eph. 6:14, 17, 1 Thes. 5:8</char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 59:18" />Penui tei kegaidung ziemne pa saja penuide peu, pecu renia kelame de rata tutiak peu, pe ngauraume dade hekum pei, duigwadeu ga kebam deudung dage penui ziehi nzwa saja peu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">59:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 20:12-13, 22:12, Nah. 1:2</char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 59:19" />Ciu eh penui naimiak kenlütle gade RAMPAUBE zi de hinglu zie, pe kendu naimiak kepetle gade; kedanemene pa dui kedi nzwa gwang zie, RAMPAUBE cuingi de teuswa gwang zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">59:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 8:11, Luk. 13:29, Lei. 102:15-16, 113:3</char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 59:20" />“Kelibeu kera ge Zion gade gwang zie nah Jacob gade penui samzai teikemak gade nreu caili kelume da, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:26">Rom. 11:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 59:21" />A ziemne au, penui ziemne aide a samkak da, RAMPAUBE rang, a rabe n da kelade, nah a samdung Ih n mui gage kaikebeu de, n mui de gidi lak, mede n namedung mui gade mpetti lak, mede n tsamedung mui gade mpetti lak, RAMPAUBE rang, cu gade nah kelungta.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">59:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heb. 10:16, Rom. 11:27</char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="ISA 60" />
  <para style="s">Zion Kendu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 60:1" />Cuhlu, Jerusalem, baapet lu; kedanemene n kebaa de gwang lada, nah RAMPAUBE kendu ne ncu teu cuh luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">60:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:14">Eph. 5:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 60:2" />Kemui ne kideube de hacim di liede, nah muiting kecu ge ne heleuhdung de;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:2">ciuliede RAMPAUBE ncu teucuh beu zie, nah pe kemdu de n dade ngaulu zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">60:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jhn. 1:14, Keu. 21:23</char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 60:3" />Heleuhdung n kebaa ga gwang zie, nah hegwangmedung n kebaa baa cuh kebam ga.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">60:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:24">Keu. 21:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 60:4" />Pie twagwa gai nah pielo. Penui pelane gwang penuikatei gwang ngkwalu nah n da gwangla.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:4">N napeidung kemdei gade gwang zie, nah n napuidung de penui badung gage pwa zie.<verse eid="ISA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 60:5" />Pecai nang pie zie nah baa dizie, nah n mlungbe suiyi nah puinlim dizie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:5">kedanemene jaaidi gu kekieege n reu gage rui gaibeu zie, heleuhdung mahei de n da gwang zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">60:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jer. 33:9, Joe. 2:26, Isa. 61:6</char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 60:6" />Ut haudung ncu hacim zie, Midian nah Ephah me gu ut nadung;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:6">penui pelane Sheba gade gwang zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:6">penui kecak nah perimkehengui teugwang zie, nah RAMPAUBE de ketwa leidung tei zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">60:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 72:10, Matt. 2:11</char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 60:7" />Kedar cuikui ga kauhaudung pelane n da keu hekwa beu zie, Nebaioth gu meurün seudung nang teumai kesia teibeu zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:7">a ratakbam gade penui luulu kebui recadung zie; nah Ih a kendu ki de tei ndu gai zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">60:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:13">Mat. 21:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 60:8" />Hemwa nzwa lim kela de caudung no, nah tamhaudung penui kemsiu ki ga lim gwangdi kela nzwa?<verse eid="ISA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 60:9" />Jaaidikung deudung acu pei, nah Tarshish limdung ne teuswa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">kemdei gade n napeidung de ngngwa gwang, penui gu rangkanggeu penai penui gu kecak penui da teugwang kerane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang zi de ziemne, nah Israel Kemcibe ziemne, kedanemene pa ncu rüt kelane.<verse eid="ISA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 60:10" />RAMPAUBE Jerusalem dage rangla, “Sangme napeidung n kiriedung teicuh dai zie, nah penui gwangpeidung n tatei zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:10">Ih a rata gade ncu saja peu liede, ciuliede a lung gade au Ih ncu ngaunggia la zie.<verse eid="ISA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 60:11" />N kirie liede ngkei pwabam jüja zie; cide tingmui mede tingkebaa dau nkui lak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:11">ciu eh heleuhdung maheidung keuteu gwanglu kerane, penui gwangpeidung ne teuswa eh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">60:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:24">Keu. 21:24</ref>,<ref loc="REV 21:26">26</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 60:12" />Kesang, heleuhdung nah hegwangramdung n gwatei kemakme de ngkap dizie; cipau heleuhdung de ngkap ciak dizie.<verse eid="ISA 60:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 60:13" />Lebanon kemdu de n da gwang zie, cypress bang, fir, nah cypress bung gu pebang de ncüt si eh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:13">a kerecaki de tei hezuyi kerane; nah Ih a pi bam de tei ndu zie.<verse eid="ISA 60:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 60:14" />Penui n da keu mie kera gwang zie, n da hena kelame napeidung; penui n pi ga keu mie zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:14">penui ncu Namdibe RAMPAUBE qu zie, Zion Israel Kemcibe.<verse eid="ISA 60:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 60:15" />Ncu gidi meliene nah ngaunghet kebam gade, migede tetka gwang kemak ga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:15">Ih ncu kelungta ziemne hegie kera ge, ceheu gade ceheu suiyi ge teibeu zie.<verse eid="ISA 60:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 60:16" />Nang heleuhdung tungdui liede sak zie, nah hegwangpeidung tung gade nkwet zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:16">nang cilu zie Ih, RAMPAUBE, ncu kelikelube nah ncu Rikebeube, Jacob Ngkiengtube. <verse eid="ISA 60:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 60:17" />Ih hetageu mene kecak keugwang zie, Ih hegeu mene rangkanggeu keugwang;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">hetsing mene, hetageu, nah tangtsudung mene, hegeu. Ih kezuyibe le n hegwangmedung tei beu zie, nah kemzeube le n muiteume.<verse eid="ISA 60:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 60:18" />N deu ga keregi kecu siu silak ta, mede ngkap kedi mede n raidung lungga teimsia kedi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:18">dede nang n kirie de Kelikebeube, nah n kiriekidung de Hetwakepung de qu zie.<verse eid="ISA 60:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 60:19" />Tingkebaa dau tingnaimiak de ngu kebaabe tadi zie da,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:19">mede hekei baa de n reuga baa tadi zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:19">dede RAMPAUBE ne kelungta ngu kebaabe dizie, nah n Tinggwang n kendube.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">60:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 21:12-23, 22:5</char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 60:20" />Ngu tingnaimiak madaude gah dilak, mede ngu hekei mui eh gah dilak;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:20">kedanemene RAMPAUBE kelungta ngu kebaabe dizie, nah n suisiet tingbaziedung bamsi tadi zie.<verse eid="ISA 60:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 60:21" />N mina pelane masang zie; penui peting pelane ziemne hangdeu cide gumlu zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:21">Ih ling kegai kiak de, a badung le teikegai tahtei, ciu eh Ih ndu lu kerane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">60:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 21:27, Eph. 2:10, 2 pet. 3:13</char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 60:22" />Keceuna be cangge, nah keceu be heleuh kengking ge petlu kera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:22">Ih, RAMPAUBE, peting gwang kecudau ma aidungde zette teicang beu zie.<verse eid="ISA 60:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="ISA 61" />
  <para style="s">Tinggwang Suiyi Mmi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 61:1" />Caihakecibe Isaiah rangla, “RAMPAUBE Tinggwang Rabe a da bam, kedanemene RAMPAUBE ne acu keniaklu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">keherei kebamme dage sam keyi ranglia kerane. Pelung ceu kelame de teingkei beu kerane pa acu langgai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">hebaangme dage lungkempet ranglia kera, nah hebaangme kangpwa kebamme de ngkei beu kera.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">61:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 11:5, Luk. 4:18, Bat. 10:38</char></note><verse eid="ISA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 61:2" />RAMPAUBE pesuiyi kela tingkum de ranglia kera pa acu langgai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:2">anui Tinggwang hekum peei kera tingba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:2">nah hap kela leune lung taumla kera.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">61:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 4:18-19</char></note><verse eid="ISA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 61:3" />Pa acu langgai, Zion ga hap kebamme de peu kerane, penuide mimüt mene peuzui ge peu kerane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">kehap mene suiyi ca, keregui kegah rabe be mene hetwa cwatie be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">penuide mhu masangbe qulu kerane, RAMPAUBE ling kebam de, peu pecu twa zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">61:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 45:7, 30:11, Luk. 6:21</char></note><verse eid="ISA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 61:4" />Judahme ndaa siakedi namdidung de penui retak dai luzie; penui ngkap kedidung de teihemi luzie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:4">Penui namdidung siakedi de teihemi luzie, ceheudung kekieege gade ngkap kedidung.<verse eid="ISA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 61:5" />Sangme bam eh nnui kauhaudung de taktyei peu zie, nah sangme napeidung nnui luhdung nah kubeluhdung ga heta teizie.<verse eid="ISA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 61:6" />Nnuide RAMPAUBE cingkume de eh qu zie; penui nnui de Tinggwang kilame de eh qu zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:6">Nnui heleuhdung mahei de tyei zie, nah penui mahei gade nnui hegie zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">61:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Pet. 2:5,9, Keu. 1:6,5:10</char></note><verse eid="ISA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 61:7" />Nnui ngngam meliene nnui kena kiee ge ngau zie; nah rütkemak meliene penui qwa ziemne penui suiyi zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">Cine penui deu gu kena kiee ge penui ngaulu zie; kelungta suiyi penui gu zie.<verse eid="ISA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 61:8" />RAMPAUBE rangla, “Ih, RAMPAUBE, kemzeube ku la, nah kerega Ih ngkau la nah mzeukemak keregi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:8">Ih a minadung de samsang eh ziehi peuzie, nah Ih penui da kelungta samkak ge tei zie.<verse eid="ISA 61:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 61:9" />Heleuhdung kakgade penui leuhdung de cilu zie, nah minadung kakgade penui name de cilu zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:9">Penuide kengaume pelane penuide hetwa peu zie, RAMPAUBE ne penuide samlam kebeume de zie.<verse eid="ISA 61:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 61:10" />Ih RAMPAUBE da a suiyi süt zie; a Tinggwang da Ih suiyi bamsüt zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">Kedanemene pa kelikelu paidung le acu bah beu; pa masangbe cwatie le acu bah beu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">lakciubepei peuzui le pecu mtei kelu nzwa, nah lakciubepui hetei hetah le pecu mtei kelu nzwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">61:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom. 5:11, Heb. 3:18, Keu. 19:7-8</char></note><verse eid="ISA 61:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 61:11" />Kedanemene hangdeu pe bangdung pwakcu kecu nzwa, nah hegurie pe bangdung de peu lungcuh kecu nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:11">ciu eh RAMPAUBE Tinggwang masangbe teigai zie nah heleuhdung leune dwa gade pwakcu kera hetwa peu zie.<verse eid="ISA 61:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="ISA 62" />
  <para style="s">Zion Zi Keheci</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 62:1" />Zion ziemne Ih zing de di lak, nah Jerusalem ziemne Ih mlei tadi lak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:1">pe kesamsang baaha eh pet lu kemaktane, nah pe kelikelu mitaubung heu kebam nzwa.<verse eid="ISA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 62:2" />Heleuhdung n kesamsang ngau zie, nah hegwangdung leune n kendu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:2">N zi keheci ge le quzie RAMPAUBE ne kedet kebeu be.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">62:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 2:17, 3:12</char></note><verse eid="ISA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 62:3" />Nang de hezukeyi peurwa ge zie RAMPAUBE ba ga, nah hegwang ketei peudui ge zie n Tinggwang ba ga.<verse eid="ISA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 62:4" />Ncu rang si lak, “Gikedi”; mede n deu de de rang silak, “Pütkedi.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">Kesang, ncu qu zie “A suiyi be pe da la,” nah n deu “Laktak teilu,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">RAMPAUBE ncu pe suiyi kela ne, nah n deu laktak tei dizie.<verse eid="ISA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 62:5" />Lungsang eh, rehangme ge releime ge de pe nau kedi nzwa, cine n napeidung ncu pe nau zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:5">nah lakciube pei lakciube pui de pe suikeyi nzwa, n Tinggwang n ziemne pe suiyi zie.<verse eid="ISA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 62:6" />Ih reketme n riedung gage kai luda, Jerusalem;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:6">penui tingna mede tingmui nlei mene bamma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:6">RAMPAUBE dage rang heci dai kebamme, mtak di so.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">62:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eze. 3:17-21, Heb. 13:17</char></note><verse eid="ISA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 62:7" />Peu pecu mtak diso pa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:7">Jerusalem teucuh dai lu kemakta nah kideuga peu ketwa ge teilu.<verse eid="ISA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 62:8" />RAMPAUBE zetle ba le sampet teibeu da nah pe ba kengkieng le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">“Ih n ngauraume de n meiciu de taktyei ziemne peu si lakta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">Sangme n zau keheci sak lak, nang ne tei kelu de.<verse eid="ISA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 62:9" />Mei luhlüt kelume tyei zie nah RAMPAUBE de twa zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:9">nah kubetsi rai kelube a Kerecaki kigu gade sak zie.”<verse eid="ISA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 62:10" />Jerusalem ga minadung, riekidung gade kah gwanglu! N minadung cailigwang kelame ziemne lampui mteilu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">Teicuh lu, puidibe teicuh lu! Tangtsudung hekwa mpet lu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">Heleuhdung ziemne marehi pailim pwacuh lu!<verse eid="ISA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 62:11" />Piegai, RAMPAUBE kideube pe nlidung leune dage reci gaila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">“Jerusalem ga minadung dage rang beulo: Ainie, n Kelikelube au gwang lada!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">Pielu, pe ziehi au pe dala, nah pane kapkedi sukebeu au pe dwaga la.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">62:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matt. 21:5, Keu. 22:12</char></note><verse eid="ISA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 62:12" />Penui nnuide, “Kemci mina; lie quzie RAMPAUBE ne rikelube,” nah nnuide qu zie “Peei kelabe; Namdibe gidi kemakbe.”<verse eid="ISA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="ISA 63" />
  <para style="s">Tinggwang Hekum kepei nah Rikelu Tingba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 63:1" />Edom deudi gade gwang kelabe de cau no, Bozrah namdi gade paigie le cum teu kelabede?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">Hegwangme paini teu kelabe de cau no, pe kengking kedi ziemne ci eh tetgwang kelabe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">Cide Ih, kesangsam rang nah ngkieng süt eh kelilu kebui kebam.<verse eid="ISA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 63:2" />N paini daitei gie no, nah daitei cidungde nang kubetsi zauniakbam ga heta tei bam kecu nzwa ngau no?<verse eid="ISA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 63:3" />Ih zauniakbam gade kubetsi a katei dau da, nah heleuhdung gade migede acu ncüt ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">Ih a rata le penuide dau nah a rata süt eh dau di.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">Penui jai ne a painidung lwa di nah a painidung pelane keniak di.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">63:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 19:15, 14:20</char></note><verse eid="ISA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 63:4" />Ci ziemne Ih hekum peei kera tingba kwa bam, nah a kelikelu tingkum de gwang bam dida.<verse eid="ISA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 63:5" />Ih pie gai, dede migede ngha kera gah. Migede ngha kera kegah ne a swagah di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:5">dede akatei a ba le acu kengking peu, nah a ratasüt kegai de ne acu kecung lu.<verse eid="ISA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 63:6" />Ih a rata le heleuhdung de dau nah penuide a rata de sakmie gai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:6">nah Ih penui jai kideu gade rui gai.<verse eid="ISA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 63:7" />Ih RAMPAUBE lungsang samkak tadung de rang zie, RAMPAUBE de twalu kebui tadung de.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">RAMPAUBE anui ziemne tei kegai leune rang zie, nah Israel kilung dage pe keyi kedi de.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">Pe ngaugia aide anui dage lia kegai de pe kehung ziemne lie, nah lungsang eh samkak kelu tadung kekiee ge ziemne lie.<verse eid="ISA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 63:8" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE rang, “Penui au a mina kesang, cwadi la kemak nadung.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:8">Pa penui Kelikelube dida.<verse eid="ISA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 63:9" />Penui rei leune gade,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:9">pa de keherei gai beu, nah tinggim samgwame pe dwa gade penui de keli beu da.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:9">Pe keku nah ngaugia gade pa penuide keli beu da,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:9">nah pa penui de pwacuh beu nah ndaa tingdau leune ga penuide ngngwa jüja la.<verse eid="ISA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 63:10" />Dede penui pecu renia nah pe Kemci Rabe suisiet tei di.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:10">Cine pa penuide ngauraube tei di nah penui de nggwa keregi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">63:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat. 7:51, Eph. 4:30</char></note><verse eid="ISA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 63:11" />Pe mina ndaa Moses tingdau ha nsung di.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:11">Penui rang, “Tinggwang dai ga bam no, meurün kekwabe pe meurün hau de jaaidi gade teu mpet kelube de.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:11">Tinggwang dai ga bam no, pe Kemci rabe penui kak gage kai kebeube de?<verse eid="ISA 63:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 63:12" />Tinggwang daiga bam no, pe kengkieng kendu de peu Moses zetle ba ga la kecube de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:12">nah penui dwaga jaaidi dui de mzi kegai, kelungta pekatei pe ziemne pe zi tei ndu kerane?<verse eid="ISA 63:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 63:13" />Tinggwang dai ga bam no, dui kecok gade penui de teu mpet kebeu be de? Hekwen hangdeu kam ga pak kela nzwa, penuide nrap dima.<verse eid="ISA 63:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 63:14" />Hetum langkam ga kehung nzwa, RAMPAUBE rabe penui de kemtak peu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:14">Cine, nang n minadung de teuswa, n katei n zi ketwa tei lu kerane.<verse eid="ISA 63:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 63:15" />RAMPAUBO, tinggim gade pie nghung nah n kemci nah kemdu kelungh ni gade cilu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:15">Dai ga n lungring teikeneu nah n ta kedi bam no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:15">N ngaugia tadung anui dade keu mzia dida.<verse eid="ISA 63:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 63:16" />Nang anui pei kecu ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:16">Abraham anui de cime lie de, nah Israel anuide cilu me lie de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:16">nang, RAMPAUBO, au anui pei. ‘Anuide Rikelube’ au ndaa de n zi delie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">63:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:41">Jhn. 8:41</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 63:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 63:17" />RAMPAUBO, daitei nang anuide peu n lampuidung gade tet mdeila no nah anui lung tei hungdi no, ciu eh anui n samzai tei lu ta di no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:17">N kilabedung zi gade cailigwang gai lo, n mapwame leuh ge.<verse eid="ISA 63:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 63:18" />N minadung n Kemci ni ting kedui na ge ziemne teula, dede anui ngauraume n kerecaki daudi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">63:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 21:24, Bat. 11:2</char></note><verse eid="ISA 63:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 63:19" />Anui au nang madaude mige reu kedi kemakmedung de nzwa dida, madau de n mina qu lu kemakme nzwa.”<verse eid="ISA 63:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="ISA 64" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 64:1" />“RAMPAUBO, magade nang Tinggimdung tei pang di eh gwang lie cai! Lamlwadung n dwa gade mbeu dizie,<verse eid="ISA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 64:2" />tsingkiak mi heu kegai dau nzwa eh, mede mi le dui helet lu kela nzwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:2">Nzi au n cu renia kelabe da de ci lu zie, heleuh be n dwa gade mbeu dizie!<verse eid="ISA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 64:3" />Pedwale, nang anui cet kemak be miswa kega ta tei kegai dau, nang nghung lu, nah lamlwadung n dwa gade mbeu di.<verse eid="ISA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 64:4" />Ndaa tingdau de migede Tinggwang nang kenzwa gede siu ma mede ci lu ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:4">nah migede nang rünne gwale keda Tinggwang de ngau ma, ncu pie kelame ziemne bata tei kelabe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">64:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 31:19, 1 Cor. 2:9</char></note><verse eid="ISA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 64:5" />Petaube ga renga kelame da nang gwang la, n lampuidung de nsung nah tei mzai kelame da.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:5">Anui kemau ketei dau nang n rata di. N lampuidung gade anui de keli beu la mui zie.<verse eid="ISA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 64:6" />Anui pelane nci kemakme ge nzwa kedi ziemne, nah anui ta kesamsangdung pelane pai neurie nzwa dida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:6">Anui pelane tsingneidung nzwa regui dida; anui maudung, tingkai nzwa, anui de gui pung dida.<verse eid="ISA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 64:7" />N zi qu kerame migede gah, ncu teugim nzeu lu kera lai kai keteime de gah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:7">Nang anui dade n zu hebai kedine nah anuide peu anui kemaudung ba gade ngkap dida.<verse eid="ISA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 64:8" />Ciude, RAMPAUBO, nang au anui pei;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:8">anui au lidei. Nang au li keteibe; nah anui pelane n bata lie.<verse eid="ISA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 64:9" />N rata ham di helo, RAMPAUBO, nah anui maudung de cet bam sap helo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:9">Keherei de anui pelane de pie lo, n minadung.<verse eid="ISA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 64:10" />N kemci namdidung au renaamkang nzwa bam dida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:10">Zion au renaamkang ge dida, Jerusalem au mta nrwa dida.<verse eid="ISA 64:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 64:11" />Anui gu kemci nah hezukeyi kerecaki, anui peime ncu ketwa de ga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:11">mi ne ngkap dida, nah hung süt kecu leune ngkap dida.<verse eid="ISA 64:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 64:12" />Nang dai nzwa cu de gim pwabam lu lai no, RAMPAUBO? Nang dainzwa nleimene anuide tei ngngam jüja bam laino?”<verse eid="ISA 64:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="ISA 65" />
  <para style="s">Tutiak nah Kelikelu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 65:1" />RAMPAUBE rangzeu, “Acu keteu kemak medungde Ih peu ngaulu kera mteiluda; Acu peei kemakme de peu acu peei lu kera Ih mteiluda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:1">Ih ranggai, ‘Ih aika bam! Ih aika bam!’ A zi qu kemak heleuh be dage.<verse eid="ISA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 65:2" />Ih a minadung de ngngwalu kera mteipwa bam muila, penui helung tak eh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:2">yi kemak lampui ga tet kelame, penui katei penui kecetdung nah mariemdung ga tet kelame!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:20">Rom. 10:20</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 10:21">21</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 65:3" />Penui au a kemei tei bammui kelame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:3">heguriedung ga ratakdung reca gai, nah tangtsu kwakdung gage perim kehengui ru gai.<verse eid="ISA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 65:4" />Penui heraudung kakga bamla nah tingmui kwabam cangla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:4">nah penui gilidung ga heteih keherabe le gidui tei lu eh hebak teih tyei.<verse eid="ISA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 65:5" />Pecai penui kedame dade rang, ‘Sap mdei di, a taiga gwang mna so, kedanemene Ih nnui swa mci ki lu.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:5">Aidungde a ziemne a ngkie ga mika ge, petingnai ru bam kela mi ge.<verse eid="ISA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 65:6" />RAMPAUBE rangzeu, “Pielo, aide a ziemne rau pwabam:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:6">Ih zing de bam dilak, kedanemene Ih penuide saja peu zie; Ih penuide saja peu zie,<verse eid="ISA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 65:7" />penui maudung nah penui peime maudung ncüt eh,” RAMPAUBE ranggai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">“Penui lamlwatudung ga perim kehengui ru kegai ziemne nah kideutudung gade a ha rang msia kecu ziemne Ih penuide saja peu zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">Ih cine penui tei kedi tahdung de mdet lu eh penuide peu zie.”<verse eid="ISA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 65:8" />Aide RAMPAUBE rangla, “Kubetsidung gade petsi dui ngau keludau,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:8">mige rangla, ‘Cide tei msia diso, kedanemene cika makeyi bamlu,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:8">aide Ih a kila be ziemne teigai zie: Ih cidungde tei msia ciak dilak.<verse eid="ISA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 65:9" />Ih Jacob dade heleuhdung tei gai zie, nah Judah leuhme a lamlwatudung gum luzie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:9">Ih kedet kelume ne hangdeu gum luzie, nah a kilamedung cika lungh luzie.<verse eid="ISA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 65:10" />Meuründung ziemne Sharon tsehei deu dizie nah Achor langkam kauhaudung ziemne kemtak ni ge zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:10">acu peei kela a minadung ziemne.<verse eid="ISA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 65:11" />Dede nnui RAMPAUBE de mlai kedime, a kemci lamlwatu de nsungta kedime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:11">mabam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">65:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mabam: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gad</char></note> ziemne taktyeibam ge mteiteu kelame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:11">nah riem pwa kela de ziemne zau hai ncüt kelade zau piak gage kai pui kelame.<verse eid="ISA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 65:12" />Ih ncu kingtie peu kera mtei luzie, nah nnui pelane tsai kera keumie luzie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">kedanemene Ih qu kegai dau, nnui a sam keli ma; Ih marang kecu dau, nnui kingnei ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">Dede a miakngau gade petau kemak be nnui tei nah Ih ngkau keladung nnui tei kera kedetlu.”<verse eid="ISA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 65:13" />Aide RAMPAUBE rangla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">“Pielo, a kilamedung matyei zie, dede nnui au mzeu zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">pielo, a kilamedung sak zie, dede nnui au hereu zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">pielo, a kilamedung penui sui yizie, dede nnui de tei ngngam dizie.<verse eid="ISA 65:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 65:14" />Pielo, a kilamedung penui lung suiyi de ziemne suiyi kwa sah zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:14">dede nnui au nnui mlung keteei de ziemne nnui hap zie, nah rabe kap kebam de ziemne nnui hei zie.<verse eid="ISA 65:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 65:15" />A kedet kelume ziemne nnui cai kai nzeu kegai nnui zi de au reset ge eh cide teu eh marang zie; Ih, RAMPAUBE, nnuide teitset zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:15">Ih a kilamedung de hezi keda ge le qu zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">65:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zec. 8:13, Keu. 2:17, 3:12</char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 65:16" />Kideu ga samlam kie kegai keheibe de a dade samlam ngau luzie, kesamsang Tinggwang.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">Keheibede kideu gade samkak kelume a dade sampet zie, kesamsang Tinggwang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">kedanemene nda reidung de nsungta dizie, kedanemene cidungde a miak gade hebai dizie lu.<verse eid="ISA 65:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 65:17" />Kedanemene pielo, Ih tinggimdung keheci nah kideu keheci ge teigai lai eh bam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:17">nah teigwang kedidung de de nsung dailak mede milung ga gwang dailak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">65:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pet. 3:13, Keu. 21:1,4</char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 65:18" />Dede Ih dam gai lai eh kebam gade nnui renga zie nah kelungta nnui sui yizie. Pielo, Ih dam gai lai eh kebam Jerusalem de suiyi ge zie, nah pe minadung suiyi ge zie.<verse eid="ISA 65:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 65:19" />Ih Jerusalem reu renga zie nah a minadung ziemne a sui yizie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:19">cika keherei ziemne hei eh hap kecu peda siu si lakta.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">65:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 21:4</char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 65:20" />Cika ngiena ge tingkak nage rünne lungh kecu tei si dai lakta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">mede kecingme ge peting cang mene tsai dai lakta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">Mige mmi hai ge lungh lu eh tsai kedime ge de hena au reu lie zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">Keheibe de mmi hai ge lungh hang canglu kemakme de au reset pung lie de zie.<verse eid="ISA 65:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 65:21" />A minadung hekidung tei zie nah cika lungh zie, nah penui kubeluh tei zie nah pe tsi tyei zie.<verse eid="ISA 65:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 65:22" />Penui heki ge teilu eh mi kedame ge de peu cika lungh kecu tei si lakta; penui linggai lak, nah mi kedame ge tyei;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:22">kedanemene tsingbangdung gu tingbaziedung de a minadung gu tingbaziedung zie. Penui penui bata tei kelude ziemne kehega luzie.<verse eid="ISA 65:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 65:23" />Penui kemta gage matei dilak, nah suisiet de nna lak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:23">Kedanemene penui au RAMPAUBE ne samlam beu pwa kebam namedung kecune, nah penuide de si eh penui leuhmedung de. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">65:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 115:14-15</char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 65:24" />Penui qu kemakne, Ih penuide keli gai zie; nah penui rang kebam tingdau, Ih siu luzie.<verse eid="ISA 65:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 65:25" />Heneu nah meurün ngngwa matyei zie, nah hingho hetumseu nzwa reigau tyei zie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:25">dede henei taktyei au rebui zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:25">Penui mide tei rezam ta dizie nah a kemci lamlwatu de ngkap dilak,” RAMPAUBE rangla.<verse eid="ISA 65:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="ISA 66" />
  <para style="s">Tutiak nah Keregui</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 66:1" />RAMPAUBE ainzwa ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:1">“Tinggim au a hegwangbam, nah kideu au a pidau bam. Ciu eh nnui daiga ge a ki teibeu laino? Ih mtak kera ni de daiga no?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">66:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat. 7:48-50, Mat. 5:34-35</char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 66:2" />Ma aidungde a ba ne teilu; aidung de ainzwa teigwang lu, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:2">Ih ne petau delie kecu mina aide da, rabe lambie mnei nah lungrei kelame, nah a sam de hing eh mbeu kelame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">66:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 34:18, Mat. 5:3</char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 66:3" />Mige hetumseu ge de gitset kelame mina de liede daptset la; mige meurünna ge teu ratak teikelame heteu ngwang de teicum dila;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">mige meibui reca pwapeu kelame hebak jai peu la; mige kensungbam kehengui rim ge pwapeu kelame kesiame de liede samlam beula.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">Penuikatei penui lampuidung kedet luda, nah penui mide ngaungkau kecu penui suila.<verse eid="ISA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 66:4" />Cide siakte penuikatei penui gu saja Ih ne kedet zie; penui hing kela de Ih penui da teugwang zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">kedanemene Ih qu kegai dau, migede keli beu ma; Ih rang kegai dau, migede kingnei ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Penui a miakngau gade kesiabe tei di, nah a suiyi la kemakpe kedet dila.”<verse eid="ISA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 66:5" />RAMPAUBE sam de kingneilu, nnui pe sam de hing kelame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">“N siname a zi ziemne ncu ngau nghet nah masipei la kemakme ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">‘RAMPAUBE de peu kendube tei lulo, ciu eh anui n suiyi ngau zie,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">dede penui de hengam gage kai dizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">66:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Thes. 1:12</char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 66:6" />Maadi keregi kwa ge namdi gade gwang, kerecaki gade makwa ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:6">RAMPAUBE pe ngauraume de hekum peei kecu kwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:1">Keu. 16:1</ref>,<ref loc="REV 16:17">17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 66:7" />A kemci namdi de mipui ge, pe mna tetteei mene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:7">zette pe na mnakelu nzwa lie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">66:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 12:2,5</char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 66:8" />Cau aikenzwa ge siu no? Cau aikenzwa dung ngau no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Hangdeu ge tingnaige gage nna lubui ni? Heleuh ge tingkak nage gage tei ncuh lubui ni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Ciuliede Zion kenna tetteei teicuh herizi, pa pe name de nna beula. <verse eid="ISA 66:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 66:9" />Ih ngiena mna kera ngkei gaibeu nah hena cide depeu mna lakni?, RAMPAUBE keteu.<verse eid="ISA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 66:10" />Jerusalem de ngngwa suiyi lu nah pe ziemne nnui suiyi lu, nnui pelane pecu keku me;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:10">pecu ngngwa suiyi lu, nnui pelane pe ziemne hap kelame!<verse eid="ISA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 66:11" />Kedanemene nnui ngkwet zie nah mnung luzie; pe tung dungne ncu teirelui beuzie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:11">kedanemene nnui cide sak pui luzie nah pe kendu ne nnui suiyi kepui tei zie.<verse eid="ISA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 66:12" />RAMPAUBE ainzwa ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">“Ih pe da hereukidung nzwa lungh keyi mzi gai lai eh bam dida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">nah heleuhdung mabam reuceunadung pui eh lwakebam nzwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">Pe lambie gade ncu ngkwet zie, pe badung ne pwa zie, nah pe ngkokpuidung ga kelui zie.<verse eid="ISA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 66:13" />Mipui ge pe na de teirelui beu kelanzwa, ciu eh Ih ncu teirelui beuzie, nah nang Jerusalem ga relui bam luzie.”<verse eid="ISA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 66:14" />Nang aide ngau zie, nah n mlung suiyi luzie, nah cehei kehenabe nzwa n radung pwakcuh zie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:14">Pe kilame dage RAMPAUBE ba de peu ci zie, dede pa pe ngauraume dage pe rata keulia zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:22">Jhn. 16:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 66:15" />Cine pielo, RAMPAUBE au mi teu eh gwangla, nah pe bagidung au heratingkai nzwa gwangla</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:15">pe rata cui de keugwang kera nah pe rata de miheu cui le keugwang lu kera.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:8">2 The. 1:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 66:16" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE minadung de mi le saja peula nah pe kingtie le. RAMPAUBE ne teitset kedime kekieege zie.<verse eid="ISA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 66:17" />RAMPAUBE rangzeu, “Nlumkemakme reca ziemne penuikatei penuide tei ntsam lu nah penuikatei penuide tei mcilu, ciu eh penui guriedung ga nlüt lu kerane, sumbe ga kelabe caisui eh caugame</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:17">hebak teih tyei labi nah heza nzwa mcikemakpe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:17">“Penui kekam ga gwang dizie, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai.<verse eid="ISA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 66:18" />Kedanemene Ih penui tadung nah penui kecetdung cibam. Ih heleuhdung nah heletdung keu hekwa kera ting gwang mna la dida. Penui gwang zie nah a kendu ngau zie. <verse eid="ISA 66:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 66:19" />Ih penui kakga marehi ge teigai zie. Ciu eh Ih heleuhdung dage bangkelume de langgai beu zie: Tarshish namdi, Put deudi, nah Lud deudi dage, lakpi pwa kecume, Tubal deudi, Javan nah kemdei jaaidikung deudung ga penui a ha siu kemakme mede a kendu ngau kemakme dage. Penui heleuhdung kakgade a kendu rang zie. <verse eid="ISA 66:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 66:20" />Penui heleuhdung leune gade n siname pelane de ngngwa cailigwang beu zie, RAMPAUBE de reca peu kecu nzwa. Penui hekwendung gade gwang zie, nah bagidung gade, mania kepung garidung gade, gadanadung gade, nah utdung gade, a kemci lamlwa Jerusalem ga, RAMPAUBE ne ranggai. Kedanemene Israel minadung hekwak kenci gage meibui reca RAMPAUBE kiga pwa gwang zie.<verse eid="ISA 66:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 66:21" />Aidung kesa gade cingkudung nah Levime liede Ih kedet zie, RAMPAUBE ne ranggai.<verse eid="ISA 66:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 66:22" />Kedanemene tinggimdung keheci nah hangdeu keheci Ih teigai kera de</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:22">cide a dwa ga bamlu kera nzwa, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndugai, ciu eh n leuhme bamlu zie, nah n zi bamlu zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">66:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Pet. 3:13, Keu. 21:1</char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 66:23" />Kei ge cia kei ge, nah Sabbath ge gade peciabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:23">mina leune keu mie a da gwang zie, RAMPAUBE ne ranggai.<verse eid="ISA 66:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 66:24" />Penui tet pet zie nah acu regi eh renia kela minadung gu ketsai paaudung ngau zie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:24">kedanemene penuide tyei kelu tangseudung tsai lak, nah penuide ngkap kedi mi de tei mmütti lak;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:24">nah pumteih leune ziemne cide kengkau ge zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:48">Mrk. 9:48</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 66" />
</usx>